<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">-</book>
  <para style="h">Misebezi ya Baapositola</para>
  <para style="toc2">Misebezi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Misebezi ya Baapositola</para>
  <para style="mt1">Misebezi</para>
  <para style="mt2">ya Baapositola</para>
  <para style="imt">Bupanduluzi</para>
  <para style="ip">Bbuku lye Misebezi ya Baapositola liindilizya Malembo aa Makani Mabotu aakalembwa o Luka. Muzeezo walyo mupati ngokutondezya basikwiiya ba Jesu bokusaanguna mbubakeendelezegwa o Muuya Uusalala mukukambooka Makani Mabotu aa Jesu “mu Jelusalemu, mu Judiya yoonse ape omu Samaliya mane kumamanino enyika.” (1.8). Lilungulula bweende bo Bukombi bwe Cikilisitu mbubwakatalika akati ka Majuda okuzumanana mane lwaba lusyomo lwe nyika yoonse. Ape mulembi wakayandisya kutondezya baswiilizi kuteeti bana Kilisitu taakwe nibali kabunga kotunzanyu kalwana buleli bwe Ciloma ape okuteeti lusyomo lwecina Kilisitu calikuzuzikizya Bukombi bwe Cijuda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bbuku lye Misebezi ya Baapositola inga lyaanzaanisigwa muzipaanzi zyotatwe, kutondezya cibaka mbocikwazamukide Makani Mabotu aa Jesu kwaakakambookwa embungano mbuyakatalisigwa: (1) Matalikilo obweende bo Bukombi bwe Cikilisitu mu Jelusalemu kuzwa Jesu nakainka kujulu; (2) Kuyandilila kuya muzibaka zimwi zyoku Palasitaini; (3) Kuzumanana kuyandilila kuya munyika yoku Meditileniya okuyoosika ku Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Cintu cipati loko mubbuku lye Misebezi ya Baapositola, micito yo Muuya Uusalala wakeza enguzu kubasyomi mu Jelusalemu mubuzuba bwe Pentekositi okuzumanana kweendelezya okuyumya-yumya mbungano abeendelezi bayo mulizyoonse zyakacitika zilembedwe mubbuku. Bukamboosi bwe Cikilisitu bokusaanguna bulafwiinsigwa munkambooko ziindene-indeni, ezyakacitika zilembedwe mubbuku lye Misebezi ya Baapositola zitondezya nguzu zyobukamboosi oobu mumaumi abasyomi omukubungana kwembungano.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mundandaanda wezili Mwateni</para>
  <para style="io1">Kulibambila bumboni <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Jesu wapa malailile ecisyomezyo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Wakabweza cibaka ca Judasi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bumboni mu Jelusalemu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bumboni mu Judiya omu Samaliya <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bukamboosi bwa Paulu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Musinzo wokusaanguna wobukamboosi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Muswaangano mu Jelusalemu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Musinzo wabili wobukamboosi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Musinzo watatu wobukamboosi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:16">18:23—21:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Paulu mwaange mu Jelusalemu, omu Sizeliya omu Loma <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Cisyomezyo co Muuya Uusalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luka 1:1-4</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ooyandwa Tiyofilasi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mubbuku lyangu lyokusaanguna ndakalemba azintu zyoonse Jesu zyaakatalikila kucita okwiisya, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mane kusikila buzuba mbwaakatolwa kujulu. Kono katana kutolwa kujulu, wakapa malailile kwiinda munguzu zyo Muuya Uusalala kubaalumi mbaakasala kuba baapositola bakwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kwamazuba aali makumi one kuzwaciindi naakafwa, wakalibonya kweziindi zinji kubaapositola ape wakabatondezya munzila zisiyene-siyene kuteeti nconzyo muumi. Bakamubona ape wakaamboolaabo zyo Bwami bwa Leza. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luka 24:49</ref>.</char></note> Iino nibakabungana antoomwi, wakabapa aaya malailila okuteeti, “Mutazwi mu Jelusalemu, kono mulindile cipego co Muuya Uusalala cindakamwaambila, eeco caakasyomezya Tata. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mateyo 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Maako 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luka 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Joni 1:33</ref>.</char></note> Mbuli mbomuzi, Joni walikubbabbatizya amaanzi, kono kwainda mazuba maniini feela, muzoobbabbatizigwa o Muuya Uusalala.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Watolwa Kujulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Mpoonyina baapositola nibabungene antoomwi o Jesu bakamubuzya kuteeti, “Mwami! Ino nako yako yokubukulusya Bwami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwiindila mubusinsimi bomu Cizuminano Ceciindi, bana Izilaili balikuyeeyela Mesiya kutalika bwami bomunyika mpoonyina we kali mwami wateni, mboonyina mbuli bulelo bwa mwami weciindi Deveti. Kono obubusinsimi bwalikwaamba azooza lwabili Jesu. </char></note> kuli Izilaili yasika na?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabataba kuteeti, “Tamuzumizidwe kuziba ziindi Tata zyabikide kwiindila munguzu zyakwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mateyo 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Maako 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luka 24:47-48</ref>.</char></note> Kono Muuya Uusalala waakuza alindinywe, muzootambula nguzu zyokuba bakamboni bangu mu Jelusalemu, mu Judiya yoonse ape omu Samaliya mane kumamanino enyika.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Maako 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luka 24:50-51</ref>.</char></note> Naakamana kwaamba namu, kabamulangilide wakatolwa mujulu mpoonyina joba lyakamuvumba mane waleka kulibonya. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesu's ascension" file="gt00105.tif" size="col" ref="1:9">Jesu Watolwa Kujulu</figure><verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Kabacidongomwene kujulu naalikwiinka, mpoonyinaawo kwakalibonya baalumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aaba “baalumi” balibangelo. Iino aaba bangelo kubagama balikuboneka mbuli baalumi.</char></note> bobile bazweete zizwato zituba kabaimvwi kumbali lyabo <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />okwaamba kuteeti, “Nobaalumi bomu Galileya! Ino niinzi nemwiimvwaawa kamulangide kujulu? Ooyu Jesu watolwa kujulu kuzwa kulindinywe uyoopiluka mboonyina mbumwamubona kaya kujulu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakatola Cibaka ca Judasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Mpoonyina baapositola bakapiluka ku Jelusalemu kuzwa ku Cilundu ca Oliva kasinzo kafwiifwi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki, “musinzo womunsabata.” Wali musinzo milawo ya Majuda nguyali kuzumizya bantu kweenda mu Nsabata, buzuba bwe Cijuda bokupumuna.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mateyo 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Maako 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luka 6:14-16</ref>.</char></note> Nibakasika mu taindi, bakanjila mungʼanda yomujulu oomo mubali kukala. Baliwo ngu Pita, Joni, Jemusi o Andulu, Filipo o Tomasi, Batolomeyo o Mateyo, Jemusi mwanaa Alufeyasi, Saimoni walikwiitwa kuteeti Sikulwanina Lwaanguluko, o Judasi mwanaa Jemusi. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bakalipa mukukomba antoomwi camoyo omwi abanakazi bamwi, o Maliya banyina Jesu kubikilzya abazyalwanyinaa Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mumazuba aayo, kwakaba muswangaano wabasyomi balikutandila kusika ku mwaanda amakumi obile. Mpoonyina Pita wakanyamuka okutalika kwaamboola kateeti, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Nobazyalwama, alikweelede kuzuzikizigwa aayo Malembo akaambwa kujatikizya Judasi, ooyo wakasolwedela bantu bakaakujata Jesu. Eeci cakaambwa ciindi loko o Muuya Uusalala kwiindila mu Mwami Deveti. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Judasi waluumwi wesu kaambo walisalidwe kuteeti awe ajane cibaka mumusebezi wesu ooyu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mateyo 27:3-8</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iino Judasi wakaula muunda amali ngaakajana mukucita cibi, oomo mwaakawida ansi cokutozya mutwe, okwaanduka da mpoonyina zyomwida lyakwe zyakawayukilaanze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Bantu boonse bomu Jelusalemu bakalumvwa lufu lwakwe, mane mumusyobo wabo cibaka eeco bakacuuzika kuteeti Akeludama, caamba kuteeti, “Muunda we Gazi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:25">Intembauzyo 69:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109:8</ref>.</char>
    </note> Pita wakazwidaanembo kateeti, “Eeci caakalemba Deveti mubbuku lye Ntembauzyo kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Ngʼanda yakwe libe tongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">kutakabi muntu naanga omwi uyookala mwateni.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Ape cililembedwe kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Amuleke muntu umbi acibweze cibaka cakwe comusebezi.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21-22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mateyo 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Maako 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Maako 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Luka 24:51</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Iino kokuteeti atusale mwaalumi umwi abweze cibaka ca Judasi. Ooyo uutisalwe kali umwi waabo baalumi balikujanika aswibo nako yoonse njaalikupona andiswe Jesu, kuzwa nako njaakabbabbatizigwa kuli Joni mane kusikila buya buzuba mbwaakanyamunwa kuzwa kulindiswe kutolwa kujulu. Ooyu mwaalumi weelede kuba kamboni wokubuka kwa Jesu antoomwi aswibo.”<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Kumane, bakadoma baalumi bobile. Umwi wali Josefa walikwiitwa kuteeti Bbasabbasi ape walikwiitwa kuteeti Jusitasi. Umwi wali Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Mpoonyina bakakomba kabateeti, “O Mwami! Uliizi myoyo yabantu boonse, iino tutondezye nguwasala akati kaaba bobile, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kuteegwa abweze musebezi o bwaapositola Judasi mbwaakasiya, naakainka kucibaka cimweelede.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bamane, bakabaumina cisolo, eeco cakawida Matiyasi. Mpoonyina wakayungizigwa kubaapositola bali kumi awomwi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuza Ko Muuya Uusalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Levitiko 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Detilonomo 16:9-11</ref>.</char>
    </note> Buzuba bwa Pentekositi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pentekositi caamba Mukiti wa Majuda wama Nsondo (Kulonga 34:22), ape walikwiitwa kuteeti Mukiti Wokukutula (Kulonga 23:16). Majuda banji balikuzaanga ku Jelusalemu mwaka omwaka kusekelela mukiti ooyu. Bbala lya Pentekositi kuligama lyaamba “makumi osanwe,” kaambo ooyu mukiti walikucitikaanga kwainda mazuba aali makumi osanwe kuzwa Mukiti we Pasika. Oobu buzuba, mbuzuba bwe Pentekositi ape lyakaba zina lye Cikilisitu lye zyakacitika mu 2:2-13.</char></note> nibwakasika basyomi boonse babungene mucibaka comwi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Mpoonya-mpoonya kujulu kwakamvwika kuvuuma mbuli guwo pati, kwakazuzya cibaka coonse cibakakede mwateni. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Mpoonyina bakabona zyalikulibonyaanga malimi emililo aayo akazoosabalangana okukala aluumwi oumwi wabo.<figure style="fig" alt="Tongues of Fire at Pentecost" file="wa03939b.tif" size="col" ref="2:3">Malimi ee Mililo Mubuzuba bwe Pentekositi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Kumane, boonse bakazula o Muuya Uusalala, okutalika kwamboola mumisyobo iisiyene-siyene kweendelana o Muuya Uusalala mbuwakabazumizya.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Aleeyo nako, kwakali Majuda balikukomba Leza balikuzwa muzisi zisiyene-siyene nyika yoonse mbwiizulwa bakali kukala mu Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Nibakamvwa coongo eeci, bbunga pati lyabantu lyakabungana. Bakalyangana okukomokwa kaambo bakamvwa umwi oumwi wabasikwiiya ba Jesu kaamboola mumusyobo waumwi oumwi waabo babungene. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Kabakomokedwe loko bakateeti, “Amulange! Tiinsi boonse aaba baamboola mbana Galilelya na? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ino cilibuti kuteeti toonse tulibamvwide kabaamboola mumusyobo woumwi oumwi wesu? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Aano tuliboku Patiya, Midiya oku Elamu, ku Mesopotamiya, Judiya, Kapadosiya, oku Pontasi ape oku Eziya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />oku Filigiya oku Pamfiliya, mane ku Ijipiti kuyoosika omu zilalaanda zya Libbiya afwiifwi o Sailini. Mane tobamwi tuzwa ku Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />boonse Majuda a Bamasi bakasandulwa kweetwa mubukombi bwe Cijuda, ape tobamwi tuzwa ku Kileti oku Alebbiya, kono toonse tulibamvwide kabaamboola mumisyobo yesu kujatikizya zintu zipati zyaacita Leza.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Boonse kabakomokedwe okulyangana, bakazumanana kubuzyanya kuteeti, “Ino eeci caamba nzi?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Kono bamwi mubbunga bakafubaazika basyomi kabateeti, “Aaba bantu balikoledwe!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Wakambooka Apentekositi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Mpoonyina Pita antoomwi abaapositola bali kumi aomwi bakanyamuka. Amane Pita wakatalika kwaamboola kubbunga ataleejwi lyakwe kateeti, “No Majuda ma, andinywe noonse nomukala mu Jelusalemu, amundiswiilizye ndimupandulwide cecaambeeci. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Aaba bantu tabakoledwe mbuli mbomuyeeya. Ino inga bakolwa buti kucili kuseni? Iino ninako yewoola lyefuka. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Kono eeci cemubwene cecico cakaambwa omusinsimi Joweli,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Joeli 2:28-32</ref>.</char>
    </note> Leza wakateeti, ‘Kumazuba aamamanino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ndiyootila Muuya wangu kubantu boonse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Mpoonyina bana benu basyimani abasimbi bayoosinsima.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Bakubusyi bayoobona zilengaano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">abo madaala bayoolota ziloto.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Mumazuba aayo, ndiyootila Muuya wangu okubabelesi bangu boonse baalumi abanakazi, mpoonyina bayoosinsima.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ndiyoocita zikomosya kujulu ezitondezyo zyamaleele aano ansi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Kunooli gazi, mulilo a mayoba oobusi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Izuba liyoosiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">awo mweezi uyoosalala mbuli gazi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Ziyoocitika buzuba bo Mwami bupati ape bobulemu kabutanaza.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Mpoonyina kufumbwa wiita Mwami kuteegwa amugwasye uyoofutulwa.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Mpoonyina Pita wakazumanana kateeti, “Nobana Izilaili amuswiilizye majwaaya! Jesu woku Nazaleta, wali mwaalumi Leza ngwaakatuma kulindinywe. Eeci Leza wakacitondezya mumisebezi mipati, maleele ape ezitondezyo zyaakacita kwiindila muli Jesu. Nywebo lwenu mulizizi eezi kaambo zyakacitikila akati kenu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mateyo 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Maako 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luka 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Joni 19:18</ref>.</char></note> Ooyu Jesu wakaabwa kono Leza walizi kuteeti eeci ciyoocitika kaambo walizikanzide kale ciindi. Mwakamujaya kwiindila mukuzumizya baalumi basizibi kuteeti bamukankamine aciingano. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5-6">Mateyo 28:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Maako 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luka 24:5</ref>.</char></note> Kono Leza wakamubusya kuzwa kulufu, wakamulukulula kuzwa mukucisa kolufu kaambo taakwe nicalikukonzeka kuteeti abe mwaange wolufu. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Intembauzyo 16:8-11</ref>.</char></note> Tulicizi eeci kuteeti cenconzyo kaambo Deveti wakaamba fateni aalinguwe kateeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Ndakabona Mwami kali kunembo lyangu nako yoonse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Kaambo kokuteeti ulaafwiifwi amebo tandiyoopenzegwi.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Kaambo keeci moyo wangu uliboteledwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">amajwaangu ngokusekelela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Nekuteegwa mubube bwangu ndilimuntu feela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">kono ndinookede okulangila,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kaambo toyoondilekelezyi munyika yabafu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Ape toyoocizumizyi kuteeti Uusalala wako akabole mucuumbwe.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wanditondezya nzila zitola kubuumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ape uyoondibotezya loko nako njonoolaandime.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Pita wakazwidaanembo okuteeti, “Nobazyalwama, ndiyanda kuteeti mumvwisisisye! Deveti sikale wesu taakwe naalikulyaamba lwakwe naakaamba aaya majwi ngindaamba, kaambo wakafwa okuzikwa, ecuumbwe cakwe kocili akati kesu kusikila sunu. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Intembauzyo 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Samuele 7:12-13</ref>.</char></note> Kono wali musinsimi, ape walizi kuteegwa Leza wakasyomezya okukonka kuteeti umwi wolunyungu lwa Deveti uyookala acibbula cobwami bwa Deveti. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Deveti wakazibona zintu Leza zyaalikuyanda kucita kunembo, mpoonyina wakaamba kujatikizya kubuka kwa Mesiya kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Taakwe naakalekelezegwa munyika yabafu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">naanga mubili wakwe kubola.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Leza wakabusya ooyu Jesu kuzwa kubafu ape toonse tulibakamboni beeci. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Mpoonyina Leza wakamusumpula ejanza lyakwe lyolulyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Busanduluzi bunji bwaamba kuteeti, “kujanza lyolulyo lwa Leza”. Kono twakasala busanduluzi bwaamba kuteeti “Ejanza lya Leza lyolulyo” kaambo Mucizuminano Ceciindi cilaambidwe ziindi zinji. Ape aaka kancali mu Cigiliki taakwe pokaamba kuteeti “kujanza lyolulyo” mu Cizuminano Cipya.</char></note> Mpoonyina Leza Isi wakamupa Muuya Uusalala mbuli mbwaakasyomezya. Iino Jesu watila ooyu Muuya Uusalala alindiswe mbuli mbomubona okumvwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Intembauzyo 110:1</ref>.</char></note> Ede Deveti taakwe naakainka kujulu, kono we lwakwe wakateeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Mwami wakaambila Mwami wangu kuteeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">kala kubbazu lyolulyo lwangu lyobulemu <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />kusikila mane ndibike basinkondonyoko kunsi ezituta zyako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Citondezya kuteeti Leza uzoozunda basikondonyina bo Mwami wa Deveti mpoonyina banoendelezegwa ooyo muntu.</char></note>.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Mpoonyina mukumanizya Pita wakateeti, “Iino kaambo keeci, nobana Izilaili noonse muzibe nconzyo kuteeti ooyu Jesu ngubakakankamina aciingano ngonguwe Leza ngwaakabika kuteeti abe Mwami ape ngo Mesiya!”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Iino bantu nibakamvwa namu, bakayaswa mumyoyo yabo, mpoonyina bakabuzya Pita abamwi maapositolanyina kuteeti, “Nobazyalwama, ino tucite buti?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Pita wakateeti, “Umwi oumwi eempwe kuzibi zyakwe okubbabbatizigwa muzina lya Jesu Mesiya kuteeti zibi zyeenu zijatilwe. Kuzwaawo mulatambula Muuya Uusalala, cipego cizwa kuli Leza. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Amucite namu kaambo eeci cisyomezyo cicenu abana benu, aabo balikule boonse. Nconzyo cisyomezyo ca boonse mbaita kulinguwe Mwami Leza wesu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Mpoonyina Pita wakazwidaanembo kukambooka okukombelezya bantu kateeti, “Amulifutule lwenu kuzwa kucisubulo ciza alaaba bantu basimucitazibi!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Mpoonyina aabo bakasyoma zyakaamba Pita bakabbabbatizigwa. Mubuzuba oobo bakayungizigwa kumbungano batikasike zyuulu zyotatwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Basyomi boonse bakalyaaba kuziisyo zyabaapositola okukuswaanana okukulya mulalilo ape okukukomba.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buponi Bwa Basyomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Mpoonyina Leza wakacita zikomosya ezitondezyo zyamaleele zinji kwiindila mubaapositola, mane bantu boonse bakayoowa okukomokwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Misebezi 4:32-35</ref>.</char></note> Basyomi boonse bakazumanana kubungana antoomwi mucibaka comwi okwaabana zyoonse zibakajesi. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bakauzya lubono lwabo okwaabana mali abasyomi batalikwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Buzuba o buzuba balikuswaangana okukomba antoomwi mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza. Ape balikuswaangana omumaanda aabo okwaabana zilyo zyabo kababoteledwe okulibombya mumyoyo yabo, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />kumwi kabalumbaizya Leza okubotezya bantu boonse. Ape buzuba o buzuba Mwami walikuyungizizya kumbunga yabo aabo balikufutulwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Pita Waponya Mwaalumi Cihole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Bumwi buzuba Pita o Joni bakainka kulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza musikati anako yawoola yatatu yokukomba. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Iino kumanjililo eelabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza aalikwiitwa kuteeti, “Manjililo Mabotu,” kwali mwaalumi wali cihole kuzwa kubwana walikutolwaanga fateni buzuba obuzuba kuteegwa akaakukumbilile kubantu balikunjila mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Naakabona Pita o Joni kabayanda kunjila mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza, wakabakumbila mali. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Bo bakamulangisisya, mpoonyina Pita wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Tulange!” <figure style="fig" alt="Peter, John and the lame man" file="wa03941b.tif" size="col" ref="3:4">Pita Waponya Cihole</figure> <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Wakabalanga, kayeeya kuteeti mweendi balamupa kwateni cimwi cintu. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kono Pita wakateeti, “Mali tandikwe, kono ndilakupa cendijesi. Muzina lya Jesu Kilisitu woku Nazaleta, nyamuka weende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Mpoonyina wakamujata kujanza lyakwe lyokululyo okumugwasya kunyamuka. Mpoonya-mpoonya maulu engongoozi zyakwe zyakabeenguzu. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kuzwaawo wakasotoka okwiima okutalika kweendeenda. Kumane wakanjilaabo mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza kayoobweenda okusotooka okukalumbaizya Leza. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Bantu boonse bakamubona kayoobweenda okuyoobulumbaizya Leza. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Nibakamuziba kuteeti ngonguwe sikukumbilila walikujanikaanga Amanjililo Mabotu, boonse bakakomokwa loko alizyakamucitikila.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bukamboosi Bwa Pita Mukotela lya Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Iino mwaalumi kacijatilide Pita o Joni, bantu boonse kabakomokedwe bakazuzila kulimbabo antoomwi ku cibaka ce nganda calikwiitwa kuteeti kotela lya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Kono Pita naakabona namu wakaambila bantu kuteeti, “Nobana ba Izilaili, ino niinzi cikomosyaawa? Ino niinzi nemutulangisisya namu mbuli kuteeti ninguzu okululama kwesu zyapa kuteeti ooyu mwaalumi eende? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kulonga 3:15</ref>.</char></note> Leza wa Abbulahamu, Isaka, o Jakobo, Leza wabasikale besu wakeeta bulemu kumubelesi wakwe Jesu kwiinda mukucita zili namu. Jesu ngumwakaaba okukaka mumeenso a Pilato, nekuba kuteeti Pilato watikamulukulule.” <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mateyo 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Maako 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luka 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Joni 19:12-15</ref>.</char></note> Kono nywebo mwakamukaka, Uusalala, Mululami, okukumbila kuteeti mulukulwidwe mujayi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mwakajaya Jesu, cisiko cobuumi kono Leza wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu. Tulibakamboni kuleezi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kwiindila mukusyoma muzina lya Jesu, ooyu mwaalumi ngomubwene ape ngomuzi waponisigwa. Kusyoma muzina lya Jesu kukwamupa kupona mbuli mbomubwene noonse.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Iino nobazyalwama, ndilizi kuteeti nywebo abasololi benu zyomwakacita kuli Jesu, mwakazicita mukutaziba. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Kono Leza wazuzikizya zyaakaamba ciindi kwiindila mubasinsimi boonse kuteeti Mesiya weelede kupenga namu. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Iino amweempe, okusandukila kuli Leza, kuteegwa zibi zyenu zigwisigwe, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />kuteegwa ziindi zyokulemunukwa mumuuya zize kuzwa ku Mwami, ape uyootuma Jesu Mesiya ngumwakasalilwa kale. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ooyo weelede kukala kujulu kusikila nako zintu zyoonse zikabambululwe bupya, mboonyina Leza mbwaakasyomezya kwiindila mubasinsimi bakwe beeciindi basalala. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mozesi wakateeti, ‘Mwami Leza wenu uyoosala umwi akati kenu, kuba musinsimi mboonyina mbuli ndime. Mpoonyina mweelede kuteeti muzoomumvwide zyoonse zyatizoomwaambile.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ape Mozesi wakateeti, ‘Kufumbwa utayoomumvwidi ooyo musinsimi, uyoogwisigwa kubantu ba Leza okusinyoonwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Ape basinsimi boonse kutalikila kuli Samiyeli bakaamba kwateni alizilimukucitika mumazuba eesunu. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ndinywe mutambula zyaakasyomezya Leza kwiindila mubasinsimi ecizuminano caakapanga abasikale benu naakaambila Abbulahamu kuteeti, ‘Kwiindila mulibolunyungu lwako, ndiyooleleka bantu boonse munyika.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Mpoonyina Leza wakasala mubelesi wakwe Jesu okutalikila kumutuma kulindinywe nobana Izilaili kuteegwa asaangune kuleleka ndinywe kwiindila mukumusandula umwi oumwi kuzwa kuzibi zyenu.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pita o Joni Kunembo lye Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Pita o Joni kabacaamboola abantu, kwakabazida bapaizi bamwi awolupati-pati wabalindizi bomu Ngʼanda ya Leza abamwi ba Saduki. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bakeza kabanyemene kaambo aaba bamaapositola bobile balikwiisya bantu kuteeti Jesu wakabuka kuzwa kubafu, eeci cakalitondezya kuteeti bantu bayoobuka kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Mpoonyina bakabajata okubabika muntolongo mane kusikila bwaca kaambo kwalisiide kale. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Kono bunji bwaabo bakalimvwa jwi bakasyoma, omweelwe wabaalumi wakavula cokuteeti batikasike kuzyuulu zyosanwe.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Buzuba bwakacilila, basololi ba Majuda, bamaalu, abamayi bo Mulawo bakabungana mu Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Alaabo baliwo kwali Anasi Mupaizi Mupati, Kayafasi, Joni, o Alekizanda ape abamwi balikuzulilwa mumukwasyi wo Mupaizi Mupati. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Mpoonyina bakaimika Pita o Joni kunembo lyabo okutalika kubabuzya kuteeti, “Ino ninguzuunzi na muuzina lyani ndimwabelesya kuponya ooyu mwaalumi?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Mpoonyina Pita kazwide Muuya Uusalala, wakabataba kuteeti, “Nobasololi babantu amaalu! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ino sunu tubuzigwa kaambo komusebezi mubotu wacitwa kumwaalumi ooyu cihole na? Ino muyanda kuziba mbwaaponisigwa na? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Nywebo abana Izilaili noonse muzibe kuteeti ooyu mwaalumi waponisigwa kwiindila muzina lya Jesu Kilisitu woku Nazaleta, ooyo ngumwakakankamina kono Leza wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Intembauzyo 118:22</ref>.</char></note> Ooyu Jesu nguwaambwa mumalembo kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Bbwe ndimwakakaka nywebo nobayaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">lyakaba ndeliyandisi kwiinda oonse.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Lufutuko lujanika feela mulinguwe kaambo taakwe limwi zina ndyaakapa Leza muno munyika oomo motunga twajana lufutuko.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Iino Benkuta Mpati ya Majuda nibakabona busicamba bwa Pita o Joni okuziba kuteeti balibantu feela batalikwe olwiiyo, bakakomokwa loko, mpoonyina bakaziba kuteeti balikujanikaanga o Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kono kaambo kokuteeti bakabona mwaalumi wakaponesegwa kaimvwi ambabo bakabula ecokwaamba aleeci. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Mpoonyina bakaambila Pita o Joni kuteeti bazwidaanze, kumane Benkuta Mpati bakalyaamboozya mulicabo kabateeti, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Ino tubacite buti aaba baalumi? Jelusalemu yoonse yaziba kuteeti bacita maleele aakomosya eeco cetutakonzyi kukaka aswebo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Kono kuteegwa nkani eeyi itasabalangani, atubalailile kuteeti baleke kwaamboola muzina lya Jesu kumuntu naanga omwi.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Mpoonyina bakabaita mukati okubalailila kuteeti batakasoli kwaamboola naanga kwiisya muzina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Kono Pita o Joni bakabataba kuteeti, “Amulyaatwide nobeni na Leza uyanda kuteeti tucilizye nywebo na nguwe? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kono swebo lwesu tatukonzyi kuleka kwaamboola alizitwabona okumvwa.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Nibakamana kubakonga, bakabalukulula kaambo kokuteeti bakakacilwa kubapa cisubulo kaambo kabantu balikulumbaizya Leza kuli cakacitika. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Mwaalumi wakacitilwa maleele ookuponesegwa waleemyaaka yalikwiinda makumi one.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basyomi Bakombela Nguzu Zyokutayoowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Pita o Joni nibakalukululwa feela, bakainka kubasyominyina okuyoobaambila zyoonse zibakabaambila bapaizi basilutwe abamaalu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kulonga 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neyemiya 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Intembauzyo 146:6</ref>.</char></note> Nibakamvwa eeci, bakanyamuna majwaabo antoomwi okukomba kuli Leza kabateeti, “O Mwami Singuzu Zyoonse, owakalenga julu enyika, lwizi ezintu zyoonse zili mulizizyo! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Intembauzyo 2:1-2</ref>.</char></note> Yebo wakaamba kubelesya Muuya Uusalala kwiindila mumubelesi wako Deveti sikale wesu kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ino niinzi capa kuteeti Bamasi banyeme loko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Ino niinzi bantu nebakanza zyobufuba-fuba?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Bami benyika bakalibambila nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">abaleli bakabungana antoomwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kulwanisya Mwami o Mesiya wakwe.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Luka 23:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateyo 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maako 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luka 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Joni 18:28-29</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nconzyo mwami Helodi o muleli Pontiyasi Pilato, Bamasi, abana Izilaili bakaswaangana omuno mutaindi kuteeti bayandoole nzila yokujaya Jesu mubelesi wako uusalala nguwakananika. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Zyoonse zibakacita wakalizikanzide kale ciindi kwiindila munguzu oluyando lwako kuteeeti zicitike. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Iino O Mwami, mvwa mbubalikutuyoosya wamana utupe nguzu zinji tobabelesi bako zyokukambooka majwi aako cokutayoowa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Tandabika janza lyako kuteeti uponye okucita zitondezyo zyamaleele ezikomosya kwiindila muzina lyomubelesi wako uusalala Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Nibakamana kukomba, cibaka pibakaswaangene cakazungaana. Mpoonyina boonse bakazula Muuya Uusalala okutalika kukambooka majwaa Leza cokutayoowa.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basyomi Babaana Lubono Lwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Misebezi 2:44-45</ref>.</char>
    </note> Basyomi boonse baloomuzeezo omwi o moyo omwi, mane okulimvwa kuteeti lubono ndobakajesi taakwe nilwalilwabo kubagama kono bakabaana zintu zyoonse zibakajesi. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Mpoonyina baapositola bakapa bumboni bokubuka kwa Mwami Jesu kubafu cenguzu loko ape luzyalo lwa Leza lupati lwali aalimbabo boonse, <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />cokuteeti taakwe wakabula akati kabo kaambo aabo bakajesi zibaka naanga maanda bakazyuuzya okweeta mali ngobakauzya, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />okwatola kunembo lya maapositola. Mpoonyina bakaabaanya kuli umwi oumwi kweelana ambwaabulide.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Mboonyina mbuli Josefa mu Levi uuzwa ku Saipulasi baapositola ngubalikwiita kuteeti Bbanabbasi, caamba kuteeti, “Sikuyumya-yumya”. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Wakauzya muunda wakwe okweeta mali kubaapositola.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiyasi o Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Iino kwali umwi mwaalumi walikwiitwa kuteeti Ananiyasi o mwanakazaakwe Safila, bakauzya muunda wabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Amwi mali wakaasyaazya omwanakazaakwe kazi okutola amwi kubaapositola. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Mpoonyina Pita wakaambila Ananiyasi kuteeti, “Ino niinzi niwalekela Saatani kukunjila mumoyo kuteegwa weene Muuya Uusalala kwiindila mukusyaazya amwi mali azwa kumuunda nguwauzya? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Niwatalina kuuzya muunda, tiwaliinsi wako na? Ape niwauuzya, mali taliinsi aako na kuteeti inga waablelesya mbuli mboyanda? Ino niinzi niwayeeya kucita cilinamu? Taakwe niweena bantu kono weena Muuya Uusalala.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Iino Ananiyasi naakamvwa majwaaya wakawidaansi okufwa, ape boonse bakiimvwa nkani eeyi bakayoowa loko. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Kumane, bamwi basyimani bakanyamuka okuvungaila mutunta wakwe mpoonyina bakutolaanze kuyouzika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Nikwakainda mawoola alikutandila kuli otatwe, mwanakazaakwe wakeza katezi cacitika okunjila. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Mpoonyina Pita wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ndaambile na ooyu ngomuulo womuunda wenu ngumwakauzya omulumaako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Wakazumina kateeti, “Iiyi ngonguwo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kumane Pita wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nimwamvwana omulumaako kusunka Muuya wo Mwami? Bona bantu bainkide kukuzika mulumaako balaanze, ayebo bazookutola!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Mpoonya-mpoonya mwanakazi wakawidaansi azituta zya Pita okufwa. Kuzwaawo basyimani nibakanjila okujana kuteeti ulifwide, bakamutolaanze okuyoomuzika ambali omulumaakwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Mbungano yoonse aabo boonse bakazimvwa eezi bakayoowa loko.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zitondezyo Zyamaleele Ezikomosya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Iino Leza wakacita zitondezyo zyamaleele ezikomosya zinji kwiindila mumaanza abaapositola. Basyomi boonse balikubunganaanga mukotela lya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Kono taakwe naanga omwi wokunze wakasola kuvwaana aabo, nekuteegwa bantu balikwaamba zibotu aalimbabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Nekuba namu, basyomi mu Mwami banji-banji bakayungizizigwa kumbungano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cipa kubonekaanga kancali ka 13 aka 14 tulindeene kuli makani ngotungamide. Kancali ka 13 katondezya kuteeti bana buleya balikukacilwa kusangana abaapositola kaambo kokuyoowa naanga likute, makamaka kuzwa nibakabona zyakacitika kuli Ananiyasi o Safila. Kono kancali ka 14 katondezya kuteeti basyomi benconzyo bakaindilizya kubasangana, balikweetwa kwiindila mumisebezi yo Muuya Uusalala obumboni bwabaapositola. Otutuncali antoomwi tutondezya lwiindano luli akati kelikute lobuleya okuvula kwa basyomi benconzyo.</char></note>, akali mabbunga aaba maalumi abanakazi. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Kaambo kemisebezi yabaapositola, bantu balikweeta baciswa mumigwagwa okubalazika amalo aaminseme kuteegwa naanga feela munzinziimwa wa Pita aalya anoinda wiinde aalimbabo kuteegwa bapone. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Ape edwi lyabantu kuzwa mumataindi aazingulukide Jelusalemu lyakeza kweeta aabo bakacisidwe aabo bakali kupenzegwa emyuuya mibi, mpoonyina boonse bakaponesigwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baapositola Bapenzegwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Iino Mupaizi Mupati aabo bolupati-pati mbalaabo, benkamu ya Basaduki kabazwide munyono. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bakajata baapositola okubabika muntolongo yobuleya boonse. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kono masiku mungelo wo Mwami wakiijula milyango yentolongo okubagwisizyaanze, amane wakabaambila kuteeti, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Kamuya mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza mukaambile bantu majwi oonse oobuumi bupya oobu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Nibakamvwa namu, kalitanaandula zuba, baapositola bakanjila mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza okutalika kwiisya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ooku kumwi, Mupaizi Mupati aabo bolupati-pati mbalaabo, bakaita antoomwi nkamu yabamaalu Benkuta Mpati okupa malailile kuteeti baapositola beetwe kunembo lyabo kuzwa muntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Kono balindizi be Ngʼanda ya Leza nibakainka kuntolongo, taakwe nibakabajana mwateni baapositola, mpoonyina bakapiluka okuyaambila Benkuta Mpati kuteeti, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Twajana ntolongo ilikiidwe kabotu-kabotu abalindizi bentolongo kabaimvwi amilyango yayo, kono nitwajula, twajana taakwe bantu mwateni”. <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mpoonyina wolupati-pati wabalindizi bomu Ngʼanda ya Leza abapaizi basilutwe nibakamvwa nkani eeyi bakakomokwa okulyangana loko kuteeti na niinzi cacitika kubaapositola. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Mpoonyina umwi wakeza okubaambila kuteeti, “Amubone! Baalumi mbimwabikide muntolongo balimukwiisya bantu mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Mpoonyina wolupati-pati wabalindizi bomu Ngʼanda ya Leza wakainka abalindilizi bakwe okuyoobeeta baapositola kono kakutakwe kubelesya nguzu kaambo kokuyoowa bantu kuteeti balabapotoola mabwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Nibakamana kubeeta, bakabaimika kunembo lye Nkuta Mpati ooko kubakabuzigwa mibuzyo omupaizi mupati yokuteeti,<figure style="fig" alt="The apostles before the Sanhedrin" file="wa03950b.tif" size="col" ref="5:27">Baapositola kunembo lye Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda</figure> <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mateyo 27:25</ref>.</char></note> “Twakamwaambila cokusinizya kuteeti muleke kwiisya muzina eeli, kono amulange cimwacita! Mwazuzya Jelusalemu yoonse eziisyo zyenu ape muyanda kubika gazi lyo mwaalumi ooyu amitwe yesu!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Mpoonyina Pita abaapositola bakataba kuteeti, “Tweelede kucilizya Leza kutainsi bantu”. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Leza wabasikale besu wakabusya Jesu kuzwa kubafu, ngumwakajata okujaya kwiindila mukumukankamina aciingano. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Kono Leza wakamusumpula ejanza lyakwe lyolulyo kuteeti abe Mweendelezi Mupati ape abe Mufutuli. Leza wakacita namu kuteegwa bana Izilaili beempe kuzibi zyabo okujatilwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Mane swebo tulibakamboni beezizintu antoomwi o Muuya Uusalala Leza ngwaakapa kulaabo bamucilizya.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Mpoonyina Benkuta Mpati nibakamvwa namu, bakanyema loko okuyanda kujaya baapositola. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kono umwi Mufalisi walikwiitwa kuteeti Gamaliya wali mwiiyi wo Mulawo walikukutekwa abantu boonse wakanyamuka akati ka Benkuta Mpati okulailila balindizi kuteeti batole baapositola anze aniini. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Mpoonyina wakaambila Benkuta Mpati kuteeti, “Nobana Izilaili, mumamele alizyemwaandoocita kubaalumi aaba! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Imwi nako mumazubaainda, kwaali Tediyasi walikulyaamba kuteeti mupati, ooyo walaabaalumi balikumucilila balikutandila kumyaanda yone. Kono naakajayigwa boonse balikumucilila bakamwaika azyoonse zyakagolela mpoonyinaawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kuzwanguwe muciindi cokubalwa kwabantu mucisi, kwakeza Judasi muna Galileya. Wakabunganya bantu kuteeti bamucilile mukubukila mfulumende. Awe wakajaigwa, mpoonyina boonse balikumucilila bakamwaika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Mukaambo aaka kalikunembo lyesu sunu, ndimwaambila kuteeti, amubaleke aaba baalumi bainke. Nakuteeti makanze aabo azyebacita zizwa kubantu feela taakwe kozitiinke. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Kono nakuteeti zizwa kuli Leza, tamukokonzya kubalesya mane muyoolijana feela kuteeti mulimukulwana Leza!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Benkuta Mpati bakacilizya zyaakaamba Gamaliya. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Kuzwaawo bakaita baapositola okubaumya mpoonyina okubalailila kuteeti batakasoli ape kwaamboola muzina lya Jesu. Kumane, bakabalukulula. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Baapositola bakazwa mu Nkuta Mpati kababoteledwe kaambo bakalimvwa kuteeti Leza wakababona kuteeti baleelela kusampoolwa kaambo kezina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Mpoonyina bakaindilizya kukambooka okwiisya Makani Mabotu okuteeti Jesu ngo Mesiya buzuba obuzuba mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza omumaanda.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kusalwa Kwabagwasyi Bali Ciloba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Muciindi eeco, basyomi nibalikuyoobuvula, Majuda baamboola Cigiliki bakatalika kutongooka Majuda baamboola ci Hibbulu kaambo bamukabafu baba Majuda baamboola Cigiliki balikusalululwaanga kuzilyo zibalikuholaanga buzuba obuzuba. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Mpoonyina baapositola balikumi abobile bakakazika basyomi antoomwi okwaamba kuteeti, “Taciinsi kabotu swebo kuleka kukambooka majwaa Leza okutalika kwaabanya zilyo amatafule. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Kaambo keeci nobakwesu, amusale baalumi bali ciloba bakutekwa ape bazwide Muuya Uusalala obusongo kuteegwa tupembabo musebezi ooyu, <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />kuteegwa swebo tobaapositola tugame feela kukomba okukambooka jwi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Boonse bakuubotelwa muzeezo ooyu, mpoonyina bakasala Sitivini mwaalumi wazwide lusyomo o Muuya Uusalala, Filipo, Polokolasi, Nikano, Timoni, Pamenasi o Nikolasi woku Antiyoki wali wa Bamasi kono wakasanduka kuba mu Juda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Aaba baalumi bakabaimika kunembo lyabaapositola, mpoonyina baapositola bakababika maanza aabo amitwe okubakombela.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mpoonyina Jwi lya Leza lyakazwidaanembo kumwaigwa. Mweelwe wabasyomi mu Jelusalemu wakavula loko abapaizi banji bakasyoma okucilila bukombi.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujatwa Kwa Sitivini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Iino Sitivini wali mwaalumi wazwide luzyalo enguzu zya Leza, wakacita zikomosya zipati ezitondezyo zyamaleele akati kabantu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Kono bumwi buzuba, bamwi baalumi be Cikombelo ciitwa kuteeti Bantu Baangulukide, bakatalika kukazyanya anguwe. Aaba bali Majuda bazwa ku Sailini ku Alekizandiliya, ku Silisiya omucooko ca Eziya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kono bakakacilwa kuzunda kwaambola kwa Sitivini kaambo ko Muuya Uusalala o busongo bwali mulinguwe. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Mpoonyina bakoongelezya bamwi baalumi kuteeti beenekezye Sitivini kuteeti, “Twamumvwa kasampoola Mozesi o Leza.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Muleeyi nzila bakanyemya bantu, bamaalu abamayi Bomulawo cokuteeti bakajata Sitivini okumutola ku Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Kuzwaawo bakeeta bakamboni bobubeji bakaamba kuteeti, “Ooyu mwaalumi taleki kwaamboola zintu zyokusampoola Ngʼanda ya Leza eeyi Iisalala ape o Mulawo wa Mozesi nako yoonse. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Mane Twakamumvwa kaamba kuteeti, ‘Ooyu Jesu woku Nazaleta uzoimwacoola Ngʼanda ya Leza eeyi ape okucinca tunsiya-nsiya twaakatusiila Mozesi.’” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Mpoonyina boonse Benkuta Mpati bakamulangisisya Sitivini okubona kuteeti ciinso cakwe cakalibonyaanga co mungelo.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sitivini Waliiminina Kunembo lye Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mpoonyina Mupaizi Mupati wakabuzya Sitivini kuteeti, “Zyanconzyo zyebalimukukutamizya na?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1">Matalikilo 12:1</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina Sitivini wakataba kuteeti, “Nobazyalwama amatata, amundimvwe! Leza wesu wobulemu wakalibonya kuli sikale wesu Abbulahamu. Muciindi eeco Abbulahamu wacilikukala mucilalaanda ca Mesopotamiya katana kulongela kutaindi lya Halani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Mpoonyina Leza wakamwaambila kuteeti, ‘Siya babbululu bako enyika yokulinywe, wiinke kunyika eeyo njendiyookutondezya.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Matalikilo 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">12:4</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Abbulahamu wakazwa kucisi cabana Kaludiya okuyokala mu Halani. Kuzwaawo baisi nibakafwa, Leza wakamugwisya okumutola munyika eeyi njemukede mwateni. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Matalikilo 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref>.</char></note> Kono aleeyo nako Leza taakwe naakamupa cibaka muleeyi nyika neciceya. Kono wakamusyomezye kuteeti inyika eeyi iyooba yakwe abolunyungu lwakwe bayooza kuzwa nguwe, nekuba kuteeti taakwe naajesi omwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Matalikilo 15:13-14</ref>.</char></note>Ape Leza wakamwaambila kuteeti, ‘Bolunyungu lwako bayookala mucisi cabamwi oomo mobayoodyamininwa mubuzike kwemyaaka iili myaanda yone. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kulonga 3:12</ref>.</char></note> Kono ndiyoopa cisubulo kucisi eeco cebayoobelekela mbuli bazike, mpoonyina kumamanino bayoozwa mwateni okuzoondikomba omuno mucibaka.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Matalikilo 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">21:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:26">25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:31-35:18">29:31—35:18</ref>.</char></note> Amane Leza wakapa Abbulahamu cizuminano cali ecitondezyo cokupalulwa. Kumane, Abbulahamu wakazyala Isaka okumupalula kajesi mazuba aali lusele. Awe Isaka wakacita mboonyina namu kumwanaakwe Jakobo. Awe Jakobo wakacita mboonyina namu kubana bakwe bali kumi abobile, matata besu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Matalikilo 37:11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:28">37:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:2">39:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Iino bana ba Jakobo bakauzya Josefa muzyalwanyina mubuzike kaambo komunyono mpoonyina wakatolwa ku Ijipiti. Kono Leza wakali anguwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Matalikilo 41:39-41</ref>.</char></note> Wakamuvuna kumugwisya mumapenzaakwe oonse okumupa busongo cokuteeti naakainka kunembo lya Falawo, mwami woku Ijipiti, mwami wakabotelwa awe. Mpoonyina mwami wakamusala kuba mweendelezi we Ijipiti owengʼanda yo mwami yoonse. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1-2">Matalikilo 42:1-2</ref>.</char></note> Imwi nako kwakanjila nzala mucisi ca Ijipiti coonse eca Kenani, eeyi nzala yakeeta mapenzi loko cokuteeti basikale besu bakakubula kokujana cilyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Iino Jakobo naakamvwa kuteeti kuli cilyo ku Ijipiti, wakatuma bana bakwe basikale besu muciindi cokusaanguna kuteeti bakaakuule kwateni cilyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Matalikilo 45:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 45:16">45:16</ref>.</char></note> Bazyalwanyina ba Josefa nibakainka ku Ijipiti nako yabili, Josefa wakalizibya kulimbabo mpoonyina mukwasyi wa Josefa wakazibwa kuli Falawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-10">Matalikilo 45:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:17-18">17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Josefa wakalaizya kuteeti Jakobo, isi aze ku Ijipiti omukwasyi wakwe woonse. Antoomwi balikusika kumakumi aali ciloba a osanwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Matalikilo 46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:33">49:33</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Jakobo wakainka ku Ijipiti, kwaakakufwida antoomwi abasikale besu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Matalikilo 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Joshwa 24:32</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina mafuwa aabo akapilusigwa kubali kukala ku Shekemu okuzikwa mucuumbwe cakaulide Abbulahamu amali kubana ba Hamo mu Shekemu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7-8">Kulonga 1:7-8</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Iino nako niyakaswena yokuteeti Leza azuzikizye zyaakasyomezyezye Abbulahamu, bantu besu bakavula loko mu Ijipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Nikwakainda nako kwakazoolela mwami umwi watakezi zya Josefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10-11">Kulonga 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">1:22</ref>.</char></note> Ooyu mwami waloolunya kubantu besu okubadyaaminina loko kubasungilizya kuteeti kabasowa twana tuvwanda kuteegwa tufwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kulonga 2:2</ref>.</char></note> Muuciindi eeci Mozesi naakazyalwa, walimwana mubotu mumeensaa Leza. Mozesi wakalelwa mungʼanda yabaisi kwa myeezi yotatwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Kulonga 2:3-10</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina nibakamusowa, mwanaa Falawo musimbi wakamubweza okumupanga kuba mwana wakwe okumukomezya mbuli mwana wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mpoonyina Mozesi wakaisigwa mubusongo boonse bwabana Ijipiti, ape wakaba mupati muzyaambo omuzicito.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Kulonga 2:11-15</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Bumwi buzuba Mozesi naalaa myaaka iili makumi one, wakayeeya kuyoopotela babbululu bakwe bana Izilaili. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Naakabona muna Ijipiti kapenzya muna Izilaili, Mozesi wakainka kuyookwabilila muna Izilaili okupilusizya muna Ijipiti mukumujaya. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mozesi walikuyeeya kuteeti bantu bakwe balaziba kuteeti Leza wakamutuma kweeta lwaanguluko kulimbabo, kono taakwe nibakaziba. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Buzuba bwakacilila, Mozesi wakabona baalumi bobile bana Izilaili kabalwana, mpoonyina wakasoleka kubavuna kabaambila kuteeti, ‘Nobaalumi, niinzi nemulwana kakuli muzyalwaamwi?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Mpoonyina sikucisa mweenzinyina wakatonta Mozesi okumubuzya kuteeti, ‘Ngwani wakakubika kuba mweendelezi omwaatuzi akati kesu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ino uyanda kundijaya mboonyina mbuwakajaya uulya muna Ijipiti jilo na?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">Kulonga 18:3-4</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Mozesi naakamvwa namu, wakacija okuyookala mucisi ca Midiya, mwaakali muzwakule. Ooko wakaakuzyala bana basyimani bobile.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Kulonga 3:1-10</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Iino nikwakainda myaaka iili makumi one, mungelo wa Leza wakalibonya kuli Mozesi muciteyo calikuyaka mulilo munkanda ambali ecilundu ca Sinayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Iino Mozesi naakacibona eeci, wakakomokwa okuswena afwiifwi kuteegwa abonesesye. Mpoonyina wakamvwa jwi lya Mwami kaliteeti, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ndime Leza wabasikale benu, Leza wa Abbulahamu, Isaka o Jakobo.’ Mpoonyina Mozesi wakatuntuma okuyoowa loko ape taakwe naakasola kulanga kwateni. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Kuzwaawo, Mwami wakaambila Mozesi kuteeti, ‘Tubula manyantela aako kaambo aawo anyika poimwvi kulasalala. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nconzyo ndakubona kupenzegwa kwabantu bangu balimu Ijipiti okutongela kwabo ndakumvwa. Ceciceeco cindaselukila kuteeti ndibanunune. Iino koza! Ndikutume ku Ijipiti.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kulonga 2:14</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Ngweenya ooyu Mozesi ngonguwe ngubakakakide bana Izilaili kabateeti, ‘Ngwani wakakubika kuba mweendelezi omwaatuzi akati kesu?’ Ngonguwe ngweenyina Leza ngwaakatuma kuteeti abe musololi o mufutuli wabo kwiindila mujanza lyo Mungelo ooyo wakalibonya muciteyo ciyaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Kulonga 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Myeelwe 14:33</ref>.</char></note>Wakabagwisya mu Ijipiti kacita zikomosya ezitondezyo zyamaleele mu Ijipiti Aalwizi Lusalala omunkanda kwe myaaka iili makumi one. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Detilonomo 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>.</char></note> Ngonguwe ngoonyinooyu Mozesi wakaambila bana Izilaili kuteeti, ‘Leza uyoosala akati kenu musinsimi mboonyina mbwaakandisala mebo.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Kulonga 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Detilonomo 5:1-33</ref>.</char></note> Mozesi ooyu ngonguwaape walaakati ke mbungano yabana ba Izilaili antoomwi abasikale besu munkanda aalya mungelo nakaamboolaawe Acilundu ca Sinayi. Aalya wakatambula majwi apa buumi kuteegwa azootupe ngawo.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Kono basikale besu taakwe nibalikuyanda kumumvwida Mozesi, mane bakamukaka ape mumyoyo yabo batokomene kupiluka ku Ijipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Kulonga 32:1</ref>.</char></note> Bakateeti kuli Aloni, ‘Tupangile ba leza batitusolwedele kaambo tatuzi zilimukucitika kuli uulya mwaalumi Mozesi, wakatugwisya munyika yoku Ijipiti.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Kulonga 32:2-6</ref>.</char></note> Momuciindeeci nibakapanga cibumbwa comunamani okupa zituuzyo kulicico okucita mukiti mukukuteka misebezi yamaanzaabo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amosi 5:25-27</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Leza wakabafutatila okubaleka kuteeti kabakomba nyenyeezi zyokujulu mboonyina mbokulemdedwe mu bbuku lya basinsimi kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Nobana Izilaili! Nconzyo tainsi ndime ngumwali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">kupa zituuzyo ezipaizyo nimwali munkanda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">kwe myaaka iili makumi one.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Ede nditeente ndimwalikukombela Moloki leza wenu ndimwayumwide</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ape mwayumwine ecibumbwa ca Lefani leza wenu we nyenyeezi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Eezi zyali zibumbwa zimwakalibumbila kuteeti kamuzikomba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Iino ndiyandoomutandila kule kwiindilila Bbabbiloni.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:9">Kulonga 25:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Basikale besu bakajesi teente lyecizuminano munkanda. Eeli teente lyakapangwa obupange Leza mbwaakatondezya Mozesi. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Joshwa 3:14-17</ref>.</char></note> Kuzwaawo basikale besu bakalitambula teente kuzwa kumaisi. Mpoonyina Joshuwa naakasololela basikale besu kuyoolwanisya zisi Leza zyakatanda muleeci cibaka, bakaliyumunizya kucibaka cipya eeco. Bakaakukala alyo kusikila nako ya Deveti. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Samuele 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Makani 17:1-14</ref>.</char></note> Iino Deveti wakajana luzyalo mumeensaa Leza okukumbila kuteeti ayakile Leza wa Jakobo ngʼanda. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Bami 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Makani 3:1-17</ref>.</char></note> Kono Solomoni nguwakamuyakila.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Nekuba kuteeti Leza Sijulu Wamajulu takali mumaanda akayakwa amaanza aabantu, mboonyina mbuli mbwaamba musinsimi kuteeti,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Izaya 66:1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note> ‘Mwami waamba kuteeti, Julu cibbula cangu cobwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Nyika cilyatilo cangu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ino inga mwandiyakila ngʼanda yomusyobo nzi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ino cili cibaka cangu cokupumwida?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ino talili janza lyangu lyakalenga zyoonseneni eezi na?’”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Izaya 63:10</ref>.</char>
    </note> Sitivini wakaindilizya okuteeti, “Nobasimitwe miyumu, bajesi myoyo itasyomi amatwi aatamvwi! Mucita zibalikucita basikale benu, nako yoonse mukazya Muuya Uusalala. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nguuli musinsimi ngubatakapenzya basikale benu? Mane basikale benu bakajayaabo bakaambilizya ciindi loko kuza kwa Uululeme, Mesiya, ngumwakaaba okujaya. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mwakatambula Mulawo ooyo wakeetwa kulindinwe abangelo kono mwakakacilwa kuucililizya.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotoolwa kwa Sitivini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Benkuta Mpati ya Majuda nibakamvwa namu, bakanyema loko okuluma ntwino kulinguwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Kono Sitivini kazwide Muuya Uusalala wakadongomwena kujulu okubona bulemu bwa Leza o Jesu kaimvwi kubbazu lyolulyo lwa Leza. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Mpoonyina wakateeti, “Amulange! Ndabona julu kalijukide Omwanoo Muntu kaimvwi kubbazu lyolulyo lwa Leza!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Kono bakalisinka matwi okoongolola loko okuvwalookela antoomwi kulinguwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Mpoonyina bakamukuluntilaanze etaindi okutalika kumupotoola mabwe. Balikumutamizya bakatubula majansaabo okwaabika amaulu omusyimani walikwiitwa kuteeti Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Nibalikumupotoola mabwe Sitivini, wakakomba kateeti, “Mwami Jesu tambula muuya wangu!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Mpoonyina wakafugama okoongolola kateeti, “Mwami utabapi mulandu acibi eeci!” Naakamana kwaamba namu, wakafwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Ooyu Saulu waluumwi wabakamboni ape wakazumina kuteeti bamujaye Sitivini.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saulu Wapenzya Mbungano</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Mubuzuba buya mbobuzuba mapenzi mapati okulwaanisya mbungano mu Jelusalemu naakatalika. Basyomi boonse bakamwaikila muzilalaanda zyoonse zya Judiya o Samaliya kunze lya Baapositola. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Bamwi baalumi balyaabide kuli Leza bakaakumuzika Sitivini, okoongoolola kumulila.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Misebezi 22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kono Saulu eeyi nako wakasola kumwayoola mbungano, okwaabunjila ngʼanda e ngʼanda kukwelaanya baalumi abanakazi okubasowela muntolongo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani Mabotu Akambookwa mu Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Iino aabo basyomi bakasabalangene bakakambooka Makani Mabotu kufumbwa ooko kubakainka. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />We Filipo wakainka mutaindi pati lyomu Samaliya kayoobubakambookela zya Mesiya. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Iino bantu banji bakabikila maano loko kulizyaalikwaamba Filipo nibakamvwa zyaalikwaamba okubona zitondezyo zyamaleele ngaakacita. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Myuuya mibi yakazwa mubantu banji kaikwiila loko, ape abantu banji bayuminide mibili ezilema zinji bakaponisigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Mpoonyina kwakaba kubotelwa loko mutaindi eelyo.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Iino mutaindi eelyo mwali mwaalumi walikwiitwa kuteeti Saimoni. Walikukomosyaanga bantu bomu Samaliya amasalamusaakwe, okulidundaizya kuteeti walimupati. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Bantu boonse bomutaindi kutalikila kubantu feela kusikila kubolupati-pati balikumubikila maano loko, okumwaamba kuteeti, “Ooyu mwaalumi nenguzu zya Leza ziitwa kuteeti, ‘Nguzu Zipati.’” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Balikumubikilaanga maano loko kaambo kweciindi cilamfwu walikubakomosya amasalamusaakwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kono nibakasyoma kukambooka kwa Filipo kwa Makani Mabotu o Bwami bwa Leza o Jesu Kilisitu, bakabbabbatizigwa, baalumi abanakazi. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Anguwe Saimoni lwakwe wakasyoma okubbabbatizigwa. Mpoonyina wakatalika kujanika o Filipo. Saimoni wakakomokwa loko naakabona zitondezyo zyamaleele emisebezi mipati njaakacita Filipo.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Iino Baapositola mu Jelusalemu nibakamvwa kuteeti bana Samaliya batambula jwi lya Leza, bakatuma Pita o Joni kulimbabo. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nibakasika bakakombela basyomi kuteegwa batambule Muuya Uusalala, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kaambo akati kabo taakwe watambwide kale Muuya Uusalala. Babbabbatizidwe feela muzina lyo Mwami Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Mpoonyina Pita o Joni bakatandabika maanza aabo abana Samaliya, kumane bakatambula Muuya Uusalala.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Iino Saimoni naakabona kuteeti Muuya Uusalala wapegwa kwiindila mukubika maanza kwaabaapositola kubasyomi, wakabasyomezya mali <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />okwaamba kuteeti, “Amundipe amebo nguzu eezi kuteegwa kufumbwa ngonditakatandabike maanza akatambule Muuya Uusalala.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Kono Pita wakamutaba kuteeti, “Ukaandooke amalaako, kaambo uyeeyaanga inga waula cipego ca Leza amali! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Tokwe lubazu naanga caabilo muleeci, kaambo moyo wako tuululeme kuli Leza. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Weelede kweempwa kuzibi zyako eezi ape ukombe ku Mwami mweendi ulakulekelela mizeezo iili mumoyo wako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ndibwene kuteeti uzwide munyono ape ulimwaange we cibi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Kono Saimoni wakaambila Pita o Joni kuteeti, “Amundikombele ku Mwami kuteegwa kutandicitikili naanga comwi aleezi zimwaamba.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Pita o Joni nibakamana kupa bumboni okukambooka ijwi lyo Mwami kubantu bomu Samaliya, bakapiluka ku Jelusalemu. Nibalikuyoobupiluka, balikuyoobukambooka Makani Mabotu mumiinzi minji yomu Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo o Muzibe Muna Itiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Iino mungelo wa Leza wakaambila Filipo kuteeti, “Nyamuka, koya kumusanza munzila yiinda munkanda izwa ku Jelusalemu kuya ku Gaza.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Mpoonyina Filipo wakanyamuka okwiinka. Munzila wakajana muzibe muna Itiyopiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muciindi eciya zina lya Itiyopiya lyalikwaamba bwami bwali mumbali omulonga wa Nailo. Sunu ciitwa kuteeti cisi ca Sudani.</char></note> wolupati-pati wali muyobozi wo lubono lo mwami mwanakazi Kandake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kandake ndizina lye cibbula cobwami bwecanakazi bwabana Itiyopiya, taliinsi zina lyakwe kumugama.</char></note> woku Itiyopiya.<figure style="fig" alt="Philip and the Ethiopian official" file="lb00331b.tif" size="col" ref="8:27">Filipo o Muzibe Muna Itiyopiya</figure> Walikuzwa ku Jelusalemu kukukomba <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />kayoobupiluka kungʼanda yakwe. Walikede mungolovani yakwe kayoobubala mubbuku lyomunsinsimi Izaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mpoonyina Muuya Uusalala wakaambila Filipo kuteeti, “Swenaafwiifwi engolovani iilya weende aayo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Cokufwambaana Filipo wakazuzila afwiifwi engolovani okumvwooyu muzibe kabala mubbuku lyomusinsimi Izaya. Mpoonyina wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino ulizimwvide cezyaamba zyolimukubala na?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Muzibe wakateeti, “Nee! Tandikonzya kumvwisisisya aati umwi andipandulwide.” Mpoonyina wakatamba Filipo kuteeti atante mungolovani bakale limwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Izaya 53:7-8</ref>.</char></note> Kampango kamalembo kaali kubala kaaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Wakatolwa mbuli mbelele iitolwa kukujaigwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Ape waluumwine mbuli kana kembelele katalili kanoogelwa boya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">taakwe naakagwisya jwi neliba lyomwi.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Wakapenzegwa ape taakwe nakaatulwa mbokweelede.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ngwani uyoolupandulula lunyungu lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">kaambo buumi bwakwe bwakagwisigwa anyikaano.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Mpoonyina muzibe wakabuzya Filipo kuteeti, “Ndaambile, ino musinsimi walikwaamba ni? Walikulyaamba lwakwe na walikwaamba muntuumbi?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Mpoonyina Filipo wakatalika akampango nkoonyinaaka kumwaambila Makani Mabotu aa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Nibacili kuyoobuya, bakajana cibaka cajesi maanzi mpoonyina muzibe wakabuzya Filipo kuteeti, “Ede maanzi ngaaya. Ino niinzi cikonzya kukasya kuteeti ndibbabbatizigwe?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Filipo wakateeti kulinguwe, “Inga wabbabbatizigwa na wasyoma omoyo wako woonse.” Muzibe wakataba kuteeti, “Iiyi ndilasyoma kuteeti Jesu Kilisitu Mwanaa Leza.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mace mabbuku aajesi kancali ka 37.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Muzibe wakalailila kuteeti ngolovani iimikwe, bamane bakaseluka okunjila mumaanzi mpoonyina Filipo wakabbabbatizya muzibe. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Nibakazwa feela mumaanzi, Muuya wo Mwami wakamutola Filipo. Muzibe taakwe nakamubona ape, kono wakaindilizya omusinzo wakwe kaboteledwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Mpoonyina Filipo wakaakulijana kutaindi lya Azotasi. Wakeenda kayoobukambooka mumataindi oonse mane kusikila kutaindi lya Sizeliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kusanduka kwa Saulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Misebezi 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Iino Saulu kabbebbede, wakakonga kujaya basyomi ba Jesu. Mpoonyina wakainka ku Mupaizi Mupati, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />kuyookumbila magwalo amuzumizya kwiinka muzikombelo zyo kutaindi pati lya Damasikasi kuteegwa ajana baalumi abanakazi bacilila Nzila yo Mwami Jesu abaange okubeeta ku Jelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Naalikuyoobuya, kalaafwiifwi o Damasikasi mpoonya-mpoonya kwakamumunika mumuni kuzwa kujulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kumane wakawidaansi okumvwa jwi kaliteeti, “Saulu, Saulu! Ino undipenzezyaanzi?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saulu wakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino ndiweni o Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Mpoonyina Jesu wakamutaba kuteeti, “Ndime Jesu ngopenzya! <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Iino nyamuka unjile mu Damasikasi, mpoonyina uyoambilwa zyoelede kucita.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Mbaali kweendaabo bakaima kabateteledwe okubula cokwaamba kaambo bakamvwa feela jwi, kono taakwe ngubakabona! <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saulu bakamugwasya kunyamuka kuzwaansi. Kono naakajula meensaakwe wakakacilwa kubona. Mpoonyina mbaalikweendaabo bakamujata kujanza okumunjizya mu Damasikasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Mpoonyina kwamazuba otatwe taalikukonzya kubona, taalikulya naanga kunywa cilicoonse.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Iino mu Damasikasi kwali musyomi wezina lya Ananiyasi. Mwami wakaamboola anguwe mucilengano, kateeti, “Ananiyasi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Wakataba kuteeti, “Ndimuuno Mwami.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mwami Jesu wakateeti, “Nyamuka unjile munzila iitwa kuteeti, ‘Yoololokede,’ wiinke ku ngʼanda ya Judasi, ukabuzye mwaalumi wezina lya Saulu woku taindi pati lya Tasisi. Ulimukukomba anako eeyi, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />mane mucilengano wabona mwaalumi wezina lya Ananiyasi kanjila mungʼanda okubika maanzaakwe alinguwe kuteeti abone ape.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Kono Ananiyasi wakateeti, “Mwami ndakamvwa bantu banji kabaamba zintu zibi zyaakacita ooyu mwaalumi kubasalali bako mu Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ape wakazumizigwa abapaizi basilutwe kuza kuno kuzoanga boonse bakukomba.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kono Mwami wakateeti, “Koya, kaambo ooyu mwaalumi cibelesyo cangu cindasala kutola zina lyangu ku Bamasi okubami, okubana Izilaili. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mebo lwangu ndiyoomutondezya mbweelede kupenga kaambo kezina lyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Mpoonyina Ananiyasi wakainka okuyoonjila mungʼanda mwaalikubede Saulu okubika maanzaakwe alinguwe kateeti, “Omuzyalwama Saulu, Mwami Jesu wakalibonya kulindiwe munzila koyoobuza kuno nguwandituma kuteegwa meensaako ajuke ape uzule Muuya Uusalala.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Mpoonyinaawo kwakazwa zibedaanga maakwa mumeensaakwe, kuzwaawo wakabona, kumane wakanyamuka okuyoobbabbatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Mpoonyina wakalya cokulya amane wakabeenguzu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulu Wakambooka mu Damasikasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulu wakakala kwamazuba maniini mu Damasikasi abasyomi. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Mpoonyinaawo wakatalika kukambooka muzikombelo kateeti, “Jesu Mwanaa Leza.”<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Boonse bakamumvwa bakakomokwa loko okutalika kwaamba kuteeti, “Ino ooyu mwaalumi tainsi nguwe na wakeeta gogoogo ku Jelusalemu kajaya balikukomba zina lya Jesu? Tainsi caazida ookuno kuteegwa aange bantu okubatola kubapaizi basilutwe na?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Kono kukambooka kwa Saulu kwakaba kwenguzu loko ape obumboni bwakwe bwalikutondezya kuteeti, Jesu ngo Mesiya mane Majuda balikukala mu Damasikasi bakakacilwa kumukazya.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2 Bakolinto 11:32-33</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iino nikwakainda mazuba manji, Majuda bakeza antoomwi okupangana kuteeti bajaye Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Mpoonyina bakatalika kunoomulindilila masiku esikati amilyango yokunjila mutaindi lya Damasikasi kuteegwa bamujaye. Kono wakaambilwa makanzaabo. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Kuzwaawo basikwiiya bakwe bakamubweza amasiku okumwiinzizya abbango lyobulambo okumuselusizyaansi mucizuma.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul is lowered in a basketoutside the city walls" file="wa03999b.tif" size="col" ref="9:25">Paulu Waselusigwa Abbango lyo Bulambo Mucizuma</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saulu Wapiluka ku Jelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Mpoonyina Saulu wakainka ku Jelusalemu. Naakakusika wakasola kulivwaanya mu basyomi, kono bakayoowa kaambo taakwe nibakasyoma kuteeti walimusyomi muli Jesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Kono Bbanabbasi wakabweza Saulu okumutola kubaapositola. Wakabalungulwida mbuli Saulu mbwaakabona Mwami munzila o Mwami mbwaakaamboozya Saulu mane okubaambila mbuli Saulu mbwaakakambooka enguzu mu Damasikasi muzina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Saulu wakakala abaapositola okuzinguluka ambabo Jelusalemu yoonse kabakambooka enguzu muzina lyo Mwami. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Wakaamboola okukazyanya a Majuda be Cigiliki, kono balikuyandoola nzila yokumujaya. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Basyomi nibakamvwa namu, bakabweza Saulu okumutola ku Sizeliya okuyoomutumizya ku Tasisi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Aciindeeci, kwakaba luumuno mumbungano zyoonse zyomu Judiya, Galileya omu Samaliya. Kwiindila mukugwasigwa o Muuya Uusalala mbungano zyakayumisigwa, abantu bakavwula kabalemeka Mwami.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Waponya Eniyasi Okubusya Dokasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Iino Pita naalikuyobweendeenda koonse, wakainka kuyoopotela basalali bo Mwami bali kukala mutaindi lya Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Wakakujana kwateni mwaalumi wezina lya Eniyasi, ooyo wayuminide mubili cokuteeti taakwe naalikukonzya kubuka abulo kwe myaaka iili lusele. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Mpoonyina Pita wakateeti kulinguwe, “Eniyasi, Jesu Kilisitu ulimukukuponya. Nyamuka! Ubambe bulo bwako”. Mpoonya-mpoonya wakanyamuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Kuzwaawo bantu boonse balikukala mutaindi lya Lida omu Libala lya Shaloni bakamubona Eniyasi, mpoonyina bakasandukila ku Mwami.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Iino mu Jopa kwali umwi mwanakazi musyomi wezina lya Tabbita, mu Cigiliki ngu Dokasi caamba kuteeti mbaambi. Nako yoonse walikucitila bamwi zibotu okugwasya bapenzi. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Aleeyo nako wakaciswa okufwa. Mpoonyina mubili wakwe bakuusanzya okuubika mungʼanda yomujulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Mukuteeti Lida yalaafwiifwi o Jopa, basyomi nibakamvwa kuteeti Pita ulimu Lida, bakatuma baalumi bobile kuyaambila Pita kuteeti, “Aakakayo twakombelela koza kulindiswe cokufwambaana.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Mpoonyina Pita wakanyamuka okwiinkaabo. Naakasika, bakamutola mungʼanda yomujulu kubakaakumubunganina bamukabafu kabalila okumutondezya majansi ezizwaato zimwi Dokasi zyaakabalukilide naacili kupona. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Kuzwaawo, Pita wakaambila bantu boonse kuteeti bazwidaanze, mpoonyina wakafugama okukomba. Naakamana wakasandukila kumutunta okuteeti, “Tabbita, buka!” Mpoonyina Tabbita wakaajula meensaankwe, naakabona Pita wakabuka okukala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Mpoonyina Pita wakamutambika janza lyakwe okumugwasya kunyamuka. Amane Pita wakaita bamukabafu abasalali boonse okubatondezya nguwe kali muumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Makani aaya akasabalangana taindi lya Jopa lyoonse abantu banji bakasyoma mu Mwami. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Mpoonyina Pita wakakala kwamazuba manji mu Jopa. Wasikilide kumwaalumi walikwiitwa kuteeti Simoni, sikukubula matobo.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Koneliyasi Waita Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kwali umwi mwaalumi mutaindi pati lya Sizaliya walikwiitwa kuteeti Koneliyasi, ooyo wali mweendelezi wenkamu yabasilumamba be Loma yalikwiitwa kuteeti, “Lumamba lwe Itali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ooyu mwaalumi omukwasyi wakwe balilipede ape walikuyoowa Leza. Walikugwasya bapengede loko okukomba nako enako. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Bumwi buzuba awoola lyatatu musikati, wakabona cilengaano, oomo mucilengaano wakabona mungelo wa Leza kayoobuza kulinguwe okuteeti, “Koneliyasi!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Mpoonyina Koneliyasi kayoowede loko wakadongomwena mungelo okutaba kuteeti, “Ategwaanzi Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Mpoonyina mungelo wakataba kuteeti, “Kukomba kwako okugwasya bapengede Leza wazitambula ape caba ciyeezyo kuli Leza! <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Iino tuma bamwi baalumi ku Jopa kuteeti bakaite mwaalumi uutegwa Saimoni Pita. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ooyu mwaalumi mweenzu wa Saimoni, sikukubula matobo, ukala kumbali olwizi lupati.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Mungelo naakainka, Koneliyasi wakaita babelesi bakwe bobile osilumamba ngwaalikusyoma, walimukombi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Mpoonyina wakabaambila zyoonse zyakacitika amane wakabatuma ku Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Buzuba bwakacilila musikati bantu mbakatuma Koneliyasi nibacili munzila aafwiifwi etaindi, Pita wakatanta aciluli cengʼanda kuyookomba. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kuzwaawo wakazoofwa nzala okuyanda kulya kono nibacili kubamba zyokulya, wakabona cilengaano. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Wakabona Julu kalijuka mpoonyina wakabona cintu cilimbuli sila pati kaciyobuselemuka, kaciyobweetwa ansi mumabazu one.<figure style="fig" alt="Peter on the roof and the vision of the unclean animals" file="wa03963b.tif" size="col" ref="10:11">Pita kali Ataleeciluli Wabona Cilengaano Cabanyama Batasalali</figure> <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Muleeci cintu, mwalimisyobo yabanyama bamaulu one yoonse abamwi banyama bakokoba ape eziyuni zyomujulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Mpoonyina wakamvwa jwi kaliteeti, “Pita, nyamuka, jaya ulye!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Pita wakateeti, “Nee, Mwami! Sinabuzuba ndalya cintu Mulawo wa Majuda cewaamba kuteeti tacisalali ape cilisofweede.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Kono jwi lyakaamba lwabili kaliteeti, “Leza caasalazya utacaambi kuteeti tacisalali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Eeci cakacitika tweendo totatwe. Kumane eeci cintu cakatolwa kujulu mpoonya-mpoonya.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Pita naacilikulibuzya zyecaamba cilengaano eeci, baalumi bakatumwa o Koneliyasi bakasika. Kono kabatana kusika, baluujesi kubuzya ngʼanda ya Saimoni sikukubula matobo mpoyakabede. Mpoonyina bakiijana okwiima amanjililo. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Bakaita kababuzya na kwalimweenzu walikuteegwa Saimoni Pita wakasikilide fateni.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Pita naacili kuyaandoola kuziba cecaamba cilengaano, Muuya wa Leza wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Bona! Baalumi botatwe balimukukuyandoola. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Nyamuka, seluka, utacedwi, mpoonyina wiinke ambabo kaambo ndabatuma.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Mpoonyina Pita wakaseluka okwaamba kuteeti, “Ndime ngomulangoola. Ino mwazidaanzi?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bakateeti, “Koneliyasi mweendelezi wabasilumamba nguwatutuma. Muntu uulikabotu uuyoowa Leza, uukutekwa a Majuda boonse. Mungelo uusalala wakamwaambila kuteeti akwiite kungʼanda yakwe kuteegwa azoomvwe zyoyanda kuzaamba.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Mpoonyina Pita wakabatambula mungʼanda okubabamba busiku buya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Mpoonyina nibwakaca, wakalibambila okwiinka ambabo antoomwi abamwi basyomi boku Jopa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Buzuba bwakacilila bakaakusika ku Sizaliya. Koneliyasi walikubalindila, mane waitide becibbululu bakwe abeenzinyina. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Pita naalikunjila mungʼanda ya Koneliyasi, Koneliyasi wakamucingoozya amane wakamufugamina okumukomba. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kono Pita wakamujata okumugwasya kwiima okumwaambila kuteeti, “Nyamuka! Amebo ndilimuntu feela mbuli ndiwe!” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Mpoonyina Pita wakazwida anembo kwaamboola o Koneliyasi kayoobunjila mungʼanda. Oomo mwaakaakujana bantu banji kababungene. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Mpoonyina Pita wakabaambila kuteeti, “Mulizi kuteeti tacili mumulawo Mujuda kusangana naanga kupotela wamasi. Kono Leza wanditondezya kuteeti nditayeeyeli muntu naanga womwi kuteegwa tasalali na ulisofweede. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Cindatakaka kuza nimwanditumina bantu. Iino amundaambile cimwandiitila.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koneliyasi wakataba kuteeti, “Mazuba one ainda, aliino nako njoonyina yokujolezya awoola lyatatu ndalikukomba mungʼanda yangu. Mpoonya-mpoonya ndakabona mwaalumi wakazweete zizwaato zibenya, kaimvwi kunembo lyangu. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Wakandaambila kuteeti, ‘Koneliyasi, Leza wakumvwa kukomba kwako ape wayeeya ambogwasilizya bapengede! <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Iino tuma bantu ku Jopa kuteegwa bakaite mwaalumi uteegwa Saimoni Pita, wakasikila kuli Saimoni sikukubula matobo uukala kumbali enkomwe yolwizi lupati.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Mpoonya-mpoonya ndakatuma bantu kuzookwiita ape cabota kuteeti weza. Iino toonse tulaano kubusyu bwa Leza kuteegwa tumvwe zyoonse zyaakulailila Mwami.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaamboola kwa Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Detilonomo 10:17</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina Pita wakateeti, “Iino nconzyo ndabona okuziba kuteeti Leza tasalululi bantu. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ulatambula boonse bamuyoowa okucita ziluleme kumisyobo yoonse. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Muleezi Makani Mabotu aayo ngaakatuma kubana Izilaili, kuteeti kuli luumuno muli Leza kwiindila muli Jesu Kilisitu Mwami waboonse. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mulizi zyakacitika Judiya yoonse, kutalikila mu Galileya, kuzwa nako lubbabbatizyo Joni ndwaalikukambooka nilwakacitika. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mulizi kuteeti Leza wakananika Jesu woku Nazaleta o Muuya Uusalala ape enguzu. Mpoonyina Jesu walikweendeendaanga kayobucita zibotu okuponya boonse balikudyaaminidwe o Dyabulosi kaambo Leza walaawe. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Swebo tobaapositola tulibakamboni bezintu zyoonse zyaakacita mu Jelusalemu omucisi coonse ca Majuda. Bakamujaya kwiindila mukumwaanzika aciingano. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Kono mubuzuba bwatatu Leza wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu okumuzumizya kuteeti alibonye. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Kono taakwe naakalibonya kubantu boonse, wakalibonya feela kulindiswe, tobakamboni Leza mbaakasalila limwi. Swebo twalikulya okunywaawe kuzwa naakabuka kubafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Mpoonyina wakatulailila kuteeti tukambooke kubantu okubacenjezya kuteeti ngonguwe Leza ngwaakasala kuba mwaatuzi wabaumi abafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Ngonguwe basinsimi boonse ngubalikwaamba kuteeti boonse basyoma mulinguwe zibi zyabo zizojatilwa kwiindila muzina lyakwe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bamasi Batambula Muuya Uusalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Pita naacilikwaamba majwi aaya, Muuya Uusalala wakeza kulaabo boonse bakaamvwa makani. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Basyomi be Cijuda bazide o Pita bakakomokwa loko kaambo Muuya Uusalala, cipego cizwa kuli Leza cakatilwa okuli Bamasi, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />kaambo bakabamvwa kabaamboola mumisyobo itazizilwe okulumbaizya Leza. Mpoonyina Pita wakateeti, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Iino mbubatambula Muuya Uusalala mbuli mbutwakuutambula, ngwani ukonzya kubakasya kubbabbatizigwa amaanzi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Mpoonyina Pita wakapa malailila okuteeti babbabbatizigwe muzina lya Jesu Kilisitu. Bamane, bakamukumbila kuteeti akalaabo mazuba maniini.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Bulunguluzi bwa Pita ku Mbungano yoku Jelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Iino baapositola abamwi basyomi balimucooko ca Judiya coonse bakamvwa kuteeti abo Bamasi bakaatambula majwaa Leza. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Mpoonyina Pita nakainka ku Jelusalemu, basyomi be Cijuda bakatalika kumutongooka <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />kabateeti, “Walimweenzu mungʼanda ya Bamasi batana palulwa mane wakalya ambabo.” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Mpoonyina Pita wakabalungulwida zyoonse mbuzyakacitika mumundandaanda kateeti,<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Nindalikukomba mutaindi lya Jopa, ndakabona cilengaano. Mucilengaano ndakabona cintu cilimbuli sila pati kaciyoobuselemuka kaciyoobweetwa ansi mumabbazu one kuzwa kujulu okuza kulindime. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nindakalanga mwateni, ndakabona mwali misyobo yabanyama bajesi maulu one bavubwa abomusaka, bakokoba abayuni. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Mpoonyina ndakamvwa jwi lyalikundaambila kuteeti, ‘Pita, nyamuka, jaya ulye.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ndakataba kuteeti, ‘Nee o Mwami, sinabuzuba ndalya cintu Mulawo wa Majuda cewaamba kuteeti tacisalali ape cilisofweede.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Kono jwi lyalikuzwa kujulu ape lyakateeti, ‘Utaambi cintu Leza caasalazya kuteeti tacisalali.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Eeci cakacitika tweendo totatwe, mpoonyina zyoonse zyakakwelelwa kujulu ape. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Mpoonyinaawo kwakasika baalumi botatwe angʼanda mpondalikukala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembo ajesi “putwalikukala” awa.</char></note>, bakatumwa kuzwa ku Sizaliya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muuya wa Leza wakandaambila kuteeti ndiinkaabo, nditazumboozyi kaambo kokuteeti mbamasi. Kuzwaawo, ndakainka antoomwi aaba bakwesu bali cisambomwe, mpoonyina twakaakunjila mungʼanda yomwaalumi wakatwiita. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Wakatwaambila mbwaakabona mungelo kaimvwi mungʼanda yakwe okumwaambila kuteeti, ‘Tuma bantu ku Jopa, bakaite mwaalumi uteegwa Saimoni Pita. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Nguuzeeta makani ambomukonzya kufutuka, yebo abengʼanda yako.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ndicitalika feela kwaamboola Muuya Uusalala wakabaselukila mboonyina mbuli mbakatuselukila kumatalikilo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Misebezi 1:5</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina ndakayeeya majwi ngakaamba Mwami kuteeti, ‘Joni walikubbabbatizya amaanzi kono nywebo muzoobbabbatizigwa o Muuya Uusalala.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Iino na Leza wakabapa cipego caakatupa nitwakasyoma mu Mwami Jesu Kilisitu, ino mebo ndakalini kuteeti ndisinkilizye Leza?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Nibakamvwa namu, bakaleka kutongooka okutalika kulumbaizya Leza kabateeti, “Twabona kuteeti Leza a Bamasi wabazumizya kweempwa okuboobuumi butamani.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbungano yoku Antiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Misebezi 8:1-4</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iino basyomi bakasabalangana nako yamapenzi nakajaigwa Sitivini bamwi bakeenda mane kucilalaanda ca Fonisiya, bamwi ku Saipulasi abamwi ku Antiyoki yoku Siliya kabayobukambooka majwaa Leza ku Majuda feela. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Kono akati kabo kwali bamwi baalumi boku Saipulasi okutaindi pati lya Sailini bakeza ku Antiyoki okutalika kukambooka Makani Mabotu o Mwami Jesu ku Magiliki. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Nguzu zyo Mwami zyalaabo. Mpoonyina bantu banji bakasyoma okusandukila ku Mwami.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Bembungano yoku Jelusalemu nibakamvwa zyakacitika, bakatuma Bbanabbasi ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Naakasika okubona Leza mbwaakamvwida luzyalo bantu aabo wakabotelwa okubayumya-yumya boonse kuteeti bajatisye mu Mwami emyoyo yoonse. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Bbanabbasi walimwaalumi walikabotu, wazwide Muuya Uusalala olusyomo. Mpoonyina bantu banji bakeetwa ku Mwami.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Mpoonyina Bbanabbasi wakainka ku Tasisi kuyolangoola Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Naakamujana, wakamweeta ku Antiyoki. Mpoonyina bakakala kwateni mwaaka omwi kababungana abembungano okwiisya bantu banji. Ku Antiyoki basyomi kubakatalikila kwiitwa kuteeti bana Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Muciindi eeco bamwi basinsimi, bakeenda kuzwa ku Jelusalemu kwiinka ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Misebezi 21:10</ref>.</char></note> Umwi wabo walikwiitwa kuteeti Agabbasi, ooyo wakanyamuka okusinsima kwiinda munguzu zyo Muuya Uusalala kuteeti kuzooba nzala mpati nyika yoonse. Eezi zyakazuzikizigwa mubulelo bwa Kulodiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Mpoonyina basyomi bakamvwana kuteeti batumizye basyominyina mu Judiya lugwasyo, umwi oumwi mbuli mbwaalikukonzya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Mpoonyina bakacita namu, bakatumizya Saulu o Bbanabbasi zipego zyabo kubamaalu bembungano yoku Jelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Helodi Wapenzya Basyomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Muciindi eeco Mwami Helodi Agilipa wakajata bamwi basyomi bomumbungano kuteegwa abapenzye. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Wakajazya mwaapositola Jemusi esabule muzyalwanyina o Joni. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Mpoonyina Helodi naakabona kuteeti eeci cakanoneezya ma Juda, wakaanzya o Pita. Eeci cakacitika nako yo mukiti we Cinkwa Citakwe Mumena. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kulonga 12:1-27</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Helodi wakajata Pita okumubika muntolongo, oomo mwaakaabwa mumaanza ootubunga tone twabasikalumamba bali bone kabunga akabunga kuteegwa kabamulindilila. Helodi wali kuyanda kweeta Pita kuzoomwaatula antangalala yainda Pasika. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Kono Pita naali muntolongo, mbungano yakamukombela kuli Leza loko.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mungelo Wagwisya Pita Muntolongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Ngoonyina masiku aalya Helodi naalikuyeeya kuteeti bwaca abeteke Pita, Pita walikoona kaangidwe maceeni obile akati kabasilumamba bobile. Bamwi balikulindilila kumanjililo entolongo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Mpoonya-mpoonya kwakalibonya mungelo wo Mwami, mpoonyina kwakamweka muntolongo. Kumane mungelo wakatikimuna Pita okumubusya kateeti, “Fwambaana! Nyamuka!” Kuzwaawo maceeni akaloka kumaanzaakwe. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Kumane, mungelo wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Anga lukanda lwako uzwaate amanyantelaako.” Mpoonyina wakacita mboonya namu. Ape mungelo wakateeti, “Iino zwaata jansi lyako undicilile.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Mpoonyina Pita wakazwa muntolongo okucilila mungelo, kono taakwe naakaziba kuteeti zyaalikucita mungelo zyalikucitika nconzyo, kono walikuyeyaanga calicilengaano feela. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Nibakaindilila balindizi bokusaanguna ababili, bakasika kumulyango wezibulo utozya mutaindi pati, mulyango wakalijula aulike. Kuzwaawo bakazwaanze okutalika kweenda mumugwagwa. Mpoonya-mpoonya mungelo wakamusiya. <figure style="fig" alt="Peter's miraculous escape from prison" file="lb00335b.tif" size="col" ref="12:10">Pita Wagwisigwa Camaleele Muntolongo</figure><verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Mpoonyina Pita naakaziba zyakacitika kulinguwe, wakateeti, “Iino ndaziba nconzyo kuteeti Mwami watuma mungelo wakwe kuzoondifutula kunguzu zya Helodi okuli zyoonse Majuda zibalikuyeeyela kuteeti inga zyacitika.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Pita naakaziba namu, wakainka kungʼanda ya Maliya banyina Joni Maako, ooko kwabungene bantu banji balikukomba. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Naakakonkomona kucitendele celabba, umwi musimbi mubelesi walikwiitwa kuteeti Loda wakeza kuteeti azoobone walikoodisya. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Mpoonyina naakaliziba jwi lya Pita, wakabotelwa loko, taakwe naakajula citendele kono wakazuzila mukati kuyaambila bantu boonse kuteeti, “Pita ulaamulyango!” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Kono bakamwaambila kuteeti, “Ulisondokede yebo!” Mpoonyina naakazumanana bakaamba kuteeti, “Mungelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamwi Majuda beeyo nako balikusyoma kuteeti Leza wakatuma mungelo kuteeti kakwabilila umwi oumwi wabantu bakwe, ape okuteeti ooyo mungelo inga walibonya okukozyanya omuntu ngwakwabilila. Mweendi awa basyomi balikuyeeya kuteeti mungelo wa Pita weza kuzobaambila kuteeti Pita wafwa.</char></note> wa Pita.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Iino Pita wakaindilizya kukonkomona. Mpoonyina nibakajula citendele okumubona bakakomokwa loko. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Kuzwaawo wakanyamuna janza lyakwe kuteegwa baumune, amane wakabalungulwida Mwami mbwaakamugwisya muntolongo okwaamba kuteeti, “Mumwaambile Jemusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooyu Jemusi uyeeyelwa kuteeti walimuzyalwanyina wo Mwami Jesu, wakazoba musololi uzizilwe mumbungano yoku Jelusalemu (mubone 15:13, 21:18).</char></note> abakwesu bamwi zyacitika.” Amane, Pita wakainka kucibaka cimwi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Nibwakaca kwali kulyangana kutalikomeneni akati kabasilumamba alizyakacitika kuli Pita. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Mpoonyina Helodi wakalailila kuteeti alangoolwe kono taakwe nibakamujana. Mpoonyina Helodi wakabazekisya balindizi okulailila kuteeti bajaigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Kuzwaawo Helodi wakazwa ku Judiya okuyookala-kala mu Sizaliya.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Helodi Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Iino Helodi wakanyemena bantu bomutaindi pati lya Taila elya Sidoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuzwangana kwa Helodi abantu boku Taila aboku Sidoni kwakamupa kuteeti akasye kubauzizya zilyo zili mbuli maila. Bantu bakasalwa kuzwa ku Taila oku Sidoni bakasoleka kweeta luumuno kuteegwa batalike kuula okuuzizyana aboku Judiya, kaambo balikuyanda zilyo kuzwa kulimbabo.</char></note>, mpoonyina bo bakainka antoomwi kuyoobonana awe. Bakanjilila kuli Bbalasitasi mugwasyi wo mwami kukumbila kuteeti kube luumuno kaambo cisi cabo calikujana zilyo mucisi co mwami.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Mubuzuba bwakasalidwe, Helodi wakazwaata zyobwami okukala acibbula cakwe co bwami okupa majwi kubantu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Mpoonyina bantu bakoongolola kabateeti, “Eeli ndijwi lya Leza kutali lyo muntu!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Mpoonyinaawo mungelo wo Mwami wakapa kuteeti Helodi aciswe kaambo taakwe naakapa likute kuli Leza. Mpoonyina wakaligwa amabuku okufwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Kono majwi a Leza akazwidaanembo kumwaigwa mpoonyina basyomi bakavula.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Kuzwaawo Bbanabbasi o Saulu nibakamanisya musebezi wabo mu Jelusalemu, bakapilukila ku Antiyoki okubwezelezya o Joni Maako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Bbanabbasi o Saulu Basalwa Okutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Iino mumbungano yoku Antiyoki kwali basinsimi abamayi mbuli Bbanabbasi, Simiyoni, walikwiitwa kuteeti Muntu Usiya, Lusiyasi woku Sailini, Maneni, wakakomenena mungʼanda yomwi o mwami Helodi Antipasi, o Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Nibacilikukomba Mwami okuliimya kulya, Muuya Uusalala wakabaambila kuteeti, “Amundiketele Bbanabbasi o Saulu kuteeti bakacite musebezi ngundakabaitila.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Mpoonyina nibakamanisya kuliimya kulya okukomba bakababika maanzaabo okubatuma.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Bbanabbasi mu Saipulasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Iino Bbanabbasi o Saulu kabatumidwe o Muuya Uusalala bakainka ku Selusiya, kuzwaawo bakaakutanta mugolo okwiinka ku Saipulasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Nibakaakusika ansumbu ya Saipulasi aali taindi pati lya Salamisi Bbanabbasi o Saulu bakatalika kukambooka muzikombelo zya Majuda. Bakaloo Joni Maako ooyo walikubagwasilizya.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bakaizinguluka nsumbu yoonse ya Saipulasi mane okuyoosika ku Pafosi ooko kubakaakujana mwaalumi wezina lya Bba Jesu Mujuda, wali musinsimi mubeji wamasalamusi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Wali mwenzinyina wo mweendelezi wecooko ca Saipulasi wezina lya Sejiyasi Paulasi ooyo walaamaano loko. Mweendelezi ooyu wakaita Bbanabbasi o Saulu kuteegwa azomvwe majwaa Leza. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kono Elimasi, mu Cigiliki caamba simasalamusi, wakasola kubasinkilizya kuteeti mweendelezi ataboo lusyomo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Kono Saulu, ape uteegwa Paulu, wazwide Muuya Uusalala, wakamudongomwena <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />okumwaambila kuteeti, “Uzwide misyobo yobubeji yoonse, ezicito zibi, omwanaa Dyabulosi yebo ulwana zyoonse ziluleme. Nako yoonse usola kucinca zyenconzyo zya Mwami kuteeti zilibonyaanga zyobubeji! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Iino bona, janza lya Mwami lileza inaawa alindiwe, mpoonyina ulaba moofu ape toyooliboni zuba kweciindi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Mpoonyinaawo gubilizi omudima zyakasika alinguwe. Wakeendeenda okutambika janza kuyandoola wokuteeti amuzulwide. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Mweendelezi naakabona zyakacitika, wakasyoma kaambo wakakomokwa loko kuziisyo zyo Mwami.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Bbanabbasi mu Antiyoki yoku Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Mpoonyina Paulu ababelesinyina bakanyamuka kuzwa kutaindi pati lya Pafosi okwiinka kutaindi pati lya Palega ookuya kucooko ca Pamfaliya mumugolo, kono we Joni Maako wakabasiya okupiluka ku Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Kono bo bakazumanana kuzwa ku Pega mane bakaakusika ku Antiyoki mu Pisidiya. Mpoonyina mu Nsabata bakainka okuyookala mucikombelo. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Nikwakamana kubalwa bbuku lya Mozesi amalembo aabasinsimi, beendelezi be cikombelo bakatuma majwi kuli Paulu o Bbanabbasi okuteeti, “Nobakwesu na muli amajwi okuyumya bantu inga mwaamba.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakanyamuka okutambika janza kuteegwa baumune okwaamba kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Nobana Izilailima anywebo Bamasi boonse nomuyowa Leza amuswiilizye! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kulonga 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">12:51</ref>.</char></note>Leza waaba bantu ba Izilaili wakasala basikale besu okupa kuteeti bavule okubeenguzu eciyaciindi nibalikukala mu Ijipiti. Mpoonyina wakazoobagwisya mwateni enguzu zipati. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Myeelwe 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Detilonomo 1:31</ref>.</char></note>Wakalikakatizya kubabamba munkanda kwe myaaka ili makumi one. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Detilonomo 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Joshwa 14:1</ref>.</char></note> Wakasinyoona misyobo yabantu bomu Kenani ili ciloba okupa nyika yabo ku bantu bakwe kuteegwa bakone. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Ba Betesi 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Samuele 3:20</ref>.</char></note> Zyoonse eezi zyakatola myaaka yatikasike myaanda yone amakumi osanwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Mpoonyina Leza wakabapa baatuzi kuteegwa babeendelezye kusikila mane kuciindi ca Samiyele musinsimi. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Samuele 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10:21</ref>.</char></note> Kuzwaawo bana ba Izilaili bakakumbila Leza kuteeti abape mwami, mpoonyina wakabapa Saulu, mwanaa Kishi womusyobo wa Benjamini. Saulu wakabalela kwe myaaka ili makumi one. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Samuele 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Intembauzyo 89:20</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Leza naakamugwisya Saulu abwami, wakabika Deveti. Leza mukujatikizya Deveti, wakateeti, ‘Ndajana kuteeti Deveti mwanaa Jesi ngomuntu undibotelezya, uuyoocita zyoonse zyendiyanda.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kuzwa kulunyungu looyu mwaalumi Leza wakabeetela Jesu mufutuli ngwaakabasyomezezye bana Izilaili. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Maako 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luka 3:3</ref>.</char></note> Jesu katana talika musebezi wakwe, kwali mwaalumi wezina lya Joni wali kukambookela bana Izilaili kuteeti beempwe kuzibi zyabo okubbabbatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Joni 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mateyo 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Maako 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luka 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Joni 1:27</ref>.</char></note> Iino Joni naalikuyanda kumanizya musebezi wakwe, wakabuzya kuteeti, ‘Ino muyeeya kuteeti ndime ni? Tandiinsi ooyo ngomulangila, kono kwali mupati, uuza musule lyangu. Tandeeleli kumwaangununa zinyantela zyakwe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Nobakwesu, bolunyungu lwa Abbulahamu anywebo Bamasi nomuyoowa Leza, kuulindiswe makani oolufutuko aaya kwaakatumwa! <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Bantu bali kupona mu Jelusalemu abasololi babo taakwe nibakaziba kuteeti Jesu ngonguwe ngubalikwaamba basinsimi. Kono bakamugambika mulandu. Mukucita namu bakazuzikizya zyakaamba basinsimi zibalwaanga Nsabata e Nsabata. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Mateyo 27:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13-14">Maako 15:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luka 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Joni 19:15</ref>.</char></note> Nekuba kuteeti taakwe nibakamujana o mulandu Jesu wokuteeti ajaigwe, bakakumbila Pilato kuteeti ajazye Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joni 19:38-42</ref>.</char></note> Nibakamanisya kucita zyoonse zyaamba Malembo alinguwe, bakamugwiysa aciingano okumubika mucuumbwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kono Leza wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Misebezi 1:3</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina kwamazuba manji wakalibonya kulaabo bakeenda anguwe kuzwa ku Galileya kwiinka ku Jelusalemu. Iino aba bantu bakaba bakamboni bakwe kubantu besu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Intembauzyo 2:7</ref>.</char></note> Iino swebo tulaano kweeta Makani Mabotu kulindinwe okuteeti, Leza zyaakasyomezya ku matata wazicita kulindiswe tobana babo kwiinda mukubusya Jesu kuzwa kubafu. Mbuli mbocilembedwe muntembauzyo yabili kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:32-33">‘Uli mwanaangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:32-33">sunu ndaba Uso.’<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Izaya 55:3</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ape Leza wakasyomezya kumubusya kuzwa kubafu kateeti tayooboli mucuumbwe naakateeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ndiyookupa zisyomezyo zisalala zisyomeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">zindakasyomezya Deveti.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Intembauzyo 16:10</ref>.</char>
    </note> Cibaka centembauzyo cimbi caamba kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Toyoolekeleli Uusalala wako kuteeti abole mucuumbwe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Eeci tacilimukwaambi Deveti, kaambo Deveti nakamana kucita musebezi wa Leza muciindi cakwe, wakafwa okuzikwa wakazikwa abasikale bakwe okubola wakabola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Kono ecci taakwe nicakacitika kuli ooyo Leza ngwakabusya kubafu. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />Noonse nobakwesu mweelede kuziba kuteeti makani okulekelelwa zibi akambookwa kuli ndinwe kwiinda muli Jesu, ape mweelede kuziba kuteeti, kufumbwa wasyoma muli nguwe ulalulamikwa kuzibi zyoonse zyatalikukonzya kululamikwa omulawo wa Mozesi. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Amumamele kuteegwa zibakaamba basinsimi zitakamucitikili. Bakateeti,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Habakuku 1:5</ref>.</char>
    </note> ‘Amulange, nobasikufubazika amukomokwe okufwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">kaambo sunu ndilacita cintu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">cemutakonzi kusyoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">naanga umwi amupandulwide cico!’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Mpoonyina Paulu o Bbanabbasi nibali kuzwa mucikombelo, bantu bakabakumbila kuteeti ensunda yali kucilila bazooze mu Nsabata, kuteegwa bazobakaambookele aleezi zintu ape. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Mpoonyina bantu nibakazwa mucikombelo Majuda a Bamasi banji balikukomba Leza bakacilila Paulu o Bbanabbasi. Baapositola bakayumya-yumya bantu aaba okubaambila kuteeti bakalilile muluzyalo lwa Leza.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Nsabata yakacilila bunji bwabantu mutaindi bakabungana kuswiilizya jwi lyo Mwami. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Majuda nibakabona kuvula kwabantu bakaba omunyono mpoonyina bakatalika kukazya zyoonse zyalikwaamba Paulu okumutuka. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Kono Paulu o Bbanabbasi bakataba obusicamba kabateeti, “Majwii aa Leza alikweelede kukambookwa kulindinywe cokusaanguna. Kono mbokunga mwaakaka okulyaatula kuteeti tamuyandiki buumi butamani, tulamusiya okwiinka ku Bamasi, <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Izaya 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>.</char></note> kaambo eeci caakatulailila Mwami naakateeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ndakakubika kuba mumuni ku Bamasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">kuteegwa nyika yoonse ifutulwe.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Bamasi nibakavwa eeci, bakabotelwa okulumbaizya makani o Mwami ape aabo bakasalidwe kuba obuumi butamani bakaba basyomi. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mpoonyina jwi lyo Mwami lyakamwaigwa mucilalaanda coonse mbocizulwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kono Majuda bakayunga banakazi balikukomba Leza okukutekwa abaalumi basololi betaindi kuteeti bapenzye Paulu o Bbanabbasi. Mpoonyina bakatanda baapositola mucilalaanda cabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mateyo 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Maako 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luka 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref>.</char></note> Maapositola bakakunkumuna suko lyali kumaulaabo kutondezya kuteeti tabacikwe ntuso ambabo. Mpoonyina bakainka ku Ikoniyamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Basyomi boku Antiyoki bakabotelwa loko okuzula Muuya Uusalala.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulu o Bbanabbasi Mutaindi Pati lya Ikoniyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Cakacitika mu Antiyoki cintu comwi ecakacitika mu Ikoniyamu Paulu o Bbanabbasi nibakainka ku cikombelo ca Majuda. Bakakambooka cenguzu cokuteeti mbunga mpati ya Majuda a Bamasi bakaba basyomi. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Kono Majuda bakakaka kusyoma bakayunga Bamasi kuteegwa babukile Paulu o Bbanabbasi. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Mpoonyina maapositola bakakala kwateni kwe nako ndamfu, kabakambooka cabusicamba kwiindila mukusepa Mwami. Anguwe Mwami wakatondezya kuteeti Makani ooluzyalo lwakwe ngenconzyo kwiinda mukubapa nguzu zyokucita zitondezyo zyamaleele ezikomosya. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Bantu bomutaindi bakaanzaana mukuteeti bamwi bali kubbazu lya Majuda, bamwi kubbazu lya maapositola.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Mpoonyina Bamasi a Majuda antoomwi abasololi babo bakayeeya kuteeti bapenzye maapositola okubapotoola mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Kono nibakaimvwa nkani eeyi maapositola, bakacijila kucilalaanda coku Likaniya, mumataindi mapati a Lisitila o Delebbe okucilalaanda caazingulukide. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Ooko kubakaakuzumanana kukambooka Makani Mabotu.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Bbanabbasi mu Lisitila omu Delebbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Iino kwakali mwaalumi mu Lisitila walimulema watakeenda kuzwa naakazyalwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Walikede kaswiilizya zyaali kwaamba Paulu. Mpoonyina Paulu wakamudongomwena okubona kuteeti waloolusyomo lokuponesigwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Kumane, Paulu wakamwaambila atala lye jwi lwakwe kateeti, “Nyamuka, wiime amaulaako.” Mpoonyina ooyo mwaalumi wakasotoka okutalika kweenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mbunga yabantu niyaka bona Paulu caakacita, bakatalika koongolola mucisyobo cabana likaniya kuteeti, “Baleza baba mbuli bantu okutuselukila!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bakapa Bbanabbasi izina lya leza wama Giliki lyokuteeti Zeyusi o Paulu lyokuteeti Helemesi kaambo nguwali mwaamboozi mupati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akati kotuleza twa Magiliki, Zeyasi wali mwami mpoonyina Hemesi wali ka leza kalikweeta makani kuzwa kuli Zeyasi otumbi tuleza.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mupaizi we ngʼanda ya leza Zeyusi eeyo yakalaanze e taindi, wakeeta bapoho amaluba-luba alukidwe antoomwi kumanjililo, kuteegwa we amabunga abantu bape zituuzyo kumaapositola.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Kono Bbanabbasi o Paulu nibakamvwa zyalikucitika, bakayaola zizwaato zyabo okuzuzila mubantu kaboongolola kuteeti, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kulonga 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Intembauzyo 146:6</ref>.</char></note>“Nobantu, ino niinzi nemulimukucita namu? Aswibo tuli bantu feela mbuli ndinwe! Twakazida kukambooka Makani Mabotu kuteegwa muzwe kuzintu zitakwe ntuso, musandukile kuli Leza upona, wakalenga julu enyika o lwizi ezintu zili mwateni. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ciindi wakazumizizye nywebo Bamasi boonse kucita zimwalikuyanda, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />kono taakwe naakalekede kulitondezya we obubotu bwakwe mbuli kumupa mvula kuzwa kujulu ezisyango muciindi ceelede, kumupa zyokulya okubotezya myoyo yenu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Nekuba kuteeti baapositola bakaamba majwi ali namu, cakasyupa ku balesya bantu kupa zituzyo kulimbabo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Kwakasika Majuda bamwi kuzwida ku Antiyoki yoku Pisidiya oku Ikoniyamu, bakayunga bantu banji okupotoola Paulu mabwe mpoonyina bakamukwelela anze etaindi kubonaanga wafwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kono basyomi nibakamubunganina wakabuka okupiluka mutaindi. Nibwakacha Paulu o Bbanabbasi bakainka ku Delebbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Bbanabbasi Bapiluka ku Antiyoki yoku Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulu o Bbanabbasi bakakambooka Makani Mabotu mu Delebbe, okupakuteeti bantu banji basanduke kuba basyomi. Mpoonyina bakapiluka ku Lisitila, ku Ikoniyamu oku Antiyoki yoku Pisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bakayumya-yumya okukulwaizya basyomi kuteeti bazumanane mulusyomo okubaambila kuteeti, “Tweelede kunjila mu Bwami bwa Leza kwiindila mumapenzi manji.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mumbungano zyoonse bakasala bamaalu, bakababika mumaanzaa Leza ngubali kusyoma kwiinda mukukomba okuliimya kulya.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Mpoonyina bakainda mu Pisidiya mane baakusika ku Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Mu Pelega bakaakukambooka majwaa Leza, mpoonyina bakaselela kwiinka ku Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kuzwaawo bakazubuka kupiluka ku Antiyoki yoku Siliya, kuwakatalikilide musinzo wabo. Kokuko kubakabikilwa muluzyalo lwa Leza kuteeti bacite musebezi ooyu ngubamanisya iino.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Nibakasika ku Antiyoki bakabunganya bantu bembungano antoomwi okubaambila zyoonse Leza zyaakacita kwiinda mulimbabo ape ambwaakajula nzila yolusyomo okuli Bamasi. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Mpoonyina bakakala mu Antiyoki abasyomi kweciindi cilamfu.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Muswaangano woku Jelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levitiko 12:3</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iino bamwi baalumi bakazwa ku Judiya kuza ku Antiyoki, bakatalika kwiisya basyomi kuteeti, “Tamukonzya kufutulwa, aati mwapalulwa kweelana o Mulawo wa Mozesi.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Mpoonyina Paulu o Bbanabbasi bakakazyanya loko aaba bantu, cokuteeti mbungano yakasala Paulu o Bbanabbasi abamwi basyomi kuteegwa bainke ku Jelusalemu kuyoobuzya maapositola abamaalu ankani eeyi.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Mpoonyina mbungano yakababambila musinzo wabo okubatuma. Iino nibalikwiinda mu Fonisiya o mu Samaliya bakalungulula mubulamfu Bamasi mbubakasandukila kuli Leza, eeci cakababotela loko basyomi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Nibakasika ku Jelusalemu, bakatambulwa abaapositola abamaalu embungano yoonse, mpoonyina bakalungulula zyoonse Leza zyaakacita kwiinda mulimbabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Kono bamwi basyomi balikuzwa kukabunga ka Bafalisi nibakamwva bulunguluzi bwa Bbanabbasi o Paulu bakaima okwaamba kuteeti, “Bamasi beelede kupalulwa okulaililwa kuteeti kabacilila Mulawo wa Mozesi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Mpoonyina baapositola abamaalu bakaswaangana kuteegwa balanganye nkani eeyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Misebezi 10:1-43</ref>.</char></note> Nibakaambozyanya kwenako ndamfu ankani eeyi, Pita wakanyamuka okwaamba kuteeti, “Nobazyalwama, imwi nakoi Leza walindisalide akati kenu okundituma ku Bamasi kuteeti ndikabakambookele Makani Mabotu kuteegwa ambabo bamvwe okusyoma. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Misebezi 10:44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">2:4</ref>.</char></note> Leza uzi mizeezo yabantu boonse wakabatambula. Wakacitondezya eeci kulindiswe kwiindila mukubapa Muuya Uusalala mbuli mbwaakacita okulindiswe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Taakwe lwindano ndwaakatondezya alindiswe aalimbabo. Wakasalazya myoyo yabo kaambo bakasyoma. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Iino niinzi nemuyanda kusunka Leza kwiinda mukubika Bamasi basyomi jokwe munsingo nditwakakacilwa kunyamuna swebo abasikale besu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Nee! Tusyoma kuteeti toonse tufutulwa munzila yoomwi, kwiinda muluzyalo lo Mwami Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Mbunga yoonse yakaumuna zii, kaiswilizya Bbanabbasi o Paulu nibalikupa bumboni bwezitondezyo zyamaleleele ezikomosya zyalikucita Leza kwiindila mulimbabo akati ka Bamasi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Nibakamana kwaamboola, Jemusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwendi ooyu Jemusi walimuzyalwanyina wo Mwami Jesu ape wali musololi uzizilwe mumbungano yoku Jelusalemu.</char></note> wakateeti, “Amundimvwe nobazyalwama! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Saimoni wazwaa kulungulula Leza mbwaakasaanguna kutondezya luyando lwakwe ku Bamasi kwiindila mukusala bamwi akatikabo kuteegwa babe bakwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Majwi abasinsimi alazuminizyanya eeci, mbuli mbwaamba mumalembo kuteeti,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amosi 9:11-12</ref>.</char>
    </note> ‘Kuzwaawo ndizoopiluka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">okuzooyakulula bwami bwa Deveti bwakawide mbuli teente.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ndizooyakulula matongo ambubo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">okuzoobubukulusya,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />kuteegwa abamwi bantu boonse bazooyandoole Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">kokuteeti Bamasi boonse mbindakaita kuba bangu.’<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Oobu mbwaamba Mwami wakayubununa zintu eezi ciindi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Jemusi wakazumanana kateeti, “Muzeezo wangu ngokuteeti tutapenzyi Bamasi balimukusandukila kuli Leza. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Kulonga 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Levitiko 18:6-23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">17:10-16</ref>.</char></note> Kono atubalembele lugwalo lokubalailila kuteeti, batanoolyi zilyo zyakatuuzigwa kumituni, bataciti bumambe okutalya nyama yakasinwa ape okutalya gazi. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kuzwa ciindi ooyu Mulawo wa Mozesi ulakambookwa mumataindi oonse ape ulabalwa Nsabata e Nsabata muzikombelo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lugwalo Lokubasyomi Bamasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Mpoonyina baapositola abamaalu antoomwi embungano yoonse bakazuminana kusala baalumi kuzwa akati kabo okubatuma ku Antiyoki antoomwi o Paulu ape o Bbanabbasi. Bakasala baalumi bobile akati kabasololi babasyomi, Judasi walikwiitwa kuteeti Bbasabbasi o Sailasi <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />okubatuma o lugwalo lwalikwaamba kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Swebo tobazyalwanyoko tobapositola abamaalu twamulumelesya nobazyalwama Bamasi nomukala mu Antiyoki, mu Siliya omu Silisiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Twakamvwa kuteeti bamwi bakazwa akati kesu okumunyonganya okumukatazya mumizeezo yenu eziisyo zyabo nekuba kuteeti taakwe nitwakabatuma. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Cecico eeco cotwabunganina antoomwi okuba omuzeezo omwi wokuteeti tusale baalumi bamwi kuteegwa tubatume kulindinywe. Balazida antoomwi abayandisi besu Bbanabbasi o Paulu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />aba mbaalumi bakaaba maumaabo kaambo komusebezi wo Mwami wesu Jesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Twatuma Judasi o Sailasi lwabo kuteegwa bamulungulwide makani aaya. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Cakabotela Muuya Uusalala aswibo kuteegwa tutamubiki mukuli umwi kunze kweeyi milawo yeelede. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Mutalyi zilyo zyakatuuzigwa kumituni, mutalyi gazi, naanga nyama yabanyama bakasinwa, mutaciti bumambe. Muyoocita kabotu mwaakuligwisya mukuzicita eezi. Mupone kabotu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Mpoonyina basyomi mu Jelusalemu bakatuma aaba baalumi bone ku Antiyoki. Nibakasika kuya, bakakubunganya basyomi boonse okubapa lugwalo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Bantu nibakalubala bakabotelwa loko kaambo kamajwi alikubayumya-yumya. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Judasi o Sailasi lwabo bali basinsimi, bakatola nako ndamfu mukuyumya-yumya okukulwaizya basyomi mulusyomo. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Nibakakala-kala kwateni, basyomi bakabapilusya muluumuno ku Jelusalemu kulaabo balikubatumide. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Kono Sailasi wakasala kusyaala ookuya.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi mabbuku taajesi kancali ka 34</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Kono Paulu o Bbanabbasi bakasyaala mu Antiyoki kabayiisya okukambooka jwi lyo Mwami antoomwi abamwi banji.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Bbanabbasi Baanzaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Nikwakainda mazuba mace Paulu wakaambila Bbanabbasi kuteeti, “Atupilukile tukapotele basyomi mumataindi oonse mutwakakambooka jwi lyo Mwami, tukabone pobeendela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Mpoonyina Bbanabbasi wakayanda kubwezelezya o Joni Maako, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Misebezi 13:13</ref>.</char></note> kono Paulu wakakaka kaambo kokuteeti Joni Maako wakapiluka okubasiya mu Pamfiliya, taakwe naakazumanana kubeleka ambabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Bakakazyana loko cokuteeti mane bakaanzaana. Bbanabbasi wakabweza Maako okuzubukila ku Saipulusi, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />kono Paulu wakasala Sailasi mpoonyina basyomi bakamubika muluzyalo lo Mwami, bamane bakainka. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Wakainda mucooko ca Siliya eca Silisiya, kayoobuyumya-yumya mbungano.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti Wasangana Paulu o Sailasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakainka ku Delebbe oku Lisitila, ooko kwakali musyomi walikwiitwa kuteeti Timoti. Banyina bali basyomi be Cijuda kono baisi bali Magiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Boonse basyomi bomu Lisitila omu Ikoniyamu balikwaamba zintu zibotu ali Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulu walikuyanda kumubwezelezya mpoonyina wakamupalula. Wakacita namu kaambo boonse basyomi be Cijuda balikukala muzibaka eezyo balizi kuteeti isi wa Timoti wali Mugiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Nibalikuyoobwiinda mumataindi oonse bali kuyoobupa basyomi malailile aakazuminanwa abaapositola abamaalu boku Jelusalemu okubalailila kuteeti kabaacilizya malailile aaya. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mpoonyina bantu be mbungano bakayumisigwa mulusyomo okuvula buzuba obuzuba.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cilengaano Caakabona Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Mpoonyina bakainda mucilalaanda ca Filigiya eca Galatiya kaambo Muuya Uusalala wakabakasya kukambooka majwaa Leza mucooko ca Eziya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciindi eco, izina lya Eziya lyalikwaamba cooko calikulelwa a Maloma. Calikupana munyinza o lwizi lupati lwa Egeni kumbo ape o lwizi lupati luteegwa lwizi Lusiya kunyika, mpoonyina o lwizi lupati lwa Mediteleniyani kumusanza. Bunji bwecico bwali bwe cisi sunu ciitwa kuteeti Teki.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Nibakasika kumunyinza wecooko ca Misiya bakasoleka kunjila mucooko ca Bitiniya kono Muuya wa Jesu wakabakasya. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Mpoonyina bakainda mu Misiya okwiinka ku Tilowasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Masiku aayo Paulu wakaba ecilengaano, oomo mwaakabona muntu woku Masedoniya kaimvwi, kamukombelezya kuteeti, “Koza ku Masedoniya, uzootugwasye!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paulu mbwaakamanina feela kuba ecilengaano eci, twakalibambila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciindi eeco Luka wakasangana o Paulo, antoomwi o Sailasi o Timoti. Iino Luka mbwalimulembi we bbuku lye Misebezi ya Baapositola, wakatalika kulemba kuteeti “swebo.”</char></note> kwiinka ku Masedoniya kaambo twakabona kuteeti Leza wakatwiitila kukambookela bantu bookuya Makani Mabotu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusanduka kwa Lidiya womu Taindi Pati lya Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Twakainka o mugolo mupati kuzwa ku Tilowasi okwiinka olwizi-olwizi ku Samotulasi, buzuba bwakacilila twakasika ku Niyapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kuzwa ooko twakainka ku Filipi lyalitaindi pati liyandisi mucooko ca Masedoniya mwalikukala ba Maloma banji. Twakakala kwateni tuzuba-zuba. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Mu Nsabata twakazwa mutaindi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki, “zitendele zyamanjililo zye taindi pati.” Taindi pati lyazingulukidwe obwaanda. Iino Kwali manjililo ngibali kubelesya bantu kukunjila okuzwa mutaindi pati. Manjililo ajesi zitendele zidiide. Eeyi milyango yalikwiitwa kuteeti “milyango yetaindi pati.” Paulu abeenzinyina bakainda aluumwi weeyi milyango kukwiinka kumulonga.</char></note> okwiinka kumbali o mulonga, ooko kutwalikuyeeya kuteeti inga twajana cibaka kobaswanaana Majuda kukukomba. Twakakala ansi o kutalika kwamboola abanakazi balikubungene kwateni.<figure style="fig" alt="City wall with city gate" file="co01450b.tif" size="col" ref="16:13">Bwaanda bwe Taindi Pati Ecitendele Cateni</figure> <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Umwi waabo bakatumvwa wali Lidiya woku Tiyatila wali sikuuzya masila omusyobo wecisombo adula loko. Wali mwanakazi wali kukomba Leza. Naalikuswiilizya, Mwami wakamujula moyo kuteegwa azitambule zyalikwaamba Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Naakamana kubbabbatizigwa antoomwi abengʼanda yakwe, wakatwiita kungʼanda yakwe, kateeti, “Amuze mukale mungʼanda yangu na mwazumina kuteeti nconzyo ndili musyomi wo Mwami.” Wakatukombelezya mane twazumina kwiinka kulinguwe.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Sailasi Basowelwa Muntolongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Bumwi buzuba katuyoobuya kucibaka cokukombela twakaswanwa o musimbi muzike wakanjilidwe muuya mubi walikumupa kusonda. Walikujanina basimalelaakwe mali manji kwiindila mukusonda kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Walikuyoobucilizya Paulu aswibo kayooboongolola kuteeti, “Aaba baalumi mbazike ba Leza Sijulu lya Majulu, baambilizya mbomunga mwafutuka.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Walikucita namu kwama zuba manji. Kono Paulu wakasesemwa okucebukila musule okwaambila muuya mubi kuteeti, “Muzina lya Jesu Kilisitu zwa mulinguwe!” Muuya wakazwa mulinguwe mpoonya-mpoonya. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Basimalelaakwe nibakabona kuteeti musimbi ooyu tacinoobajanini mali, bakajata Paulu o Sailasi okubakwelela kubeendelezi benkuta ankanzo ye taindi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Nibakabeeta kubeendelezi benkuta ye taindi pati bakateeti, “Aaba baalumi Majuda, balimukuyunga taindi lyesu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Balimukwiisya zizo ziteendelani e milawo yesu, swebo to Maloma tatukonzya kuzitambula naanga kuzicita.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Kuzwaawo dwi lya bantu lyakabukila Paulu o Sailasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Mpoonyina beendelezi benkuta bakayawoola zizwato zya Paulu o Sailasi okulailila kuteeti babakwabboole. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Nibakamana kubakwabboola loko bakabasowela muntolongo, mpoonyina bakalailila mulindizi we ntolongo kuteeti abamamele bataloboki. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Naakamana kumvwa malailile aaya, mulindizi wentolongo wakanjizya Paulu o Sailasi mukati mweni yentolongo okubika maulu aabo muzitolokisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zitolokisi alimatanda mapati ape malemu obile aajesi zibbanga mokubikila miindi yomwaange. Matanda aaya obile alimangidwe antoomwi kuzinguluka miindi yomwaange. Mwaange talikukonzya kukweela zituta zyakwe anze ezitolokisi kaambo zibbanga zyateni zyali ziniini loko.</char></note>. <figure style="fig" alt="The apostles in stocks in the prison" file="gt00114.tif" size="col" ref="16:24">Baapositola Muzitolokisi Muntolongo</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Akati kamasiku Paulu o Sailasi bali kukomba okwiimba nyimbo zyokulumbaizya Leza, baange mbibali ambabo kabaswiilizya. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Mpoonyinaawo nyika yakazungaana loko mane entalisyo ye ntolongo yakazungaana. Mpoonya-mpoonya milyango ye ntolongo yakajuka e nsimbi zibaangidwe baange boonse zyakaloka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mulindizi we ntolongo naakabuka okubona milyango ye ntolongo kijukide wakayeeya kuteeti baange bakazwa okucija. Mpoonyina wakasomona sabule munkomo yateni kuteegwa alijaye. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Kono Paulu wakazoongolola ejwi pati kateeti, “Utalijayi! Potuli toonse!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Mulindizi we ntolongo wakakumbila lampi okuzuzila mwateni okuyoolifusila afwiifwi amaulu a Paulu o Sailasi katuntuma. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Mpoonyina wakabatola anze okubuzya kuteeti, “Nobasimalelaangu! Ino ndeelede kucita nzi kuteegwa ndifutulwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Syoma mu Mwami Jesu, mpoonyina ulafutulwa yebo abengʼanda yako.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Mpoonyina bakamukambookela jwi lyo Mwami antoomwi aabo boonse balikukala mungʼanda yakwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Aliilya nako njoonya yamasiku, mulindizi we ntolongo wakababweza okubasanzya zilonda zyabo mpoonya-mpoonya we antoomwi abengʼanda yakwe bakabbabbatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Mpoonyina wakabweza Paulu o Sailasi kungʼanda yakwe okuyoobapa cokulya. We antoomwi abomukwasyi wakwe bakabotelwa kaambo iino bakasyoma muli Leza.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Nibwakaca beendelezi benkuta bakatuma mapokola amajwi okuteeti, “Amubalukulule aabo baalumi bainke.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Mpoonyina mulindizi we ntolongo wakaambila Paulu kuteeti, “Beendelezi benkuta batumizya majwi okuteeti yebo o Sailasi mulukululwe. Iino inga mwazwa okwiinka muluumuno.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Kono Paulu wakateeti kumapokola, “Taakwe nitwakajanwa o mulandu kono bakatukwabboola antangalala okutusowela muntolongo nekuba kuteeti tuli bana Loma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mulawo we Ciloma walikupa cisubulo cipati loko kumwaatuzi uuma muna Loma kaatazekisidwe. Aaba baatuzi balikugwisigwa musebezi wobwaatuzi cokusampoolwa antangalala, cimwi ciindi okujaigwa.</char></note>. Iino bayanda kutulukulula cokusisilikizya. Nee! Abaze mbabo beendelezi benkuta, bazootulukulule.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Mapokola bakaambila beendelezi benkuta makani aaya. Iino nibakamvwa kuteeti Paulu o Sailasi bali bana Loma bakalikalelwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Mpoonyina bakeza okulilekelela kuli Paulu o Sailasi. Kuzwaawo bakabagwisya muntolongo okubakumbila kuteeti bazwe mu taindi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Mpoonyina Paulu o Sailasi bakazwa muntolongo okwiinka kungʼanda ya Lidiya. Okuya bakakuswaanana abasyomi okubaambila majwi okubakulwaizya. Bamane bakainka.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Paulu o Sailasi mutaindi pati lya Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Iino Paulu o Sailasi nibakainda mutaindi lya Amfipolisi omutaindi lya Apoloniya, bakasika kutaindi pati lya Tesalonika, ooko kwali cikombelo ca Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulu wakainka ku Majuda mucikombelo mbuli citambo cakwe. Kwe Nsabata zyo tatwe zicilizyanya walikwaamboozyana abantu <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />kubapandulwida Malembo okubatondezya kuteeti Mesiya walikweelede kupenga okubuka kuzwa kulufu. Paulu wakazumanana okwaamba kuteeti, “Ooyu Jesu ngondaambilizya kulindinywe ngonguwe Mesiya.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Iino bamwi bakamvwida zyaalikwaamba Paulu. Mpoonyina bakacilila Paulu o Sailasi ape kwali ebbunga pati lya Magiliki balikukomba Leza abanakazi bace balikukutekwa ambabo bakamumvwida okucilila.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kono bamwi Majuda bakaba omunyono okubunganya baalumi batakwe ntuso baingaila feela mumigwagwa batajesi zyokucita. Nibakavula, bakalyanganya taindi lyoonse okufumpa ngʼanda yo mwaalumi walikuteegwa Jasoni kabalangoola Paulu o Sailasi kuteegwa babeete kubantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Kono nibakababula bakakuluntila Jasoni abasyomi bamwi kunembo lya beendelezi be taindi okoongolola kuteeti, “Paulu o Sailasi balyanganya nyika yoonse!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibbala “nyika” aawa yaamba bulelo bwa Maloma. Paulu o Sailasi bakaliinkide mwateni mumataindi mapati amwi alimucibeela cobulelo bwa Maloma. Kono bantu bakaambila munkanka mukoongolola kuteeti Paulu o Sailasi bakasika koonse.</char></note> Iino beza kuno kutaindi lyesu. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Kono Jasoni wabatambula mungʼanda yakwe. Boonse babacilila bakazya milawo ya Kaisala Muleli Mupati wa Baloma, kabaamba kuteeti kuluumbi muleli mupati wezina lya Jesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Aaya majwi akeeta kulyangana akati kembunga yabantu a beendelezi be taindi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Mpoonyina beendelezi be taindi bakabbadezya Jasoni abamwi mali alikuyandika ecisyomezyo cokuteeti taciyoocitiki ape, mpoonyina bakabalukulula.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu o Sailasi mutaindi lya Bbeliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Masiku aayo ngoonyina, basyomi bakatuma Paulu o Sailasi kwiinka ku Bbeliya. Nibakasika feela kwateni bakanjila mucikombelo. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Bantu boku Bbeliya bali emizeezo isolonta kwiinda bantu boku Tesalonika, kaambo balikuyandisya loko kuswilizya zyaalikukambooka Paulu, buzuba-obuzuba balikubala Malembo kubona na zyali kwiisya Paulu zye nconzyo. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Kaambo keeci bunji bwabo bakasyoma antoomwi abanakazi abamaalumi be Cigiliki balikukutekwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kono Majuda boku Tesalonika nibakamwva kuteeti Paulu ako ku Bbeliya walikukambooka majwi a Leza bakainka kwateni okuyoobunganya bantu okutalika kulyanganya mabunga. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Mpoonya-mpoonya basyomi bakatola Paulu kunkomwe yo lwizi, kono Sailasi o Timoti bakasyala ku Bbeliya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Aabo bamaalumi bakainka o Paulu, bakamusindikizya mane ku Atenesi. Bakapiluka omulaizyo wokuteeti Timoti o Sailasi bamutandile Paulu kwaakabede cokufwambana.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Mutaindi Pati lya Atenesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulu naalikulindila Sailasi o Timoti mu Atenesi, wakabijilwa loko naakabona taindi mbulyazwide mituni. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul at Athens at a Greek temple" file="cn01995b.tif" size="col" ref="17:16">Paulu Acikombelo ca Magiliki ku Antenesi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Mpoonyina walikwiinkaanga mucikombelo okwaambozyanya a Majuda a Bamasi bali kukomba Leza ape walikwaamboozyanya abantu balikuza mumusika buzuba-obuzuba. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ape abamwi basongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aaba basongo mbantu bayeeyaanga nyika mboibeleka, bulungulizi bo buumi ecipa kuteeti kupona kubeentuso. Bagwasilizya bantu kusala nzila mbobeelede kupona. Bakuteka ziisyo zyabo kwiinda bukombi.</char></note> baitwa kuteeti Baipikuleya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baipikuleya balikwiisya kuteeti kubotelwa ceceelede kuba cintu cipati loko mubuumi.</char></note> abamwi baitwa kuteeti Basitoyiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basitoyikisi balikwiisya kuteeti bantu beelede kwiiya kulijata okupona buumi kakutakwe kulimvwa kubotelwa naanga kulimvwoobi.</char></note> bakakazyanya anguwe. Bamwi bakateeti, “Ino ooyu utakwe ecezi ubbwa nzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Bamwi bakataba kuteeti, “Kuboneka aanga mukamboosi wa baleza mbetutezi.” Bakaamba namu kaambo wali kukambooka Makani Mabotu aa Jesu azyokubuka kwabafu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Mpoonyina bakamwiita okwiinka anguwe ku nkuta ya Alewopagasi, kabateeti kulinguwe, “Tuyanda kumvwisisisya eeci ciisyo cipya. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Zimwi zintu zyoamba kulindiswe zilakomosya, iino tuyanda kuziba zyozyaamba.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Bakamubuzya namu kaambo bana Atenesi abamuzwakule balikukala mwateni balikubelesya nako yabo yoonse kumvwa okwaamba zintu zipya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22-23" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakaima kunembo lya benkuta ya Alewopagasi okutalika kwaamba kuteeti, “Nobana Atenesi, nindali kweenda-enda mu taindi lyenu ndajana kuteeti mulifundumene kukomba kaambo ndakajana zintu zinji zyemubelesya mubukombi bwenu. Ndajana ecipaililo calembedwe kuteeti ‘Kuli Leza Utazizilwe.’ Iino ndiyandoomukambookela Leza ngomukomba naanga kuteeti tamumuzi. <verse eid="ACT 17:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Bami 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Izaya 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Misebezi 7:48</ref>.</char></note> Leza wakapanga nyika ezyoonse zili mwateni ngonguwe Mwami we julu enyika, takali mumaandaa Leza aakapangwa amanzoo muntu, <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />naanga kupegwa mbuli muntu ubulide ape taakwe cayanda kaambo we nguupa buumi, kuyeeka ape ezyoonse kuli boonse. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kuzwida kumuntu omwi wakalenga misyobo yabantu yoonse kuteegwa bakale nyika yoonse, nguwakasala ziindi ezibaka bantu zyobeelede kukala. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Wakacita namu kuteegwa bakamuyandoole mweendi mukwaampaampa balamujana, nekubakuteeti we tainsi kule kuli umwi-oumwi wesu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ede bakateeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Mulinguwe motuponena, motuputila ape motubede.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Mboonyina mbuli mbobaamba bamwi basikweema benu kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Aswibo tuli bana bakwe.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Mbotuli bana ba Leza tutanoyeeyaanga bube bwa Leza buli mbuli ngolide naanga nsiliva naanga bbwe naanga cifwanikiso cakabambwa oluzibo naanga mizezo yabantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Leza wakazilanga feela zintu zibalikucita bantu muciindi cokutaziba, kono iino ulailila kuteeti boonse koonseneni beempwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Wakabika buzuba mbwayoatula bantu munyika yoonse cokululama kwiindila mu muntu ngwaakasala. Wakacitondezya eeci kumuntu woonse kwiindila mukubusya uulya muntu kuzwa kubafu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Iino nibakamwva Paulu kaamboola ankani yokubuka kuzwa kubafu, bamwi bakatalika kumufubaazika kono bamwi bakateeti, “Tuciyanda kuzookumvwa ape kwaamboola aleyi nkani.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakazwa mumuswaangano. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kono bamwi bamaalumi bakamusangana okusyoma, alaaba kwali Diyonisiyasi walikuzulilwa munkuta ya Alewopagasi omwanakazi wezina lya Damalisi abamwi bantu.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Mutaind Pati ya Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Kuzwaawo Paulu wakazwa ku taindi pati lya Atenesi okwiinka ku taindi pati lya Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Kwaakakujana Mujuda uteegwa Akwila, wakazyalilwa ku Pontiyasi. We amwanakazaakwe Pulisila bakazwide aakuzwa ku Itali kaambo Kulodiyasi Kaisala Muleli Mupati waba Loma wakalailila kuteeti Majuda bazwe mu Loma taindi pati lya Itali. Paulu wakainka kuyoobapotela, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />okuyookala okubeleka ambabo kaambo walikubeleka musebezi wokuluka mateente mboonyina mbuli mbabo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Nsabata-ensabata Paulu walikwaamboozyanya a Majuda a Magiliki mucikombelo kusola kuteeti basyome muli Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Iino Sailasi o Timoti nibakasika kuzwa ku Masedoniya Paulu wakaleka musebezi wakwe wokuluka mateente okupa nako yakwe yoonse kukukambooka majwi, kaambila Majuda kuteeti Jesu ngu Mesiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Nibakamukazya okwaamba zintu zibi alinguwe wakatondezya kuteeti tacikwe ntuso ambabo kwiindila mukututula zizwaato zyakwe kateeti, “Mwalijazya nobeni, mebo tandikwe mulandu nee! Kuzwa iino ndiinka kuli Bamasi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakazwa kucikombelo okwiinka ku ngʼanda ya Titiyasi Jusitasi Wamasi wali kukomba Leza. Ngʼanda yakwe yali afwiifwi ecikombelo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Iino umwi mwaalumi wezina lya Kilisipasi mweendelezi wecikombelo, we aboonse bengʼanda yakwe, abamwi bantu banji bomu Kolinto bakamvwa zyalikwaamba Paulu okusyoma mu Mwami okubbabbatizigwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Busiku bumwi Paulu wakabona cilengaano, Mwami mwaakamwaambila kuteeti, “Utayoowi, kono zumanana kukambooka, utaleki, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kaambo ndilaandiwe ape taakwe uyookulwaana okukucisa kaambo ndilaabantu banji mulilino taindi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakakala mu Kolinto mwaaka emyeezi iili cisambomwi kalimukwiisya bantu majwi a Leza.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Kunembo Lyomuleli Galiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Iino Galiyo naakazooba muleli we cooko ca Akaya, Majuda bakeza antoomwi okujata Paulu okumweeta kunembo yomuleli Galiyo kuzoatulwa, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />kabateeti, “Ooyu mwaalumi uyembulula bantu kukomba Leza munzila iteendelani omulawo!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulu uciyanda feela kwaamboola, Galiyo wakaambila Majuda kuteeti, “Nikwali kuteeti ninkani yomulandu naanga kulubizya nindakumvwa kutongooka kwenu, no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Kono kaambo kokuteeti ninkani yokukazyanya amajwi, amazina omulawo wenu feela, nywebo no Majuda amukazibambe nobamukamwini! Tandiyandi kwaatula zili namu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Mpoonyina wakabatandila anze lye nkuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Mpoonyina Majuda bakajata Sositenesi mweendelezi wecikombelo okomuumina kunembo lye cibbula cobwaatuzi. Kono we Galiyo wakazilaanzya feela meenso eezi.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Wapiluka ku Antiyoki yoku Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Myeelwe 6:18</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nizyakainda eezi, Paulu wakakala abasyomi mu Kolinto kwamazuba manji, mpoonyina wakalaizya okubasiya okwiinka ku Kenkiliya antoomwi o Pulisila o Akwila. Okuya wakagezya masusu aakwe kaambo kokukonkezya kuli Leza kwaakacitide. Mpoonyina bakagama ku Siliya omugolo mupati. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Nibakasika mu Efeso Pulisila o Akwila bakakala mwateni. Paulu kaacili mu Efeso wakainka kucikombelo okutalika kwaamboozyanya a Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bantu bakamukumbila kuteeti kaacikede-kede kwamazuba ambabo kono taakwe naakazumina. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Naakayanda kwiinka wakateeti, “Ndiyoopiluka kulindinywe nakuteeti Leza akacizumizye” Amane wakatanta mumugolo okuzwa ku Efeso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Naakakusika ku Siziliya wakainka ku Jelusalemu okuyoolumelesya mbungano mpoonyina wakainka ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Naakakala-kala mu Antiyoki wakazwa okwiinda mucooko ca Galatiya eca Fuligiya kayoobuyumya-yumya basyomi boonse.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolosi Watalika Musebezi Wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Kweeyo nako Mujuda we zina lya Apolosi wakazyalilwa mu Alekizandiliya wakeza mu Efeso. Walizi kwaamboola kabotu ape walooluzibo lwa Malembo. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Walilailidwe munzila yo Mwami, wakakambooka okwiisya kabotu zyenconzyo zya Jesu cokuyandisisya nekuba kuteeti wakezi feela lubbabbatizyo lwa Joni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aaka kampango katondezya kuteeti Apolosi taalizi lubbabbatizyo Jesu ndwaakalailila basikwiiya bakwe kucita (Mateyo 28:19).</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Wakatalika kwiisya obusicamba mucikombelo. Pulisila o Akwila nibakamumvwa bakamutola kumbali okumulungulwida nzila ya Leza kabotu-kabotu. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Kuzwaawo Apolosi wakayeeya kwiinka ku Akaya, mpoonyina basyomi boku Efeso bakamukulwaizya okulembela basyomi boku Akaya kubaambila kuteeti bamutambule. Naakakusika wakabagwasya loko aabo bali basyomi kwiindila muluzyalo lwa Leza. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Apolosi wakabazunda Majuda mukukazyanya kwakwe ambabo kupati antangalala. Wakabapa bumboni kwiindila mu Malembo bokuteeti Jesu ngu Mesiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Wapiluka Ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolosi naali mu Kolinto Paulu wakainda mukati mweni mwecilalaanda mane kuyoosika ku Efeso ooko kwaakakujana bamwi basyomi. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Mpoonyina wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino mwakatambula Muuya Uusalala na nimwakasyoma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Bo bakamutaba kuteeti “Nee, mane taakwe nitwakamvwa okuteeti kuloo Muuya Uusalala.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino ndubbabbatizyo nzi ndumwakabbabbatizigwaalo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Lubbabbatizyo lwa Joni.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mateyo 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Maako 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luka 3:4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Joni 1:26-27</ref>.</char>
    </note> Paulu wakateeti “Joni walikubbabbatizya olubbabbatizyo lokusanduka, kaambila bantu kuteeti basyome muli ooyo uza musule lyakwe, kokuteeti muli Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Nibakamvwa eeci bakabbabbatizigwa muzina lyo Mwami Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakabika maanza aakwe alimbabo, kumane Muuya Uusalala wakabaselukila, mpoonyina bakatalika kwaamboola misyobo imwi okusinsima. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Kwali baalumi batakasike kumi abobile antoomwi.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kuzwawo Paulu wakanjila mucikombelo ca Majuda kwemyeezi yotatwe kaamboola cobusicamba kubantu kuteegwa asole kubakweelela kukusyoma zyo Bwami bwa Leza. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kono bamwi baleelikanyi okukaka kusyoma, okutalika kwaamboola zintu zibi Anzila yo Mwami kunembo lye mbungano. Mpoonyina Paulu wakazwa okubwezelezya basyomi okwiinka mucikolo ca Tilanasi ooko kwaali kwaamboozyanya ambabo buzuba-obuzuba. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Eeci cakatola myaaka yobile mpoonyina boonse bali mucilalaanda ca Eziya Majuda antoomwi a Bamasi bakamvwa jwi lya Mwami.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana Ba Sikeva Baumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Leza walikucita maleele aakomosya kwiindila muli Paulu <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />cokuteeti ntaulu nekuba tusila twakakuma amubili wakwe kuteeti mwatutola kubalwazi, balikupona. Kuli aabo bali emyuuya mibi, myuuya mibi yalikuzwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Iino kwali bamwi Majuda balikweendeenda kutanda myuuya mibi. Bakasola kubelesya zina lyo Mwami Jesu alaabo bajesi madimona kabateeti, “Ndakulailila muzina lya Jesu ooyo Paulu ngwaakambooka, zwaa!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Balikucita namu bali baalumi bali ciloba. Aaba bali bana bo Mupaizi Mupati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuzibwa kwa Sikeva mbuli mupaizi silutwe kutondezya kuteeti walijesi cibbula cobukombi, nekuba kuteeti taakwe cilembedwe citondezya kuteeti kusule ooku kwali mupaizi silutwe we zina eeli. Eeci caamba kuteeti walilibbide zina lye cibbula cobukombi naanga kuteeti walikuzwa kumukwasyi wabapaizi basilutwe watalikuzizilwe loko.</char></note> wa Majuda walikuteegwa Sikeva.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Muuya mubi wakateeti kulimbabo, “Jesu ndilimuzi ape o Paulu ndilimuzi. Ino nwyebo ndinywe bani?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Mpoonyina mwaalumi wakanjidwe madimona wakabasotokela okubazunda okubauma loko boonse cokuteeti bakacija kuzwa mungʼanda kabali ecinkuna ape kabaliciside loko. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Boonse Majuda a Bamasi balikukala mu Efeso bakazimvwa eezi bakayoowa mpoonyina zina lyo Mwami Jesu lyakalumbaizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Bunji bwaabo bakasyoma bakeza kulyaambilila antangalala okutondezya zintu zibi zibalikucita. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Bunji bwaabo balikucita masalamusi bakeeta mabbuku aabo aazyamasalamusi okwaatenta antangalala. Muulo wamabbuku aaya oonse niwakasanganizigwa wakasika ku zyuulu zili makumi osanwe zya mali emiwaya-waya ye nsiliva. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Muleeyi nzila, jwi lyo Mwami lyakazumanana kusabalangana okubeleka cenguzu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lupyopyongano mu Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Nizyakainda eezi Paulu wakayeeya kwiinka ku Jelusalemu kwiinda mucooko ca Masedoniya eca Akaya kateeti, “Ndaakuzwa ku Jelusalemu, ndeelede kuyoinka oku Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Mpoonyina wakatuma baalumi bobile mbaalikubeleka abo, Timoti o Elasitasi kuteeti bainke ku Masedoniya, we wakasyala musule mucooko ca Eziya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Aciindi coonyina eeci kwakaba mapyopyongano mu Efeso kaambo kenzila yo Mwami Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Umwi mwaalumi uteegwa Dimitiliyasi mufuzi we nsiliva walikufula tufwanikisyo twe nsilva twe ngʼanda ya leza wokupanga mwanakazi uteegwa Atemisi ape musebezi ooyu wokufula tufwanikiso ootu walikubeetela mpindu loko, we abasikufula bamwi. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Wakaita basikufulanyina antoomwi abamwi balikucita misebezi iswana eyabo okubaambila kuteeti, “Nobaalumi, mulizi kuteeti ooyu musebezi nguutweetela mpindu nji. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mulibwene okumvwa ooyu mwaalumi Paulu mbwaayunga okusweesya bantu banji kutainsi feela omuno mu Efeso kono ezibaka zinji zyomucooko ca Eziya kaamboola kuteeti ba leza bokupanga amaanza tiinsi ba leza benconzya. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Kuli ntenda kutaamba feela kuteeti musebezi wesu ulasampoolwa kubantu kono okuteeti ngʼanda ya leza mupati Atemisi ilabula ntuso kubantu ape obupati bwakwe bulasinyeka, leza mupati ngobakomba mu Eziya enyika mbwiizulwa!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bantu nibakamvwa eeci bakalutila okutalika koongolola kabateeti, “Atemesi woku Efeso ngomupati!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Mapyopyongano aaya akazula taindi lyoonse, mpoonyina bbunga lyakazuzila kubbuwa lyezisaanino antoomwi okuyookulunta Gayasi o Alisitakasi. Aabo baalumi bali bana Masedoniya balikweenda antoomwi o Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulu walikuyanda kunjila mubbunga kono basyomi bakamukasya. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Mpoonyina bamwi basololi becooko bali beenzinyina bakatuma mulaizyo wokumukombelezya kuteegwa atanjili mwateni. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Anako eeyo muswaangano wacili mumapyopyongano, bantu bamwi balikoongolola cintu cimwi abamwi balikoongolola cimwi kaambo bunji bwa bantu taakwe nibezi ecibakazidilide. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Kwali umwi mwaalumi Mujuda akati kabo wezina lya Alekizanda. Bamwi Majuda bakamutontela kunembo kuteegwa amboole kubantu. Mpoonyina Alekizanda wakanyamuna maanza akwe kuteeti bantu baumune kuteegwa aambe kuteeti tainsi Majuda bakeeta mapyopyongano. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kono bantu nibakamvwa kuteeti Mujuda bakoongololesya loko kabateeti, “Atemesi woku Efeso ngomupati! Atemesi woku Efeso ngomupati!” Bakoongolola namu kwa mawoola obile.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Mpoonyina mulembi wetaindi pati wakabaumuzya okubaambila kuteeti, “Nobana Efeso, ino ngwani utazi kuteeti taindi pati lya Efeso ndelibabalela ngʼanda ya Atemisi mupati ape kokubambwa ebbwe lyalikubonekaanga nguwe lyakawa kuzwa kujulu? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Mbokunga taakwe ukonzya kukazya eezi zintu, amusitikizye zyamba, mutaciti zintu kamutayeeyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ape ndabona kuteeti mweeta aba baalumi bobile nekuba kuteeti taakwe nibakafumpa mumaanda aaba leza naanga kusampoola leza wesu mwanakazi Atemesi. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Nakuteeti Demitiliyasi abafuzi balaanguwe baleetongoosi kujatikizya umwi muntu, nkuta zilijulidwe ape abaatuzi bapati kobali inga baakuzekesyanya okuya. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Nakuli cimbi ciindilila awa ceelede kuyoobambwa mumiswaangano yomulawo. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kuleezi zyacitika sunu, tulimuntenda yokupegwa mulandu wokweeta mapyopyongano, mukuteeti taakwe citamizyo kumapyopyongano aaya. Tatukwe bupanduluzi bubotu bokupa kuleezi zyacitika.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Naakamana kwaamba aya majwi wakamwaisya mbunga yabantu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Wapilukila ku Masedoniya oku Gilisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Mapyopyongano naakamana Paulu wakaita basyomi antoomwi okubapa majwi okuyumya-yumya okubalaizya. Mpoonyina wakanyamuka ookwiinka ku Masedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kacili mu Masedoniya wakayumya-yumya basyomi mumataindi oonse mwaakainda. Mpoonyina wakasika kucooko ca Gilisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awa izina lya “Gilisi” lyaamba cilalaanda ca mataindi omu Gilisi enyika Maloma njibali kwiita kuteeti cooko ca Acaya.</char></note>, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />ooko kwaakakala kwe myeezi yotatwe. Naalikulibambila kwiinka ku Siliya omugolo mupati, wakaziba kuteeti Majuda balikukanza kumujaya, mpoonyina wakayeeya feela kupiluka kwiinda mu Masedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Bakainka o Paulu kwali Sopata mwaana wa Pilasi woku Bbeliya o Alisitakasi o Sekundasi boku Tesalonika, Gayasi woku Delebbe, Tikikasi o Tilofimasi boku cooko ca Eziya o Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Aaba bakainka kunembo okuyootulindila ku Tilosi, <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />kono twakasika ku Filipi. Mpoonyina niwakamana mukiti we cinkwa citakwe mumena, twakeenda omugolo mupati kwamazuba osanwe. Twakaakusangana abamwi mu Tilosi mutwakakala nsunda yomwe.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Wabusya Musyimani kuzwa Kubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mubuzuba bokusaanguna bwe nsunda twakaswaangana antoomwi kulya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki, “kukomoona cinkwa.” Mwendi eeci cilyo cakamana okusekelela Mulalilo wo Mwami. Jesu wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti kabalya eci cilyo ciyandika loko mukumuyeeya okumupa bulemu (Luka 22:14-20).</char></note>. Paulu wakakambookela bantu mane akati kamasiku kaambo kokuteeti walikuyanda kunyamuka buzuba bwali kucilila. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Malampi manji alikuyaka mungʼanda yomujulu oomo mutwaswaangene. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Umwi musyimani wezina lya Yutikasi walikede ampulungwido. Kaambo Paulu wakatola nako ndamfu kwaamboola, Yutikasi wakafwa ngʼonzi okoona amane wakawida ansi kuzwa mungʼanda yatatu mujulu. Nibakamubweza walifwide. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Kono Paulu wakainka ansi okulisowela alinguwe okumukumbata mpoonyina wakateeti, “Mutapengi kaambo uloobuumi!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakapiluka mujulu lye ngʼanda okuyookomona cinkwa okulya. Wakaamboola ambabo kweciindi cilamfu kusikila mane lyaandula zuba, kumane wakainka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Musyimani bakamutola kungʼanda kali muumi ape abantu bakayumisigwa loko.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musinzo wa Paulu kuzwa ku Tilosi Kusika ku Melitasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Iino Paulu wakatwaambilide kuteeti ulainka amaulu ku Asosi. Swebo wakatwaambilide kuteeti twiinke omugolo mupati ku Asosi ooko kwayootusangana mumugolo mupati. Mpoonyina twakacita mbuli mbwaakatulailila, kono we wakeenda amaulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Naakatuswaana mu Asosi, twakamubweza okuza awe kutaindi lya Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Twakeenda omugolo kuzwa kwateni kuyoosika kucibaka cilangene ensumbu ya Kiyosi buzuba bwakacilila. Nikwakainda buzuba bomwi twakainka ku nsumbu ya Samosi, mpoonyina buzuba bwakacilila twakasika ku Melitasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulu wakayeeyede kuteeti aiinde mbali Efeso kuteegwa atasowi nako mucooko ca Eziya, kaambo walikuyanda kusika kufwambaana ku Jelusalemu nakakukonzyeka mubuzuba bwe Pentekositi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi a Paulu Okulaizya Bamaalu boku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kali ku Melitasi Paulu wakatuma mulaizyo ku Efeso wokwiita bamaalu bembungano kuteegwa baswaangane anguwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Nibakasika wakabaambila kuteeti, “Mulizi mbundali kupona nako yoonse nindali andinwe, kuzwa buzuba nindakasika mucooko ca Eziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Ndakacita musebezi wo Mwami mukulicesya, mumisozi omumasunko aakandicitikila kaambo kamakanze aa Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mulizi kuteeti taakwe cindakasiya calikunoomugwasya nindakali kukambooka okumwiisya antangalala omumaanda eenu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ndakabacenjezya Majuda antoomwi a Bamasi kuteegwa beelede kusiya zibi zyabo okusandukila kuli Leza ape okusyoma Mwami wesu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Iino ndeelede kumvwida Muuya wa Leza okwiinka ku Jelusalemu kanditezi ciyoondicitikila. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ndizi feela kuteeti mumataindi oonse Muuya Uusalala wakandicenjezya kuteeti ntolongo amapenzi zilandilindila. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Timooti 4:7</ref>.</char></note> Kono buumi bwangu tabukwe mpindu kulindime. Cintu cipati kumanisya feela musebezi wangu obukamboosi mbwaakandipa Mwami Jesu bwakwaambilizya Makani Mabotu oluzyalo lwa Leza.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Iino ndilizi kuteeti taakwe naanga womwi akati kenu mbindakeendela okukambookela zyo Bwami bwa Leza uyoondibona ape. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Kono buno buzuba ndimwaambila cokusinizya kuteeti na bamwi benu basweeke ciindi cabo, mebo tandikwe mulandu, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />kaambo taakwe cindakamusisila kono ndakamukambookela zyoonse Leza zyayanda. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Amulimamele nobeni ape obutanga boonse oobo Muuya Uusalala mbwaakamupa kuteeti mulange okweembela mbungano ya Leza eyo njakaula egazi lyo Mwanaakwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndilizi kuteeti ndazwa, baumpe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awa bbala “baumpe” yaamba bamayi bobubeji. Awa Paulu wakaamba kuteeti bamayi bobubeji bazooza ku Efesasi okweeta buyumu-yumu kubasyomi kwateni.</char></note> babutambo bazooza akati kenu ape tabakozoobuleka butanga nee. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Naanga akati kenu kuzoozwa bamwi baalumi bayoiisya zibakapilinganya mukusola kukwelela basyomi kulimbabo. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Iino amumamele okuyeeya kuteeti kwemyaaka yotatwe ndalikucenjezyaanga umwi oumwi wenu sikati amasiku emisozi minji.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Iino ndamusiya mumaanza a Leza omumakani ooluzyalo lwakwe, aayo akonzya kumuyaka okumupa lukono akati kaabo Leza mbaakalisalila. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Taakwe nindakanyomenena nsiliva naanga ngolide naanga cizwato comuntu umwi nee. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Nywebo nobeni mulizi kuteeti ndabeleka amaanza angu aya kulijanina zyoonse zyendibula azyebabula beenzuma mbotwakali limwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Kwiindila muleezi zintu zyoonse zyendakacita, ndakamutondezya kuteeti mukubeleka namu tweelede kugwasya aabo batalikonzyezi, netucita namu katuyeeya amajwi ngaakaamba Mwami Jesu lwakwe naakateeti, ‘Kupa kweeta cileleko cipati kwiinda kutambula.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Iino Paulu naakamana kwaamba namu wakafugama okukomba ambabo. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Mpoonyina boonse bakalila loko kabamukumbata okumumyonta mukumulaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Akabapa kuusa loko majwi ngakaamba kuteeti tabaciyomuboni. Mpoonyina bakamusindikila kwiinka kumugolo mupati.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Musinzo wa Paulu Wokwiinka ku Jelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Twakalaizyanya abamaalu katutaboteledwe, mpoonyina twakanjila mumugolo mupati twakalulama kwiinka kunsumbu ya Kosi, buzuba bwakacilila twakainka kunsumbu ya Lodesi kuzwaawo twakainka kutaindi lya Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ooko twakaakujana mugolo mupati walikuzubuka kwiinka ku Fonisiya, mpoonyina twakautanta okwiinka. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Nitwakaakusika acibaka mpitwalikubona nsumbu ya Saipulasi twakainda kumusanza wayo okwiindilila kwiinka ku Siliya. Twakaakwiima acito ca Taila kaambo kwali zyalikuselusigwa kuzwa mumugolo mupati. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Twakayandoola basyomi, nitwakabajana twakakala ambabo nsunda yomwi. Basyomi aaba kwiindila munguzu zyo Muuya wa Leza bakainduluka kunoambila Paulu kuteeti atakasyati gulu ku Jelusalemu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumatalikilo Muuya Uusalala wakaambila Paulu kuteeti ainke ku Jelusalemu (20:22). Ape okumucenjezya Paulu kuteeti bantu bayoomupenzya okumubika muntolongo (20:23). Ape Muuya Uusalala wakaambila abasyomi mu Taila cintu comwi. Kono nibakamvwa namu, bakayeeya kuteeti Paulu atainki kwateni.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Kono nako yokuba ambabo niyakamana twakanyamuka okwiinka. Basyomi boonse, abanakazi babo antoomwi abana bakatusindikila kutugwisya mutaindi mane kuyootusisya kunkomwe yo lwizi kutwakakufugama okukomba antoomwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Twakalaizyanya umwi oumwi mpoonyina twakanjila mumugolo mupati kumane bo bakapiluka kumaandaabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Twakazumanana omusinzo wesu wokuzwa ku Taila okwiinka kutaindi pati lya Pitolemaisi okuya twakaakulumelesya basyomi okukala buzuba bomwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Misebezi 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref>.</char></note> Buzuba bwakacilila twakanyamuka kwiinka ku Siziliya, twakaakusikila kungʼanda ya Filipo muvangeli. Filipo wali umwi waabo bagwasilizi bali ciloba bakasalwa ku Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Walaa bana banakazi balikusinsima bone batakakwetwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Misebezi 11:28</ref>.</char></note> Twakakala mazuba manji mungʼanda ya Filipo mpoonyina kwakasika umwi musinsimi uteegwa Agabbasi kuzwa ku Judiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Wakazoobweza lukanda lwa Paulu okulyanga kumaanza okumaulu kateeti, “Muuya Uusalala waamba kuteeti mukamwini lukanda oolu Majuda bayoomwaanga mboonyina namu ku Jelusalemu ape okumwaaba ku Bamasi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Nitwakamvwa eeci swebo abamwi basyomi bookuno twakatalika kumukumbila Paulu kuteeti atainki ku Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kono we wakateeti, “Niinzi cemucita mwanoolila namu okutyompya moyo wangu? Tamuzi kuteeti ndililibambilide kutali kwaangwa feela kono okufwida zina lyo Mwami Jesu mu Jelusalemu?”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nitwakakacilwa kumukasya, twakaamba feela kuteeti, “Alucitike luyando lwa Leza.” Mpoonyina twakaumuna.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Nitwakakala-kala twakabweza zintu zyesu okutalikizya kwiinka ku Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Bamwi basyomi boku Siziliya bakainka aswebo okututola kungʼanda ya Munasoni kutwalikweelede kukala. Ooyu Munasoni walikuzwa ku Saipulasi, ape wali musyomi kuzwa eciindi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Wapotela Jemusi Mupati Wembungano yoku Jelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Nitwakasika mu Jelusalemu basyomi bakatutambula amaanza obile omoyo omwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Mpoonyina buzuba bwakacilila Paulu antoomwi aswebo twakainka kuyoopotela Jemusi abamaalu boonse bembungano baliwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paulu naakamana kubalumelesya wakabapa bupanduluzi bukwene kutondezya Leza mbwaalikubeleka kwiindila mubukamboosi bwakwe akati ka Bamasi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Nibakamana kumuswilizya bakalumbaizya Leza, mpoonyina bakateeti, “Omuzyalwama, walibonena omukamwini zyuulu-zyuulu zya Majuda bakasyoma ape okulyaaba cokumaninina ku Mulawo wa Mozesi. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Bakaambilwa zitainsi zyenconzyo kuteeti uyiisya Majuda bakala muzisi zya Bamasi kuteeti basiye Mulawo wa Mozesi okubaambila kuteeti batanoopaluli bana babo naanga kucilila zizo zyesu. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ino tulacita buti? Nconzyo kumvwa balamvwa kuteeti wakasika. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Myeelwe 6:13-21</ref>.</char></note> Ceeci cotuyanda kuteeti ucite, okuno kuli baalumi bone bakali konkezya. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Koya ambabo ukalisalazye ape ukababbadelele mali ayandika kuteegwa bakagelwe masusu aabo. Kwacitwa namu bantu boonse baakubona eeci bayooziba kuteeti makani ngibakamvwa alindiwe tainsi anconzyo kono yebo ucilizya Mulawo wa Mozesi. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Misebezi 15:29</ref>.</char></note> Iino kujatikizya nkani ya Bamasi bakasyoma, mbulimbozi, twakabalembela lugwalo mutwakabalailila kuteeti batanolya nyama yakabelesegwa mukukomba mituni na kulya gazi na kulya banyama bakasinwa ape bataciti bumambe kuteeti bakale kabotu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakainka okubabweza okuyoolisalazyaabo buzuba bwakacilila, mpoonyina wakainka mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza okupa cizibisyo ceciindi nibayoomana kulisalazya ecituzyo coumwi oumwi neciyoopegwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Wajatwa Mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Mazuba aliciloba naali afwiifwi okumana, bamwi Majuda bakazwida kucooko ca Eziya nibakamubona Paulu mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza bakayunga bantu boonse okumujata. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Mpoonyina bakoongolola kabateeti, “Nobana Izilaili, amutugwasye! Ooyu mwaalumi nguuli mukwiinka muzibaka zyoonse, wiisya bantu boonse kubukila bana Izilaili, o Mulawo wa Mozesi e Ngʼanda ya Leza. Atala eezi zyoonse, weeta a Bamasi mucibaka celabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza cakabambilwa feela Majuda okusofwaazya eeci cibaka cisalala!” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Misebezi 20:4</ref>.</char></note> Bakaamba namu kaambo bakali mubwene imwi nako Tilofimasi woku Efeso o Paulu mutaindi, mpoonyina bakayeeya kuteeti Paulu wakamunjizya mucibaka celabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza cakabambilidwe Majuda.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Iino taindi pati lyoonse lyakayungwa mpoonyina bantu boonse bakazuzila antoomwi okuyoomujata Paulu okumukuluntila anzee labba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza mpoonya-mpoonya emilyango yoonse yakajalwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Dwi lyabantu nilyali kuyanda kujaya Paulu cizibisyo cakatumwa kumweendelezi mupati waba silumamba be Ciloma kuteeti taindi pati lyoonse lya Jelusalemu lilimumanyongwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Mpoonya-mpoonya mweendelezi mupati wakabwezelezya beendelezi baba silumamba abasilumamba okuzuzila kwali mbunga. Bantu nibakabona mweendelezi mupati aba silumamba bakaleka kumuuma Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mpoonyina mweendelezi mupati wakainka kuli Paulu okumujata okulailila kuteeti bamwaange amaceni obile, mpoonyina wakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino ngwani ooyu mwaalumi ape wacita nzi?” <figure style="fig" alt="Paul with Roman soldiers and his accusers" file="cn02143b.tif" size="col" ref="21:33">Paulu a Basilumamba beci Loma a Basikumutamikizya</figure> <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Bamwi mumbunga bakaamba cimwi abamwi bakaamba cimwi. Mweendelezi mupati wakakacilwa kuziba cakacitika kaambo kamanyongwe mapati. Mpoonyina wakalailila kuteeti batole Paulu kukala basilumamba. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Nibakasika amatantilee ngʼanda basilumamba bakamutemba Paulu kumukwabilila kaambo kokubbebba kwe mbunga. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Boonse balikuyoobumucilila, kaboongolola kuteeti, “Amumujaye! Amumujaye!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Waliiminina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Basilumamba nibali kuyanda kumunjizya mubalikukala, Paulu wakakumbila mweendelezi mupati kateeti, “Ndikumbila kwaamboola ayebo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Wakakomokwa okumubuzya kuteeti “Ino ulicizi Cigiliki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ndalikuyeeya kuteeti ndiwe uulya muna Ijipiti wakabusya lupyopyongano kusule oku okusololeda zyuulu zyone zye zigebenga munkanda. Tainsi ndiwe na?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulu wakataba kuteeti, “Nee, ndili Mujuda muna Tasisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciindi eco, baantu bace feela bakazyalilwa naanga balikukala mutaindi pati mbali bomwateni. Nakuteeti ube womwateni weelede kuba enyika mwateni naanga kupegwa nguzu zyokuba womwateni abasololi betaindi pati naanga kuzyalwa abomwateni. Kuba womwateni cilikupa kukutekwa loko kumuntu ooyo.</char></note>, taindi pati likutekwa mu Silisiya. Ndikumbila kuteeti ndaamboole abantu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mpoonyina mweendelezi mupati wakamuzumizya. Kuzwaawo Paulu wakaima amatantilee ngʼanda okunyamuna janza kuteegwa bantu baumune. Nibakaumuna wakaamboola ambabo mu Cijuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki, “mu Cihibbulu.” Aawa caamba kuteeti muci Alamaiki. Aciindi eci Alamaiki nguwali musyobo Majuda ngubali kuzyalwawo. Ciindi loko kaitana sika nako eeyi, cisi ca Alamu cakazunda cibeela cokunyika ya Izilaili. Mbokunga bantu becisi ca Alamu balikwaamboola ci Alamaiki, mwendi Majuda taakwe nibakayanda kubelesya zina eelyo nekuba kuteeti aawa balikwaamboola musyobo ooyo.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Nobakwesu amatata, amundiswiilizye mbondiliiminina kunembo lyenu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Nibakamumvwa Paulu kaamboola mu Cijuda boonse bakaumuna zii! Mpoonyina Paulu wakazumanana.<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Misebezi 5:34-39</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Ndili Mujuda wakazyalilwa mutaindi pati lya Tasisi mucooko ca Silisiya kono ndakakomenena omuno mu Jelusalemu. Ndali sikwiiya wa Gamaliyo, ndakaiisigwa kabotu-kabotu Mulawo wabasikale besu ape ndakalipa kuli Leza mbuli ndinywe mbomulipede noonse nomulaawa sunu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Misebezi 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref>.</char></note> Ndakapenzya okujazya bantu bakali kucilila Nzila yo Mwami Jesu, ndakaanga baalumi abanakazi okubasowela muntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mupaizi Mupati abe Nkutanyina boonse inga bazumina amebo kuteeti zyendilimukwaamba zyenconzyo. Ndakatambula magwalo kuzwa kuli mbabo aakalembelwa bazyalwama bomu Damasikasi aalikundizumizya kuyaanga bantu aaba mumaceni okubeeta ku Jelusalemu kuno kuteegwa bazoopegwe cisubulo. Mpoonyina ndakanyamuka kwiinka ku Damasikasi.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Wapandulula Mbwaakasanduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Misebezi 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Nindalimumusinzo afwiifwi okusika ku Damasikasi musikati, kwaka mweka mumuni kuzwa kujulu okundimunika. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Mpoonyina ndakawida ansi okumvwa jwi kaliteeti kulindime, ‘Saulu! Saulu! Ino undipenzezya nzi?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Mpoonyina ndakabuzya kuteeti, ‘Ino ndiweni, o Mwami?’ Mpoonyina we wakanditaba kuteeti ‘Ndime Jesu woku Nazaleta, ngopenzya.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Iino bamaalumi mbindali ambabo bakuubona mumuni kono jwi lyooyo wali kundaamboozya taakwe nibakalimvwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ndakabuzya kuteeti, ‘Ino ndicite buti o Mwami?’ Mpoonyina wakataba kuteeti, ‘Nyamuka wiinke ku Damasikasi, okuya uyoambilwa cayanda Leza kuteeti umucitile.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ndakoofwaala kaambo komumuni wakandimunika, mpoonyina aabo mbindalaabo bakandijata kujanza okunditola ku Damasikasi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Omuya mutaindi kwali mwaalumi wezina lya Ananiyasi wakalikapede kweendelena o Mulawo wa Leza. Walikulemekwa loko aba Majuda balikukala mwateni. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Wakeza okwiima afwiifwi andime okwaamba kuteeti, ‘Omuzyalwama Saulu, kobona ape!’ Mpoonyaawo ndakatalika kubona ape ndakabona Ananiyasi kaimvwi. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Mpoonyina wakandaambila kuteeti, ‘Leza wabasikale besu wakusala kuteegwa uzibe luyando lwakwe okubona Mululami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eeci caamba Jesu. Muciindi ca Jesu, Mululami lyali zina Majuda ndibali kubelesya kwaamba cibbula ca Mesiya. </char></note> wakwe okumumvwa kaamboola ejwi lyakwe, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />kaambo uyooba kamboni wakwe kubantu boonse kuli zyoonse ziwabona okumvwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Ino ulindila nzi? Nyamuka ubbabbatizigwe kuteegwa zibi zyako zisanzigwe kwiindila mukukomba.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwiito lwa Paulu kuteegwa Akambookele Bamasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Kuzwaawo, ndakapilukila ku Jelusalemu. Iino nindalikukomba mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza ndakabona cilengaano. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ndakabona Mwami wangu kandaambila kuteeti, ‘Fwambaana, zwa mu Jelusalemu kaambo bantu boomuno tabakoobutambula bukamboni bwako kujatikizya ndime.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Mpoonyina ndakamutaba kuteeti, ‘Mwami wangu, balizi kabotu-kabotu kuteeti ndalikwiinkaanga mucikombelo ecikombelo kuyaanga okuuma bantu balikusyoma mulindiwe. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Misebezi 7:58</ref>.</char></note> Ape kamboni wako Sitivini naakajaigwa ndakaliimvwi ambali ape ndakazumizya kujaigwa kwakwe okubamba zizwaato zyabasikumujaya.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Mpoonyina Mwami wangu wakandaambila kuteeti, ‘Koya, ndiyookutuma kule kuli Bamasi.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Bantu bakaswilila Paulu zyaalikwaamba kusikila waamba namu, mpoonyina bakatalika koongoolola atala amajwi aabo kabateeti, “Mutamuleki, amumujaye! Teelede kupona!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bali koongolola kumwi kabasowaila zizwato zyabo ansi okufusaila muse mujulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mpoonyina mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba be Ciloma wakalailila basilumamba kuteeti bamupilusye kukala basilumamba ape bavuntoozye mulandu wakwe kwiinda mukumuuma entatula kuteegwa mweendelezi mupati azibe mbunga ciyalikumoongolweda namu Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Kono nibakamwaangilila maanza kucisamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basilumamba bakalibambila kuuma Paulu. Bakamunyamuzya maanza kukumbate cisamu. Balikulibambila kwaanga maanzaakwe kucisamu.</char></note> kuteegwa bamuume, Paulu wakaambila umwi mweendelezi wabasilumamba wali afwiifwi kuteeti, “Ino cilimumulawo kulindinwe kuuma muna Loma watakazekesegwa kabotu okujanwa omulandu na?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Mpoonyina Mweendelezi wabasilumamba naakamvwa namu, wakainkila mweendelezi wabasilumamba mupati okumucenjezya kuteeti, “Ino niinzi comuyanda kucita? Ooyu mwaalumi muna Loma!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Mpoonyina mweendelezi wabasilumamba mupati wakainka kuli Paulu okumubuzya kuteeti, “Ndaambile, uli muna Loma na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulu wakamutaba kuteeti “Iyi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mpoonyina mweendelezi wabasilumamba mupati wakaamba kuteeti, “Mebo ndakaba namu kwiindila mukubbadela mulwi-wa mali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Kono we Paulu wakateeti, “Mebo ndili muna Loma kukuzyalwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Mpoonyinaawo bamaalumi balikuyanda kubuzya Paulu mibuzyo bakapiluka musule. Awe mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba be Ciloma wakayoowa naakaziba kuteeti ngwaakaanzya wali muna Loma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Kunembo lye Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba wakayandisisya kuziba ceni-ceni Majuda cibali kutamizya Paulu. Mpoonyina buzuba bwakacilila, wakalaila kuteeti Paulu alukululwe okuteeti bapaizi basilutwe abenkunta boonse baswaangane o Paulu. Mpoonyina wakabweza Paulu okumwiimika kunembo lyabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulu wakabalangisisya Benkuta Mpati ya Majuda okuteeti, “Nobazyalwama! Sizumboozyi mumoyo wangu obuumi mbundapona kuli Leza kusika sunu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Mpoonyina Mupaizi Mupati wezina lya Ananiyasi wakalailila bali afwiifwi o Paulu kuteeti baume Paulu kumulomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27-28">Mateyo 23:27-28</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Paulu wakateeti, “Yebo oosikuupaupa amenso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Kuupaupa amenso” aawa maambilambali okuteeti “bwaanda bwalambwa kutuba” mu Cigiliki. </char></note>, Leza ulakuuma ayibo! Ukede aawo kundaatula kweelana o Mulawo kono ndiwenya utyola Mulawo kwiindila mukwaambila bantu kuteeti banduume!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Aabo bali afwiifwi o Paulu bakateeti, “Yebo! Utukila Mupaizi Mupati wa Leza.”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kulonga 22:28</ref>.</char>
    </note> Paulu wakataba kuteeti, “Nobazyalwama, tindalizi kuteeti Mupaizi Mupati. Malembo aamba kuteeti, ‘Utaambooli zibi amusololi wa bantu bako.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Misebezi 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Bafilipi 3:5</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iino Paulu naakabona kuteeti mu Nkuta Mpati eeyi bamwi bali ba Saduki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basaduki kali kabunga ka Majuda kalikucilizya kabotu-kabotu Mulawo wakalembwa o Mozesi kono taakwe nikali kusyoma mukubuka kwabafu, omubangelo naanga mumyuuya, cicali kubaindanya kutubunga tumwi twa Majuda tuli mbuli Mafalisi. Balikusyoma kuteeti mabbuku osanwe okusaanguna Mucizuminano Ceciindi ngemajwi feela aa Leza enconzyo. Balivubide ape balibayumu kutunzanyu.</char></note> bamwi bali Bafalisi wakoongolola kateeti, “Nobazyalwama, ndili Mufalisi, mwanaa Bafalisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mafalisi kali kabunga ka Majuda kalikusyoma kuteeti Bbaibbo ye Cihibbulu yoonse (Cizuminano cesu Ceciindi) nga majwi aa Leza. Balikusyoma kuteeti kucilizya Mulawo wa Leza cintu cipati loko. Balikuyungizizya emilawo imbi otunsiyansiya kuteegwa bantu kabatakonzezyi limwi kutyola Mulawo wa Leza.</char></note>. Ndiimvwi aano okwaatulwa kaambo kobulangizi bokubuka kuzwa kubafu!”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Naakaamba feela namu, Mafalisi aba Saduki bakatalika kukazyana. Mpoonyina Nkuta yakaanzana, <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mateyo 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Maako 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luka 20:27</ref>.</char></note>kaambo Basaduki tabazumini kuteeti bantu bayoobuka kuzwa kubafu ape tabasyomi kuteeti kuli bangelo na muuya, kono bo Mafalisi balasyoma muli eezi zyotatwe zyoonse. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kuyoba kwakaindilizya mpoonyina bamwi bamayi bo Mulawo balikuzulilwa kukabunga ka Mafalisi bakaima okukazya loko kabateeti, “Taakwe cibi citwajana mumwaalumi ooyu. Ino na kuteeti muuya na mungelo wamwaamboozya?”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Kukazyanya nikwakakomena, mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba wakazooyoowa kuteeti bantu inga bamukwamoona muzipanzi panzi Paulu. Mpoonyina wakaambila basilumamba kuteeti bainke mubantu oomo okumubweza Paulu kuteegwa bamutole ooko kukala basilumamba.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Aayo masiku ngoonyina, Mwami wakeza okwiima afwiifwi o Paulu okuteeti, “Utayoowi! Mboonyina mbuwapa bumboni alindime mu Jelusalemu, oku Loma weelede kuyoocita mboonyina namu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanze Ookujaya Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Nibwakaca bamwi Majuda bakaswaangana okukanza kujaya Paulu. Bakakonkezya kuteeti tabakoolya naanga kunywa aati bamujaye Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Bakayeeya kucita namu balikwiinda makumi one. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Mpoonyina bakainka kubapaizi basilutwe abamaalu okuteeti, “Swebo twakonkezya kuteeti tatukoolya na kunywa cintu mane Paulu tumujaye. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Iino nywebo abe Nkutanyoko, amutume majwi ku mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba ba Maloma, mucite mbuli kuteeti kulizyemuyanda kumvwisisisya zijatikizya Paulu. Tulilibambilide kumujaya katana sika afwiifwi ecibaka cino.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Kono mujwa wa Paulu wakaamvwa makanze aaya mpoonyina wakainka kukala basilumamba okuyaambila Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakaita umwi wa beendelezi babasilumamba okumwaambila kuteeti, “Mutole ooyu musyimani kumweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba, kuli zyajesi zyayanda kwaamba.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mpoonyina ooyu mweendelezi wabasilumamba wakamutola kumweendelezi mupati okuteeti, “Sintolongo Paulu walindiitide okundikumbila kuteeti ndeete ooyu musyimani kulindiwe kaambo kulizyajesi zyayanda kukwaambila.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba wakamujata kujanza okumukwelela ambali kubakakuba bobile feela okuteeti kulinguwe, “Ino niinzi coyanda kundaambila?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Wakateeti, “Beendelezi Majuda bamvwana kuteeti junza bazookukumbile kuteeti uzootole Paulu ku Benkuta Mpati mbulikuteeti kuli zyebayanda kuzibisisya amakani akwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Utakazizumini eezi zintu kaambo kuli baalumi bainda makumi one bayuba kulindila kuteeti bamujaye. Bakakonkezya kuteeti tabakoolya naanga kunywa cintu kusikila mane bamujaye Paulu. Iino balilibambilide, balindila feela muzeezo wako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mpoonyina mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba wakaambila ooyu musyimani kuteeti, “Eeyi nkani utaambili umbi nee.” Mpoonyina wakamuleka kuteegwa ainke.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Watolwa ku Muleli Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Mpoonyina mupati wabasilumamba wakaita beendelezi babasilumamba bobile okubaambila kuteeti, “Amubambe basilumamba bali myanda yobile, bainke ku Sizeliya antoomwi abasimbizi bali makumi aliciloba ape aba simasumo bali myanda yobile. Mulibambile kunyamuka sunu masiku awoola lyafuka. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mumubambile mbizi anguwe Paulu kuteegwa atolwe kabotu kumuleli Felikisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Felekisi wali mweendelezi wecooko ca Judiya kutalikila mu 52 kusikila mu 60 AD (myaka kuzwa Mwami naakazyalwa). Walimuzike womukwasyi wo Muleli Mupati we Loma, mpoonyina wakazoolukululwa. Mubweendelezi bwakwe wazizilwe kubija moyo ku Majuda basikulwanina lwaanguluko.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Mpoonyina mupati wabasilumamba wakalemba lugwalo luteeti,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Ndime Kolodiyasi Lisiyasi, ndilembela ndinwe nomulemekwa, nobaleli ba Felikisi. Ndamulumelisya. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Ooyu mwaalumi Majuda bakamujata, kwasyeede aniini kuteeti bamujaye. Iino nindakaziba kuteeti muna Loma, ndakainka abasilumamba kuyoomuvuna. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Mukuyandisisya kuziba mulandu ngubakamupa ooyu muntu, ndakamutola ku Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ndakaakujana kuteeti ooyu muntu taakwe mulandu wokuteeti mane ajayigwe na kusowelwa muntolongo, balikumutamizya mumibuzyo kujatikizya emilawo yabo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Nindakazoambilwa kuteeti kuli makanze ookumujaya, cokufwambaana ndakamutuma kulindinwe okwaambila basikumutamizya kuteeti baze bazoomwaambile zyebatamizya Paulu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Mpoonyina basilumamba kweelana ambobakalaililwa, bakabweza Paulu okumutola kutaindi pati lya Antipatilisi amasiku. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Buzuba bwakacilila basilumamba baansi bakapiluka kubalikukala, mpoonyina basimbizi bakazumanana o Paulu <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />okumutola ku Sizaliya, kubakaakupa muleli lugwalo okusiya Paulu mumaanzaakwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Muleli wakalubala lugwalo okubuzya Paulu kuteeti, “Ino uzwa kucooko nzi?” Paulu wakataba kuteeti, “Ndizwa ku Silisiya.” <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Muleli wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Ndizoumvwa mulandu wako basikukutamizya bazooza.” Mpoonyina wakalailila kuteeti bamumamele okumubika mungʼanda yobwami njakasiya mwami Helodi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Watamizigwa Kunembo lyo Muleli Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Nikwakainda mazuba osanwe, Ananiyasi Mupaizi Mupati wakainka ku Sizeliya antoomwi abamwi bamaalu osimulawo umwi wezina lya Teetulusi. Bakalibonya ku muleli Felikisi kulungulula makani eemilandu ya Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulu naakeetwa mukati, Teetulusi wakatalika kumutamizya. Wakateeti kumuleli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Nomulemekwa! Busololi bwenu mbobusongo bwakatweetela nako ndamfu yoluumuno ape zintu zinji zibotu zilacitwa mukusumpula okweeta bubotu mucisi cesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Eeci twacitambula nako yoonse kuli koonse ape twamulumba loko. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Tandiyandi kumusowela nako yenu ndikumbila kuteeti mutumvwide luzyalo okubuswilizya bulunguluzi bwesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Twajana kuteeti ooyu mwaalumi cigebenga cibi loko, weeta mapyopyonganyo akati ka Majuda nyika yoonse mboizulwa ape musololi wakabunga kabantu bacilila ziisyo zyoulya mwaalumi woku Nazaleta. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ape wakasola kusofwaazya Ngʼanda ya Leza, [mpoonyina twakamujata okuyanda kumwaatula kweendelana omulawo wesu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembo akazida musule alijesi kancali 6b kusikila kukancali ka 8a.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Kono mupati wabasilumamba Lisiyasi wakeza cobukali loko okuzoomubweza kuzwa kulindiswe. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Wakalailila basikumutamizya kuteeti baze kunembo lyenu.] Mwamubuzya ooyu mwaalumi nywebo nobamukamwini mulakonzya kuziba kuteeti eezi zyotumwaambila kujatikizya nguwe zyenconzyo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Mpoonyina basololi ba Majuda bakamusangana Teetulusi mukwaamba kuteeti twaambo ootu twenconzyo.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Waliiminina Kunembo lyo Muleli Felekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Muleli wakatondeka Paulu kuteeti aamboole, mpoonyina Paulu wakateeti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Ndilizi kuteeti ulimubetesi mupati wo mucisi ecino kwemyaka minji cecico eeco cendiboteledwe kuliiminina kunembo lyako. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Mbuli mbokonzya kuziba omwini kuteeti kwiindide feela mazuba aataindi kukumi aobile kandiinkide ku Jelusalemu kuyookomba. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Majuda taakwe nibakandijana kandikazyanya omuntu uliwoonse naanga kuyunga mbunga mulabba lye ngʼanda ya Leza naanga muzikombelo naanga kuli koonse mutaindi pati. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Tabakonzyi kutondezya bumboni mbobajesi kuli eezyo zyebakanditamikizya. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ndilazumina kulindiwe kuteeti ndikomba Leza waba sikale besu kwiinda mukucilizya Nzila yo Mwami Jesu eeyo njibateeti tainsi yenconzyo. Ape ndisyoma mulizyoonse ezyo zilembedwe mu Mulawo wa Mozesi omumabbuku aabasinsimi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ndilijesi kulangila muli Leza mbuli mbubajesi boonse aaba bantu kuteeti kuyooba kubuka kwa baluleme abataluleme kuzwa kubafu <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />cecico eeco cendifundumana kucita zibotu nako yoonse kuteegwa ndibe omoyo uululeme kuli Leza okubantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Misebezi 21:17-28</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Iino nikwakainda myaaka minji kanditawo mu Jelusalemu ndakeza kweeta zipego kubantu bangu bapengede ape okupa zituuzyo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Ndalimanide kale kulisalazya nibakandijana mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza kandipa zituuzyo. Tikwalikwe mbunga ya bantu naanga manyongwe aakacitika. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Kono kwali bamwi Majuda bazwa kucooko coku Eziya bakaliwo, beelede kuteeti kabaliwo aawa kunembo lyako kupa kaambo kabo kulindiwe alizyondakacita, <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />naanga aaba baalumi balaawa, abaambe mulandu ngubakandijanina nindakaima kunembo lye Nkuta Mpati ya Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Misebezi 23:6</ref>.</char></note> Kuli cintu comwi feela cindakoongolola kukwaamba nindakaima kuneembo lyabo, ‘Ndilimukuzekisigwa kunembo lyako sunu kaambo kokusyoma kuteeti bafu bayoobuka kuzwa kulufu.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Mpoonyina Felekisi walaaluzibo a makani Eenzila yo Mwami Jesu kabotu-kabotu wakuujala muswaangano ooyu kateeti, “Mweendelezi mupati wabasilumamba Lisiyasi aakuza ndizooziba cokucita ankani yako.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Mpoonyina wakalailila mweendelezi wabasilumamba kuteeti amamele Paulu, kono amupe kwateni lwaanguluko aniini okuzumizya beenzinyina kumweetela lugwasyo.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Wabonana o Felikisi o Dulusila Mwanakazaa Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Nikwakainda mazuba maniini Felekisi wakeza o mwaanakazi wakwe Dulusila wakali Mujuda okutuma mulaizyo wokwiita Paulu okuzoomumvwa kaamboola zyo lusomo muli Kilisitu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Iino Paulu naalikwaamba zyobululami okulijata ape obwaatuzi buyoobuza, Felikisi wakayoowa mpoonyina wakaambila Paulu kuteeti, “Kweino nako koya, ndizookwiita ape ndaakuba enako.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Muciindi coonyina eeco ape Felekisi walikulangila okuteeti mweendi inga wapegwa mali kuli Paulu, kaambo keeci Felekisi walikumwiita-iita Paulu kuzoamboola anguwe.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Niyakainda myaaka yobile Posiyasi Fesitasi nguwakabweza cibbula ca Felekisi cobuleli. Iino Felekisi mukuyanda kuteeti abotezye Majuda wakasiya Paulu muntolongo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Watola Kaambo Kakwe kuli Kaisala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Iino nikwakainda mazuba otatwe Fesitasi katalikide musebezi wakwe wobuleli mucooko, wakazwa ku Sizeliya okwiinka ku Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Mpoonyina bapaizi basilutwe abasololi ba Majuda bakamuzida okweeta milandu njibalikutamizya Paulu okukumbila Fesitusi kuteeti <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />abacitile cimwi cintu cokubabotezya, kwiindila mukulailila basilumamba kuteeti beete Paulu ku Jelusalemu kaambo balaamakanze okumujaya munzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kono Fesitasi wakabataba kuteeti, “Paulu ulimuntolongo ku Sizeliya, mane aawa ndiyoobupiluka kwateni ceenaawa. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Amuleke basololi benu bainke amebo ku Sizeliya kuteegwa bakeete twaambo twabo kujatikizya nguwe nakuteeti mwaalumi ooyu kulicibi caakacita.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesitasi wakakala ambabo mu Jelusalemu kwamazuba ali lusele na kumi mpoonyina wakapiluka ku Sizaliya abasololi. Buzuba bwakacilila wakakala acibbula cobwaatuzi munkuta okulailila kuteeti Paulu bamweete. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulu naakasika, Majuda bakazwida ku Jelusalemu bakamuzinguluka okutalika kumutamizya milandu mipati njibatalikukonzya kutondezya kuteeti na yali yenconzyo. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakaliiminina kateeti, “Taakwe cibi cindakacita kujatikizya Mulawo we Cijuda naanga Ngʼanda ya Leza naanga Kaisala Muleli Mupati waba Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Kono mukuyanda kubotelezya Majuda, Fesitasi wakabuzya Paulu kuteeti, “Ino inga wayanda kwiinka ku Jelusalemu kuteegwa ndikakuzekesye kumilandu eeyi na?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulu wakateeti, “Ndiimvwi munkuta yobubetesi bwa Kaisala Muleli waba Loma oomo mondeelede kuzekesigwa. Taakwe cindakabisizya Majuda mbuli mbomuzi kabotu-kabotu. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Nakuli cindakacita ceelede kuteeti ndijaigwe, tandiciji kufwa, kono nakuteeti zyebali mukunditamizya tainsi zyenconzyo, taakwe ukonzya kundaaba mumaanza aaba bantu kubabotezya. Iino ndakatola kaambo kangu kuli Kaisala.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Mpoonyina Fesitasi naakamana kwaamboozyanya abalailili bakwe, wakataba Paulu kuteeti, “Mbuli mbuwakatola kaambo kako kuli Kaisala, kokuteeti uyooinka kuli Kaisala.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Kunembo lyo Mwami Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Imwi nako mwami Agilipa o mucizaakwe Bbenisi bakeza mu Sizeliya kuzoopotela Fesitasi okuyoomulumelisya kaambo wali muleli mupya. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nibacili mu Sizeliya kwamazuba manji, Fesitasi wakalungululwida Mwami kaambo koonse ka Paulu kuteegwa amvwe mizeezo yo Mwami kateeti, “Muleli Felekisi wakasiya umwi mwaalumi muntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Nindakainka ku Jelusalemu bapaizi basilutwe abamaalu bakaakumutamizya milandu minji okundikumbila kuteeti ooyu muntu ndimujane omulandu. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Iino ndakabataba kuteeti taciinsi cilengwa cesu to Maloma kwaaba muntu aati kuteeti wapegwa nako yokuliiminina kunembo lyaba sikumutamizya. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Nibakasika ku Sizeliya taakwe nindakasowa nako kono buzuba bwakacilila ndakakala acibbula cobwaatuzi okulailila kuteeti Paulu eetwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Basikumutamizya nibakaima, bakamutamizya zintu zinji kono taakwe nibakamutamizya zintu zindakali kuyeeyela kuteeti inga bamutamizya. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Bajesi feela kukazyana abukombi bwabo ape aamwaalumi uteegwa Jesu wakafwa, ooyo we Paulu ngwaali kuteeti ulapona. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ndakajana buyumu-yumu kujana luzibo amakani aaya. Mpoonyina ndakabuzya Paulu kuteeti na inga wayanda kwiinka ku Jelusalemu kuteegwa bakaakumuzekesezye kwateni amakani aya. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kono Paulu wakakumbila kuteeti abambwe kuli basilumamba kusikila mane Kaisala akakalange kaambo kakwe. Mpoonyina ndakalailila kuteeti, kacibambidwe kusikila mane ndizomutumizye kuli Kaisala.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Mwami Agilipa wakateeti, “Ndiyanda kumumvwa lwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Mpoonyina Fesitasi wakataba kuteeti, “Uzoomumvwa junza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Buzuba bwakacilila Agilipa o Bbenisi bakasika mubulemu bupati okunjila mungʼanda mpati yokubunganina abolupati-pati babasilumamba abeendelezi betaindi pati. Kumane Fesitasi wakalailila kuteeti Paulu bamweete. Mpoonyina Paulu bakamweeta. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesitasi wakateeti, “O mwami Agilipa anywebo noonse nomulaano, mwamubona ooyu mwaalumi, Majuda boonse muno mu Sizeliya oku Jelusalemu ngoba jesilidi matongoosi. Boongololaanga kuteeti teelede kuteeti kacipona. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Kono ndakajana kuteeti ooyu muntu taakwe caakacita kuteeti ajaigwe. Iino mbokunga kaambo kakwe wakakatola kuli Kaisala, ndakayeeya kuteeti atolwe kulinguwe ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Kono mebo tandijesi ceni-ceni cokulembela mwami wangu zijatikizya Paulu cindateeti ndimweete kulindiwe o mwami Agilipa, wamana kuvuntoozya mumulandu ooyu mwendi ndilabaa ecokulemba, <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />kaambo citondezya kubula maano kutuma mwaange kotalembede mulandu ngwajesi.” <figure style="fig" alt="Agripa and Festus question Paul" file="cn02036b.tif" size="col" ref="25:27">Agilipa o Fesitasi Bazekesya Paulu</figure><verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Waliiminina Kunembo lyo Mwami Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agilipa wakaambila Paulu kuteeti, “Ulizumizidwe kulyaambilila omwini.” Mpoonyina Paulu wakatandabika janza lyakwe okutalika kuliiminina, kateeti,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“O mwami Agilipa! Ndalimvwa kubeecoolwe kuliiminina ndemwini kunembo lyako sunu kuleezyo zyebanditamizya Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ndalimvwa kubeecolwe loko kaambo ulizizi kabotu-kabotu zizo otwaambo toonse tobatazuminani Majuda. Kono ndakumbila kuteeti undiswiilizisye.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Boonse Majuda balizi mbuli mbundakapona buumi bwangu kuzwa kubukubusi. Balizi mbuli mbundakabupona, kutalikila mucisi cangu mpoonyina omu Jelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Misebezi 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Bafilipi 3:5</ref>.</char></note> Balindizi kweciindi cilamfu ape nakuteeti kabayanda inga bazumina kwaamba kuteeti ndakapona kandili umwi wakabunga ka Bafalisi, kabunga kacilizya loko zizo zyobukombi bwesu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Iino ndilimukuzekisigwa aano kaambo kokulangila kwangu mucisyomezyo Leza caakapa basikaale besu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Eeci cisyomezyo misyobo yesu iili kumi eyobile ciilangila kuzootambula yanoobelekela Leza cokulyaaba masiku esikati. Iino kaambo kokulangila ooku o mwami, cendilimukutamizigwa aawa a Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ino niinzi nemutakonzyi kusyoma kuteeti Leza inga wabusya bafwide?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Misebezi 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Mebo lwangu ndalikusyoma kuteeti ndeelede kucita zyoonse zyendikonzya kulwaanisya zina lya Jesu woku Nazaleta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Zezizyo zindakacita mu Jelusalemu. Ndakatola basyomi banji muntolongo kwiindila munguzu zindakatambula ku Bapaizi Basilutwe. Ape amebo ndakazuminana abasololi ba Majuda kuteegwa basyomi bajaigwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Ziindi zinji ndakapa zisubulo muzikombelo zyoonse okusola kubasungilizya kukaka lusyomo ndobakajesi. Ndali babbebbelide cokuteeti ndalikwiinkaanga mumasi amwi okuyoobapenzya.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Waamba Zyokusanduka Kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Misebezi 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Kekaambo aako kakanditola ku Damasikasi munguzu omumalailile aabapaizi basilutwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Nindalikuyoobweenda munzila sikati o mwami, ndakabona mumuni kuuselemuka kuzwa kujulu. Walikumwekesya loko kwiinda zuba okundizunguluka koonse-koonse aabo mbindalikweenda ambabo. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Toonse twakawida ansi, mpoonyina ndakamvwa jwi kalyaamboola mu Cijuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki, “mu Cihibbulu.” Aawa caamba kuteeti muci Alamaiki. Aciindi eci Alamaiki nguwali musyobo Majuda ngubali kuzyalwawo. Ciindi loko kaitana sika nako eeyi, cisi ca Alamu cakazunda cibeela cokunyika ya Izilaili. Mbokunga bantu becisi ca Alamu balikwaamboola ci Alamaiki, mwendi Majuda taakwe nibakayanda kubelesya zina eelyo nekuba kuteeti aawa balikwaamboola musyobo ooyo.</char></note> kuteeti, ‘Saulu, Saulu! Ino undipenzezya nzi? Ulalicisa feela omwini kuteeti kouma ciconsyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Ulalicisa feela omwini na kouma ciconsyo” Aka kaambyo kaamba kuteeti Saulu zyalikucita walikulicisa, mbuli munyama ulicisa kwiindila mukubbakela kasamu kamutondezya nzila.</char></note>.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Mpoonyina ndakataba kuteeti, ‘Ino ndiweni O Mwami?’ Mpoonyina Mwami wakataba kuteeti, ‘Ndime Jesu ngopenzya.<figure style="fig" alt="Oxen guided by goad" file="lb00020b.tif" size="col" ref="26:15">Mapulu Eendelezegwa e Ciconsyo</figure> <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Kono nyamuka! Ndalibonya kulindiwe kuteegwa ndikusalile limwi kuba mubelesi wangu okuba kamboni wezintu ziwabona ape omuzintu mondizoolitondezezya kulindiwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ndiyookuvuna kubantu bako bana Izilaili a Bamasi boonse ooko kondiyookutuma. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Weelede kubajula menso aabo kuteegwa ubasandule kubagwisya mumudima okubeeta mumumuni ape okubagwisya kunguzu zya Saatani okubeeta kuli Leza. Mpoonyina zibi zyabo ziyoolekelelwa okutambula caabilo akati kaabo bakasalazigwa kwiindila mukusyoma ndime.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Walungulula Musebezi Wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“O mwami Agilipa, ndakacilila cilengaano cindakabona kuzwa kujulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Misebezi 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:28-29">28-29</ref>.</char></note> Ndakatalikila kukambookela bantu bomu Damasikasi mpoonyina bomu Jelusalemu ape abomu cisi coonse ca Izilaili oku Bamasi, kuteegwa basanduke kuzwa kuzibi zyabo okuza kuli Leza okucita zintu zitondezya kuteeti basanduka nconzyo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Cecico eeci Majuda cibakandijatila kandili mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza ape okusola kundijaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kono kusika obuno buzuba, ndilimukugwasigwa o Leza, cecico eeco cindaimina aano kuteeti ndipe bumboni kuli boonse, bantu feela abolupati-pati. Eezi zyendaamba, cintu comwi azibakaamba basinsimi o Mozesi kuteeti ziyoocitika. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Bakolinto 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Izaya 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>.</char></note> Bakateeti Mesiya weelede kupenga okuba wokusaanguna kubuka kuzwa kubafu, kuteegwa aambilizye mumuni wolufutuko ku Majuda okuli Bamasi boonse.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulu naalikuliiminina muleyi nzila, Fesitasi wakoongolola okuteeti, “Ulisondokede Paulu! Kwiiya kwako kupati kwaandokusondola!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakataba kuteeti, “Tandisondokede oolemekwa Fesitasi! Kono ndaamboola feela zyenconzyo ape zyamaano. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />O mwami Agilipa, inga ndakonzya kwaamboola obusicamba, kaambo ulizizi eezi zintu. Ndisyoma kuteeti eezi zintu taakwe nizyakacitika kotezi kaambo taakwe nizyakacitikila musisikide, kono zyakacitika antangalala. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />O mwami Agilipa, ino ulasyoma mubasinsimi na? Ndilizi kuteeti ulasyoma!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Mpoonyina Agilipa wakateeti kuli Paulu, “Ubonaanga mukaindi kaniini aaka inga wandisandula kuba muna Kilisitu?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakataba kuteeti, “Nekuba mukaindi kaniini naanga muciindi cilamfu, kukomba kwangu kuli Leza kwakuteeti yebo aaba boonse bandiswiilizya sunu mube mbuli ndime kono kakutakwe maceeni.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Mpoonyina mwami omweendelezi o Bbenisi antoomwi abamwi bakanyamuka okwiinka. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Mpoonyina nibalikuyoobuya, bakatalika kwaamboozyanya muli cabo kabateeti, “Ooyu mwaalumi taakwe caacita cokuteeti inga wajailwa nekuba kubikwa muntolongo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Ape Agilipa wakaambila Fesitasi kuteeti, “Ooyu mwaalumi nalukulwidwe kale naatakayanda kwiinka kuyaatulwa kuli Kaisala.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Mumusinzo woku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Iino nibakayeeya kuteeti twiinke ku Itali omugolo mupati, Paulu abaange bamwi bakabikwa mumaanzaa mweendelezi wabasilumamba walikuteegwa Juliyasi. Wakali mweendelezi wenkamu yabasilumamba be Loma yalikwiitwa kuteeti, “Basilumamba bo Muleli Mupati.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Twakatanta mumugolo mupati wali woku Adilamitiyamu, ooyo walikuyanda kuyoinda muzito ziindene-indene zili mucooko ca Eziya. Twakuutalikizya musinzo waamaanzi antoomwi o Alisitakasi muna Masedoniya walikuzwa kutaindi pati lya Tesalonika. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Buzuba bwakacilila twakasika mu Sidoni. Mweendelezi wabasilumamba Juliyasi waloo moyo mubotu kuli Paulu, wakamuzumizya kupotela beenzinyina kuteegwa bakamupe zyaalikuyanda. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Twakazumanana omusinzo wesu. Iino kaambo keguwo lyalikubbubbula kutugama, twakainda kunyika lye nsumbu ya Saipulasi yakatukwabilila kuguwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Twakazubuka lwizi lupati lubambene ecooko ca Silisiya eca Pamfiliya mane twaakusika kutaindi pati lya Maila mucooko ca Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ookuya, mweendelezi wabasilumamba wakatujanina mugolo mupati woku Alekizandiliya, ooyo walikwiinka ku Itali okututansika mwateni.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Twakatola mazuba manji kuyobweenda aniini-aniini mubuyumu-yumu mane twakasika kumbali etaindi lya Sinidasi. Iino kaambo keguwo lyacili kubbubbula kaligama ndiswe twakakacilwa kuzumanana. Mpoonyina twakaselelela mumbali lye nsumbu ya Kiliti yakatucingilizya kuguwo, twakainda kumbali enkomwe ya Salimoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Twakainda kumbali enkomwe ya Kiliti mubuyumu-yumu mane twaakusika kucibaka calikwiitwa kuteeti Zito Zibotu. Eeci cibaka calaafwiifwi etaindi lya Lusiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Mbokunga twakasowa nako ndamfu kwateni kusikila mane kwatalika kuyoosya kweendaa maanzi kaambo nako yempeyo yalaafwiifwi, enako yokuliimya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eeci caamba Buzuba bwa Majuda Bokumanizya Zibi (kubukulusya cilongwe o Leza). Bwali buzuba bokuliimya, kukomba okupaila. Bwali buzuba ape mbuzuba bumwi bwamazuba mapati aasalala aa Majuda. Bwalikucitika kumamanino omweezi Wavwivwi naanga kumatalikilo o mweezi wa Kavumbi Kaniini. Muleeci cibaka cenyika, kweenda omugolo aleeyi nako yomwaka kwalikuyoosya kaambo ziindi zinji kwalikukonzya kuza guwo lyalikukonzya kupanga mayuwe mapati aalikukonzya kusinya migolo mipati.</char></note> yaliindide, Paulu wakabacenjezya kuteeti, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Nobaalumi, ndabona kuteeti musinzo wesu uyoobaa ntenda ape kuyooba kusweekelwa kupati kwezintu omugolo antoomwi amaumi eesu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Kono mweendelezi wabasilumamba wakamvwida zyaakaamba sikweendelezya mugolo omwini womugolo kutaamba zyakaamba Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Iino kaambo cito eeci ticaliinsi kabotu kukalila mugolo nako yempeyo eguwo, bunji bwabo bakayanda kuteeti bazumanane kusola kusika ku Fonikisi okukala kwateni nako yempeyo nicalikukonzeka. Fonikisi cito comu Kiliti calangide kumbo lyo kumusaanza okumbo lyo kunyika.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guwo Pati Alwizi Lupati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Luuwo luniini nilwakatalika kuunga kuzwida kumusaanza, basikweenzya mugolo mupati bakayeeya kuteeti inga bacita zibali kuyanda. Mpoonyina zibulo zikasya mugolo kweenda bakazikwelela mumugolo okutalika kweendela afwiifwi loko e nkomwe ya Kiliti.<figure style="fig" alt="Ship in storm" file="wa03994b.tif" size="col" ref="27:13">Mugolo Mupati Muguwo Pati</figure> <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kono kweciindi ciniini feela, guwo pati loko liteegwa kunyika yokujwe lyakatalika kubbubbula kuzwa kunsumbu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Lyakatontaika mugolo mupati cokuteeti ticalikukonzeka kuulanzya kuzwa guwo, mpoonyina twakauleka feela kuteeti kuuyobucilizya guwo kolibbubbwida. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Twakacingilizigwa kuguwo nitwakainda kumusaanza woku ka nsumbu kaniini kateegwa Kauda, ooko mubuyumu-yumu twakakonzya kukwelela kagolo kaangwaanga kusule lyo mugolo mupati okukatansika. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Bakazingaila mugolo mupati amantambo kuteegwa mugolo udiye. Beenzya mugolo bakayoowa kuteeti inga twaakupatila mumuseenga wedaka walaafwiifwi enkomwe ya Silutisi yali kunyika ya Afulika. Mpoonyina bakawisizya cintu mumaanzi cikasya mugolo kweenda kufwambaana. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Buzuba bwakacilila, beenzya mugolo mupati bakatalika kufusa zibya zyali mumugolo mumaanzi kaambo keguwo pati lyakazumanana kutubbubwida ce ntenda. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ape buzuba bwakacilila bakafusila mumaanzi zibelesyo zyomugolo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwamazuba manji taakwe nitwalikulibona zuba na nyenyeezi. Guwo pati lyakazumanana kutubbubwida loko cokuteeti bulangizi bokufutulwa bwakamana.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Mbokunga bantu balikukacilwa kulya kweciindi cilamfwu, Paulu wakaima kunembo lyabo okuteeti, “Nobaalumi, mwalikweelede kundimvwa aalya nindakaamba kuteeti tutazwi ku Kileti. Ooku koonse kusweekelwa okusinyekelwa kwacitika nikwatatucitikila. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Kono ndimukumbila kuteeti mutabilaili kaambo taakwe utifwe akati kenu aati feela mugolo mupati nguutisinyeke. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ndaamba namu kaambo masiku mungelo wa Leza wangu ngondikomba walizide kulindime <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />okundaambila kuteeti, ‘Utayoowi Paulu! Weelede kuyoozekesegwa kuli Kaisala. Nconzyo Leza muluzyalo lwakwe kulindiwe wafutula maumi abantu boonse mboyoobweenda ambabo.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Iino nobaalumi amukazike myoyo kaambo ndilasyoma muli Leza kuteeti kuyooba mboonyina mbuli mbundaambilwa, <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />kono tulatontelwa kukansumbu.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Mubusiku bwe kumi a one, akati kamasiku katuyoobweenzegwa eguwo akati ko lwizi lupati lwa Adiliyatiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eeli lyali zina lyeci Loma lyo lwizi lupati luli kujwe lya Itali luzumanana kusikila akati ku Lwizi Lupati lwa Mediteleniya. Lwizi lupati luzungulukide Malita, sunu lwiitwa kuteeti Lwizi Lupati lwa Mediteleniya.</char></note>, balikweenzya mugolo bakabonaanga twalikuyoobuswenena anyika. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bakatalika kupima bulamfu bwamaanzi. Bakalosya ntambo ijesi cilemu cokupimya maanzi okujana kuteeti zyali ntaamu zili makumi otatwe ecisambowe kwiinka ansi. Ape nitwakendeenda, bakacita mboonyina namu okujana kuteeti zyali ntaamu zili makumi obile eciloba. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Mukuyoowa kuteeti mugolo ulagaila mumabwe, bakalosya zyokujatisya mugolo zyone kusule lyomugolo okukomba kuteeti buce. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Balikweenzya mugolo mupati balikuyanda kuloboka, bakaselusya kagolo okukalosezya mumaanzi okucitaanga bayanda kulosya zyokujatisya mugolo mupati kunembo lyomugolo. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Kono Paulu wakaambila mweendelezi wabasilumamba abasilumamba kateeti, “Aati basikweenzya mugolo, bakale mumugolo mupati tamukoofutuka.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Mpoonyina basilumamba bakatimbula ntambo zyalikujesi kagolo okukaleka kuteeti kakunkulike.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Mujunzo-onza, Paulu wakakumbila bantu kuteegwa balye kateeti, “Mwalindila kuteeti mubone zitacitike kwensunda zyobile kamutalyi naanga comwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Iino ndamukumbila, amulye kuteegwa mube enguzu. Taakwe naanga omwi akati kenu utisweekelwe susu mumutwe wakwe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Naakamana kwaamba namu, wakabweza cinkwa okucikomona kabamulangilizya okulumba Mwami okutalika kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Boonse bakayumisigwa okulya cilyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Toonse antoomwi nitwali mumugolo mupati twali myaanda yobile amakumi aali ciloba ecisambomwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Nibakalya okukuta boonse, bakabweza maila asyeede okwasowela mulwizi lupati kuteegwa mugolo mupati wuube.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusinyeka ko Mugolo Mupati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Nibwakaca basikweenzya mugolo mupati bakabona nyika kono taakwe nibakiiziba eeyi nee. Iino bakabona cibaka eco lwizi lupati mpolubaanga luzwida aanze cijesi seese ape mpocijesi maanzi mafwiifwi. Mpoonyina bakayeeya kuteeti na inga cakonzyeka mugolo mupati bautole kwateni okuwiimika. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Mpoonyina bakatimbula zijatisyo zyo mugolo mupati okuzisiya mu lwizi lupati. Aciindi conya eeco bakaangununa ntambo zyakaangide mapulanga ookunyonesya mugolo mupati. Mpoonyina bakaangununa sila lyokunembo lyo mugolo mupati kuteegwa guwo likonzye kuutontela kunembo, mpoonyina twakalulama kwiinka ku nkomwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kono mugolo mupati wakaakuma mumuse kaambo maanzi alimafwiifwi. Mpoonyina wakapatila kunembo cokuteeti tiwalikukonzya kuswena. Kusule wakatalika kukwamooka kaambo ka mayuwe aaleenguzu loko.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Iino basilumamba bakakanza kujaya boonse baange kuteegwa batadwayi kwiinka kunkomwe okuloboka. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Kono mweendelezi wabasilumamba walikuyanda kuteeti afutule Paulu, wakabakasya kucita namu. Mpoonyina wakalailila kuteeti aabo bakonzya kudwaya basaangune kusotokela mumaanzi kuzwa mumugolo okudwaila kunkomwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Basyaala beelede kucilila kabajesilidi kumapulanga naanga kuzibeela zimwi zyo mugolo mupati zyakakwamokede. Oobu mbombubo toonse mbutwakazubukila kunkomwe okufutuka. <figure style="fig" alt="Paulu and other passengers in a shipwreck" file="gt00117.tif" size="col" ref="27:44">Paulu a Bamwi Muntenda yo Mugolo Mupati</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Abeenzinyina Munsumbu ya Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Nitwakaakusika ankomwe kabotu-kabotu, pepawo nitwakaziba kuteeti tuli ansumbu ya Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bantu bookuya bali kabotu loko, bakatutambula kabotu cokuteeti mane bakatukutwida mulilo ngutwakatalika kuyota kaambo kwali kutontola okuwa mvula. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Mpoonyina Paulu wakatalika kubwezelela nkuni okuzibika amulilo kono kaambo kokupya muya munkuni zyaakabika amulilo Paulu, kwakazwa cipile okumulamatila kujanza okumuluma. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Bantu booko nibakabona nzoka kailengelela kujanza lyakwe, bakaamboozyanya kabateeti, “Taakwe okuzumboozya, ooyu mwaalumi mujayi. Nekuba kuteeti wafutuka kuzwa mulwizi kono leza wesu wecanakazi uuteegwa Bululami takomuleka kuteeti apone.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Kono Paulu wakiisansila mumulilo nzoka mpoonyina taakwe naakacisigwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Bantu balikulindila kuteeti azimbe naanga kuwa okufwa mpoonya-mpoonya. Kono nibakabona kuteeti kwainda nako ndamfu kakutakwe cibi cicitika, bakasandula mizeezo yabo okwaamba kuteeti, “Ooyu ngu leza!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Kweenda-enda feela aniini kuzwaawo putwali kuyotela mulilo, yalimyuunda ya Pabbuliyasi ooyo wakali ngomupati wensumbu eeyo. Wakatutamba kuyoopota kungʼanda yakwe. Twakaba beenzu bakwe kwamazuba otatwe ape wakatubamba kabotu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Iino baisi Pabbuliyasi balilede mubulo, balikuciswa kupiya mubili akalowa-lowa. Mpoonyina Paulu wakanjila mungʼanda mubakalede okubakombela okubabika maanza akwe mpoonyina wakabaponya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Iino eeci nicakacitka, bantu baansumbu boonse balikuciswa bakeza mpoonyina bakaponesegwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Mpoonyina bakatutondezya likute munzila zinji. Kumane nitwalikulibambila kwiinka omugolo, bantu bakatupa zyoonse zyalikuyandika mumusinzo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzwa Kunsumbu ya Melita Kwiinka ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Iino nikwakainda myeezi yotatwe twakanyamuka omugolo mupati woku Alekizandiliya, walikujesi cifwaninikiso caba leza bamayanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bali ba Kasita o Polakisi. Balikuyeeyelwa kuteeti mbana basyima bamayanga ba leza walikwiita kuteeti Zeyasi omwanakazi walikwiitwa kuteeti Leda. Bamwi bantu balikusyoma kuteeti Kasita o Polakisi balima leza lwabo beni ape balikugwasya beenzya migolo. Mpoonyina mukamwini wooyu mugolo mupati wakabeza cifwanikisyo naanga citondezyo caaba bazyalwanyina kunembo lyomugolo mupati wakwe kuteegwa kabaukwabilila.</char></note> kunembo. Mugolo mupati ooyu wakakede munsumbu eeyi nako yempeyo yoonse. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Twakasika mutaindi pati lya Silakuse okukala mwateni kwamazuba otatwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kuzwa ooko twakazumanana mane twakaakusika mutandi pati lya Legiyamu. Buzuba bwakacilila guwo lyakabbubbula kuzwa kumusanza, mpoonyina mubuzuba bwabili twakeza ku taindi lya Puteyoli, kuwakamanina musinzo wesu womumaanzi. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Twakaakujana kwateni basyomi aabo bakatutamba kuteeti tukale ambabo kwensunda yomwe, mpoonyina twakazumanana amaulu kwiinka ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Basyomi bomu Loma nibakamvwa kuteeti tuyoobuza, bakeza kutaindi liitwa kuteeti Misika yoku Apiyasi eimwi iteegwa Maanda Ookulida Otatwe kuzootucingoozya. Paulu naakababona wakalumba Leza mpoonyina wakakulwaizigwa loko.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu mu Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nitwakasika mu Loma, Paulu wakazumizigwa kulikalila kono kalindililwa osilumamba.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Nikwakainda mazuba otatwe, Paulu wakaita basololi ba Majuda bomu Loma kuteeti baswaangane. Nibakaswaagana wakabaambila kuteeti, “Nobazyalwama, nekuteegwa taakwe cindakababisizya bantu besu naanga kucizo cakatusiila basikale besu, Majuda bakandijata mu Jelusalemu okundaaba mumaanza aaba Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Nibakamana kundibuzya-buzya, Maloma balikuyanda kundilukulula kaambo bakajana kuteeti taakwe cindakalubizizye cokuteeti mane inga bandijaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Misebezi 25:11</ref>.</char></note> Kono Majuda nibakakazya, cakandisungilizya kukumbila kuteeti ndizoozekesegwe kuli Kaisala nekuba kuteeti taakwe cindakabatamizya bantu besu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Cecico eeco cindamwiitila kuteeti twaamboole. Nconzyo ndilimumaceeni namu kaambo kooyo bana Izilaili ngobalangila.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bakaambila Paulu kuteeti, “Taakwe lugwalo ndutwakatambula kuzwa ku Judiya lujatikizya ndiwe ape taakwe bantu besu bakazwa kwateni bakatwaambila makani mabi aajatikizya ndiwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kono inga twayanda kuteeti tumvwe mboyeeya yebo kaambo tulizi kuteeti koonse feela bantu baamba zibi akabunga aaka kozulilwa.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bakapanga buzuba bokuteeti bazooswaangane antoomwi. Mpoonyina bantu bakeza mubunji ooko kucibaka Paulu kwaali kukala. Kuzwa kuseeni kusikila masiku Paulu wakabalungulwida zintu zinji okupa bumboni bo Bwami bwa Leza. Wakasola kubacita kuteeti bazumine muli Jesu kwiinda mumulawo wa Mozesi amalembo aabasinsimi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bamwi bakazulwa okuzumina zyaakaamba, kono bamwi bakakaka kusyoma. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Mpoonyina bakazwa kabateendelene mulicabo, Paulu naakamana kwaamba eeci cintu comwi kateeti, “Ano Muuya Uusalala wakaamba kabotu kuli basikale benu kwiindila mumusinsimi Izaya, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Izaya 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note> naakateeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Koya kubantu aaba ukabaambile kuteeti, kuswiilizya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">munooswiilizya kono tamunoomvwisisisyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">ape kulanga munoolanga kono tamunooboni,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />kaambo myoyo yaaba bantu miyumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ape matwi aabo bakaasinka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">amenso aabo bakaajala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kambe menso aabo alikubona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">amatwi aabo alikumvwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ape emyoyo yabo yalikumvwisisisyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">nibakonzya kusandukila kulindime mpoonyina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nindabaponya.’”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Ape Paulu wakamanisya kateeti, “Mweelede kuziba kuteeti oolu lufutuko luzwa kuli Leza lwatumwa okuli Bamasi. Mpoonyina bayoolutambula.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Paulu naakamana kwaamba eeci, Majuda bakazwa kabayoobukazyanya yacinkalu-nkalu muli cabo.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi mabbuku alijesi kancali ka 29.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwemyaaka yobile, Paulu wakakala mungʼanda njaalikulibbadelela ape walikutambula bantu boonse balikumupotela. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Wakakambooka zyo Bwami bwa Leza okwiisya zyo Mwami Jesu Kilisitu, kaamboola obusicamba cokwaanguluka.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>